msgid "GS1 barcode usage"
msgstr "Uporaba črtne kode GS1"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:10
msgid ""
"GS1 barcodes provide a standardized format that barcode scanners can "
"interpret. They encode information in a :ref:`specific structure recognized "
"globally <barcode/operations/gs1>`, allowing scanners to understand and "
"process supply chain data consistently."
msgstr ""
"Črtne kode GS1 zagotavljajo standardizirano obliko, ki jo lahko berejo "
"optični čitalniki črtnih kod. Informacije kodirajo v :ref:`specifično "
"strukturo, ki je prepoznana globalno <barcode/operations/gs1>`, kar optičnim "
"čitalnikom omogoča dosledno razumevanje in obdelavo podatkov dobavne verige."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:14
msgid ""
"Odoo *Barcode* interprets and prints GS1 barcodes, automating product "
"identification and tracking in warehouse operations such as receiving, "
"picking, and shipping."
msgstr ""
"Odoo *Črtna koda* interpretira in tiska črtne kode GS1, s čimer avtomatizira "
"identifikacijo izdelkov in sledenje pri skladiščnih operacijah, kot so "
"sprejem, nabiranje in odpošiljanje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:17
msgid ""
"The following sections contain examples of how Odoo uses GS1 barcodes "
"provided by the business to identify common warehouse items and automate "
"certain warehouse workflows."
msgstr ""
"Naslednji razdelki vsebujejo primere, kako Odoo uporablja črtne kode GS1, ki "
"jih zagotovi podjetje, za identifikacijo običajnih skladiščnih artiklov in "
"avtomatizacijo določenih skladiščnih procesov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:21
msgid ""
"Odoo **does not** create GS1 barcodes. Businesses must purchase a unique "
"Global Trade Item Number (GTIN) from GS1. Then, they can combine their "
"existing GS1 barcodes with product and supply chain information (also "
"provided by GS1) to create barcodes in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **ne** ustvarja črtnih kod GS1. Podjetja morajo kupiti edinstveno "
"mednarodno številko trgovskega artikla (GTIN) pri GS1. Nato lahko svoje "
"obstoječe črtne kode GS1 kombinirajo z informacijami o izdelkih in dobavni "
"verigi (ki jih prav tako zagotavlja GS1) za ustvarjanje črtnih kod v Odooju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:26
msgid "`Purchase GTINs <https://www.gs1.org/standards/get-barcodes>`_"
msgstr "`Nakup GTIN <https://www.gs1.org/standards/get-barcodes>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:27
msgid ":ref:`GS1 nomenclature <barcode/operations/gs1>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Nomenklatura GS1 <barcode/operations/gs1>`"

