#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/operations_valuation.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Learn how receipts, deliveries, manufacturing, returns, and other inventory "
"operations affect stock valuation under the FIFO and AVCO costing methods."
msgstr ""
"Spoznajte, kako prevzemi, dobave, proizvodnja, vračila in druge operacije "
"zaloge vplivajo na vrednotenje zalog pri metodah vrednotenja FIFO in AVCO."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/operations_valuation.rst:10
msgid "Valuation of stock movements and inventory operations"
msgstr "Vrednotenje premikov zaloge in skladiščnih operacij"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/operations_valuation.rst:12
msgid ""
"The **Inventory** app maintains a real-time valuation of stock based on the "
"physical movement of goods. Every time an operation moves goods in or out of "
"the company's stock, the value that came in or went out is recorded on "
"the :ref:`stock movement <inventory/operations_valuation/stock-movements>`, "
"and the product's :ref:`unit cost and total value <inventory/"
"operations_valuation/stock-movement-reported-values>` are recalculated."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija **Zaloga** vzdržuje sprotno vrednotenje zalog na podlagi "
"fizičnega gibanja blaga. Vsakič, ko operacija premakne blago v zalogo "
"podjetja ali iz nje, se prejeta ali izdana vrednost zabeleži na "
":ref:`premiku zaloge <inventory/operations_valuation/stock-movements>`, "
":ref:`cena na enoto in skupna vrednost <inventory/operations_valuation/stock-"
"movement-reported-values>` izdelka pa se ponovno preračunata."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/operations_valuation.rst:19
msgid ""
"This article covers inventory operations that affect the stock valuation "
"reported in the **Inventory** app under the |AVCO| or |FIFO| costing "
"methods, which are set per product category. Products using the *Standard "
"Price* costing method behave differently, since their unit cost is set "
"manually and is never recalculated by an operation."
msgstr ""
"Ta članek obravnava operacije zaloge, ki vplivajo na vrednotenje zalog, "
"prikazano v aplikaciji **Zaloga** po metodi vrednotenja |AVCO| ali |FIFO|, "
"določeni za posamezno kategorijo izdelkov. Izdelki, ki uporabljajo metodo "
"vrednotenja *Standard Price*, se obnašajo drugače, saj je njihova cena na "
"enoto nastavljena ročno in se z operacijo nikoli ne preračuna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/operations_valuation.rst:24
msgid ""
"These operations change product valuation in the **Inventory** app "
"immediately, whether or not the corresponding accounting entry exists yet. "
"The difference between the **Inventory** and **Accounting** app valuations "
"is reported as :ref:`stock variation <accounting/inventory-valuation/"
"inventory-valuation-report>` in the **Accounting** app."
msgstr ""
"Te operacije takoj spremenijo vrednotenje izdelka v aplikaciji **Zaloga**, "
"ne glede na to, ali ustrezna računovodska vknjižba že obstaja. Razlika med "
"vrednotenjem v aplikaciji **Zaloga** in aplikaciji **Računovodstvo** se "
"izkazuje kot :ref:`sprememba vrednosti zalog <accounting/inventory-valuation/"
"inventory-valuation-report>` v aplikaciji **Računovodstvo**."

