msgid ""
":doc:`configure/package`: A physical container used to group products "
"together, regardless of whether they are the same or different."
msgstr ""
":doc:`configure/package`: fizični vsebnik, uporabljen za skupinsko "
"združevanje izdelkov, ne glede na to, ali so enaki ali različni."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:22
msgid ""
