"obrazcu posameznega izdelka. To je zato, ker so pakiranja specifična za "
"izdelek, ne splošna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:15
msgid ""
"Packaging can be used in conjunction with Odoo :doc:`Barcode <../../../"
"barcode/setup/software>`. When receiving products from suppliers, scanning "
"the packaging barcode automatically adds the number of units in the "
"packaging to the internal count of the product."
msgstr ""
"Pakiranje se lahko uporablja v kombinaciji z Odoo :doc:`Barcode <../../../"
"barcode/setup/software>`. Pri prejemu izdelkov od dobaviteljev skeniranje "
"črtne kode pakiranja samodejno doda število enot v pakiranju k interni "
"količini izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:22
msgid ""
"To use packagings, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`. Then, under the :guilabel:`Products` heading, "
"enable the :guilabel:`Units of Measure & Packagings` feature, and "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite uporabiti pakiranje, pojdite na :menuselection:`aplikacija Zaloga "
"--> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve`. Nato pod naslovom :guilabel:`Izdelki` "
"omogočite funkcijo :guilabel:`Enote mere in pakiranje` ter "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:26
msgid "Enable packagings by selecting Units of Measure & Packagings."
msgstr "Omogočite pakiranje z izbiro Enote mere in pakiranje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:32
msgid "Create packaging"
msgstr "Ustvarjanje pakiranja"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:34
msgid ""
"Packagings can be created directly on the product form, or from "
"the :guilabel:`Units & Packagings` page."
msgstr ""
"Pakiranje je mogoče ustvariti neposredno na obrazcu izdelka ali s "
"strani :guilabel:`Enote in pakiranje`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:38
msgid "From product form"
msgstr "Iz obrazca izdelka"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:40
msgid ""
"Create packagings on a product form by going to :menuselection:`Inventory "
"app --> Products --> Products`, and select the desired product."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarite pakiranja na obrazcu izdelka tako, da greste "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Zaloga --> Izdelki --> Izdelki` in izberete "
"želeni izdelek."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:43
msgid ""
"To specify a sales packaging, open the *Sales* tab, then "
"specify :guilabel:`Packagings` in the :guilabel:`Upsell & Cross-Sell` "
"section. Specify existing packagings or create new ones by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Create and edit`. When :guilabel:`Create and edit` is "
"clicked, a *Create Packagings* window opens, where information about the "
"packaging can be specified:"
msgstr ""
"Za določitev prodajnega pakiranja odprite zavihek *Prodaja*, nato določite "
":guilabel:`Pakiranja` v razdelku :guilabel:`Dodatna prodaja & navzkrižna "
"prodaja`. Določite obstoječa pakiranja ali ustvarite nova s klikom na "
":guilabel:`Ustvari in uredi`. Ko kliknete :guilabel:`Ustvari in uredi`, se "
"odpre okno *Ustvari pakiranja*, kjer lahko določite podatke o pakiranju:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:48
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unit Name` (required): Specify the name of the packaging that "
"appears on sales/purchase orders as a packaging option for the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Ime enote` (obvezno): Navedite ime pakiranja, ki se prikaže v "
"prodajnih/nabavnih naročilih kot možnost pakiranja za izdelek."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:50
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Quantity` (required): Specify the amount of product in the "
"packaging."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Količina` (obvezno): Določite količino izdelka v embalaži."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:51
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reference Unit` (required): Define the measurement unit for "
"quantifying the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Referenčna enota` (obvezno): Določite mersko enoto za "
"kvantifikacijo izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Package Type`: Specify the package type used to set custom "
"dimensions and limits. See :ref:`package type <inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"package-type>` to learn more."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tip embalaže`: Določite tip embalaže, ki se uporablja za "
"nastavitev dimenzij in omejitev po meri. Za več informacij glejte :ref:`tip "
"embalaže <inventory/warehouses_storage/package-type>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:54
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Barcodes`: Enter an identifier for tracing packaging in stock "
"moves or pickings using the :ref:`Barcode app <barcode/operations/intro>`. "
"Leave blank if not in use."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Črtne kode`: Vnesite identifikator za sledenje embalaži pri "
"premikih zalog ali komisioniranju z uporabo :ref:`aplikacije Črtna koda "
"<barcode/operations/intro>`. Pustite prazno, če ni v uporabi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:57
msgid "Create a new packaging in the Create Packagings box."
msgstr "Ustvarite novo pakiranje v polju Ustvari pakiranje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:60
msgid ""
"To update barcodes for all defined packagings of a product, click "
"the :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Barcodes` link under "
"the :guilabel:`Packagings` field. The *Packaging Barcodes* page opens."
msgstr ""
"Če želite posodobiti črtne kode za vso definirano embalažo izdelka, kliknite "
"povezavo :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Črtne kode` pod poljem "
":guilabel:`Embalaža`. Odpre se stran *Črtne kode embalaže*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:64
msgid "The following fields are available on the *Packaging Barcodes* page:"
msgstr "Na strani *Črtne kode embalaže* so na voljo naslednja polja:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:66
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:111
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product`: Select the product (and variant, if applicable) to "
"which the packaging applies."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Izdelek`: Izberite izdelek (in varianto, če je primerno), za "
"katerega velja embalaža."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:68
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:113
msgid ":guilabel:`Barcode`: Specify the barcode for the specified product."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Črtna koda`: Določite črtno kodo za navedeni izdelek."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:69
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unit`: Select the packaging. This packaging must be defined "
"already in the :guilabel:`Packagings` field in the *Sales* tab of the "
"product form."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Enota`: Izberite embalažo. Ta embalaža mora biti že določena v "
"polju :guilabel:`Embalaža` na zavihku *Prodaja* obrazca izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:72
msgid ""
"Add barcodes for packagings and any variants on the Packaging Barcodes page."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte črtne kode za embalažo in vse variante na strani Črtne kode embalaže."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:75
msgid ""
"To specify a purchase packaging for a vendor, open the *Purchase* tab, then "
"add a vendor. Update the :guilabel:`Unit` field to specify a purchase "
"packaging for that vendor. Specify existing packagings here, or create new "
"ones by clicking :guilabel:`Create and edit`. When :guilabel:`Create and "
"edit` is clicked, the *Create Unit* window opens. The fields in this box are "
"the same as for the *Create Packagings* window above."
msgstr ""
"Če želite določiti prodajno embalažo za dobavitelja, odprite zavihek "
"*Nabava* in dodajte dobavitelja. Posodobite polje :guilabel:`Enota`, da "
"določite prodajno embalažo za tega dobavitelja. Tukaj navedite obstoče "
"embalaže ali ustvarite nove s klikom na :guilabel:`Ustvari in uredi`. Ko "
"kliknete :guilabel:`Ustvari in uredi`, se odpre okno *Ustvari enoto*. Polja "
"v tem polju so enaka kot za zgoraj omenjeno okno *Ustvari embalažo*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:82
msgid ""
"To create a purchase packaging type for six units of the product, `Grape "
"Soda`, begin by clicking :guilabel:`Add a line` in the *Purchase* tab. "
"Specify a :guilabel:`Vendor`. Specify `6-pack` in the :guilabel:`Unit` "
"field, then click :guilabel:`Create and edit`. In the *Create Unit* window, "
"specify a quantity and reference unit (in this case, `6` `Units`), then "
"click :guilabel:`Save`. Repeat this process for additional packagings."
msgstr ""
"Če želite ustvariti tip nabavne embalaže za šest enot izdelka, `Grape Soda`, "
"najprej kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj vrstico` na zavihku *Nabava*. Določite "
":guilabel:`Dobavitelj`. V polje :guilabel:`Enota` vnesite `6-pack`, nato "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Ustvari in uredi`. V oknu *Ustvari enoto* določite "
"količino in referenčno enoto (v tem primeru `6` `Enot`), nato kliknite "
":guilabel:`Shrani`. Ta postopek ponovite za dodatno embalažo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:88
msgid "Create purchase packagings for product."
msgstr "Ustvarite pakiranja za nabavo za izdelek."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:92
msgid "From units & packagings page"
msgstr "S strani enote in pakiranje"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:94
msgid ""
"To view all packagings that have been created, go "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Units & Packagings`. "
"Doing so reveals the *Units & Packagings* page with a complete list of all "
"packagings that have been created for all products. Create new packagings by "
"clicking :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Za ogled vseh ustvarjenih pakiranj pojdite na :menuselection:`aplikacija "
"Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> Enote in pakiranje`. S tem se prikaže stran "
":guilabel:`Enote in pakiranje` s popolnim seznamom vseh pakiranj, "
"ustvarjenih za vse izdelke. Ustvarite nova pakiranja s klikom na "
":guilabel:`Novo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:100
msgid ""
"Two soda products, `Grape Soda` and `Diet Coke`, have three types of "
"packagings configured. On the :guilabel:`Units & Packagings` page, each "
"product can be sold as a `6-Pack` that contains 6 products, as a `12-Pack` "
"of 12 products, or as a `Case` of 32 products."
msgstr ""
"Dva izdelka sode, `Grape Soda` in `Diet Coke`, imata konfigurirana tri tipe "
"pakiranj. Na strani :guilabel:`Enote in pakiranje` je mogoče vsak izdelek "
"prodati kot `6-Pack`, ki vsebuje 6 izdelkov, kot `12-Pack` z 12 izdelki ali "
"kot `Case` z 32 izdelki."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:104
msgid "List of different packagings for products."
msgstr "Seznam različnih pakiranj za izdelke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:107
msgid ""
"To define barcodes for packagings, click the :icon:`fa-"
"barcode` :guilabel:`Packaging Barcodes` smart button in the packaging form. "
"The *Packaging Barcodes* page opens, with the following fields available:"
msgstr ""
"Za določitev črtnih kod za embalažo kliknite pametni gumb :icon:`fa-barcode` "
":guilabel:`Črtne kode embalaže` v obrazcu embalaže. Odpre se stran *Črtne "
"kode embalaže*, kjer so na voljo naslednja polja:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:118
msgid "Partial reservation"
msgstr "Delna rezervacija"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:120
msgid ""
"After :ref:`completing the packaging setup <inventory/product_management/"
"packaging-setup>`, packagings can be reserved in full or partial quantities "
"for outgoing shipments. Partial packaging flexibility expedites order "
"fulfillment by allowing the immediate shipment of available items, while "
"awaiting the rest."
msgstr ""
"Po :ref:`dokončanju nastavitve pakiranja <inventory/product_management/"
"packaging-setup>` je mogoče pakiranja rezervirati v celotnih ali delnih "
"količinah za odhodne pošiljke. Fleksibilnost delnega pakiranja pospeši "
"izvajanje naročil, saj omogoča takojšnjo pošiljko razpoložljivih artiklov, "
"medtem ko se čaka na preostale."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:125
msgid ""
"To configure packaging reservation methods, go to :menuselection:`Inventory "
"app --> Configuration --> Products --> Categories`. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`New`, or select the desired product category."
msgstr ""
"Za konfiguracijo metod rezervacije pakiranja pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`aplikacija Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> Izdelki --> "
"Kategorije`. Nato kliknite :guilabel:`Novo` ali izberite želeno kategorijo "
"izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:128
msgid ""
"On the product category's form, in the :guilabel:`Logistics` "
"section, :guilabel:`Reserve Packagings` can be set to :guilabel:`Reserve "
"Only Full Packagings` or :guilabel:`Reserve Partial Packagings`."
msgstr ""
"Na obrazcu kategorije izdelka lahko v razdelku :guilabel:`Logistika` "
"nastavite :guilabel:`Rezervacija pakiranj` na :guilabel:`Rezerviraj samo "
"polna pakiranja` ali :guilabel:`Rezerviraj delna pakiranja`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:132
msgid ""
"To see the :guilabel:`Reserve Packaging` field, the :guilabel:`Product "
"Packaging` feature **must** be enabled. To enable this feature, go "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll to "
"the :guilabel:`Products` section, tick the :guilabel:`Product Packagings` "
"checkbox, and click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite videti polje :guilabel:`Rezervacija pakiranja`, **mora** biti "
"omogočena funkcija :guilabel:`Pakiranje izdelkov`. Za omogočitev te funkcije "
"pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> "
"Nastavitve`, se pomaknite do razdelka :guilabel:`Izdelki`, odkljukajte "
"potrditveno polje :guilabel:`Pakiranja izdelkov` in "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:137
msgid "Show Reserve Packagings field on the product categories page."
msgstr "Prikaz polja Rezervacija pakiranj na strani kategorij izdelkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:141
msgid ""
"To better evaluate the options based on business needs, consider the "
"following example:"
msgstr ""
"Za boljšo oceno možnosti glede na poslovne potrebe upoštevajte naslednji "
"primer:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:143
msgid "A product is sold in twelve units per packaging."
msgstr "izdelek se prodaja v dvanajstih enotah na pakiranje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:144
msgid "An order demands two packagings."
msgstr "naročilo zahteva dve pakiranja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:145
msgid "There are only twenty-two units in stock."
msgstr "na zalogi je samo dvaindvajset enot."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:147
msgid ""
"When :guilabel:`Reserve Only Full Packagings` is selected, only twelve units "
"are reserved for the order."
msgstr ""
"Ko je izbrana možnost :guilabel:`Rezerviraj samo polna pakiranja`, je za "
"naročilo rezerviranih samo dvanajst enot."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:150
msgid ""
"Conversely, when :guilabel:`Reserve Partial Packagings` is selected, twenty-"
"two units are reserved for the order."
msgstr ""
"Naprotno, ko je izbrana možnost :guilabel:`Rezerviraj delne embalaže`, je za "
"naročilo rezerviranih dvaindvajset enot."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:154
msgid "Apply packagings"
msgstr "Uporabi embalaže"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:156
msgid ""
"When creating a sales order in the :menuselection:`Sales` app, specify the "
"packagings that should be used for the product. The chosen packaging is "
"displayed on the :abbr:`SO (Sales Order)` under the :guilabel:`Units` field."
msgstr ""
"Pri ustvarjanju prodajnega naloga v aplikaciji :menuselection:`Prodaja` "
"določite pakiranja, ki naj se uporabijo za izdelek. Izbrano pakiranje je "
"prikazano na :abbr:`PN (prodajni nalog)` pod poljem :guilabel:`Enote`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:161
msgid ""
"18 cans of the product, `Grape Soda`, is packed using three 6-pack "
"packagings."
msgstr ""
"18 pločevink izdelka `Grape Soda` je pakiranih z uporabo treh embalaž po 6 "
"kosov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:163
msgid "Assign packagings on the Sales Order Line."
msgstr "Dodelite embalaže v vrstici prodajnega naloga."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:3
msgid "Product type"
msgstr "Vrsta izdelka"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:8
msgid ""
"In Odoo, goods and services are both set up as *products*. When setting up a "
"new product, several fields should be carefully selected, as they determine "
"how to invoice and track a business's goods or services."
msgstr ""
"V Odoo so blago in storitve nastavljeni kot *izdelki*. Pri nastavljanju "
"novega izdelka je treba skrbno izbrati več polj, saj določajo način "
"obračunavanja in sledenja blagu ali storitvam podjetja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:12
msgid ""
"To configure an existing product, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Products --> Products`, and select the desired product from the list. "
"Alternatively, from the *Products* page, click :guilabel:`New` to create a "
"new product."
msgstr ""
"Za konfiguracijo obstoječega izdelka pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Zaloga --> Izdelki --> Izdelki` in izberite želeni izdelek s seznama. Lahko "
"pa na strani :guilabel:`Izdelki` kliknete :guilabel:`Novo`, da ustvarite nov "
"izdelek."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:19
msgid "For sale vs. purchase"
msgstr "Za prodajo ali nakup"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:21
msgid ""
"Goods and services can be designated as those that can be bought, sold, or "
"both. On the product form, select the :guilabel:`Sales` checkbox if the "
"product can be *sold* to customers (e.g., finished goods). "
"Select :guilabel:`Purchase` if the product can be *purchased* (e.g., raw "
"materials)."
msgstr ""
"Blago in storitve lahko označite kot tiste, ki jih je mogoče kupiti, prodati "
"ali oboje. Na obrazcu izdelka izberite potrditveno "
"polje :guilabel:`Prodaja`, če je mogoče izdelek *prodati* strankam (npr. "
"končni izdelki). Izberite :guilabel:`Nabava`, če je mogoče izdelek *kupiti* "
"(npr. surovine)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:27
msgid ""
"If a resale clothing shop buys discounted denim jackets and sells them at a "
"higher cost to the end consumer, the `Jacket` product form should have "
"*both* the :guilabel:`Sales` and :guilabel:`Purchase` checkboxes selected."
msgstr ""
"Če trgovina s ponovno prodajo oblačil kupi jeans jakne s popustom in jih "
"prodaja po višji ceni končnemu potrošniku, mora imeti obrazec izdelka "
"`Jacket` *obe* potrditveni polji :guilabel:`Prodaja` in :guilabel:`Nabava` "
"izbrani."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:31
msgid ""
"On the other hand, imagine the store occasionally sews new jackets from "
"denim and thread. In the `Denim` and `Thread` product forms, "
"only :guilabel:`Purchase` should be selected, whereas in the `Handmade "
"Jacket` product form, only :guilabel:`Sales` should be selected."
msgstr ""
"Po drugi strani si predstavljajte, da trgovina občasno šiva nove jakne iz "
"jeansa in niti. V obrazcih izdelkov `Denim` in `Thread` naj bo izbrana "
"samo :guilabel:`Nabava`, medtem ko naj bo v obrazcu izdelka `Handmade "
"Jacket` izbrana samo :guilabel:`Prodaja`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:38
msgid "Goods vs. services"
msgstr "Blago ali storitve"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:40
msgid ""
"When configuring a product, a :guilabel:`Product Type` must be selected on "
"the *General Information* tab of a product form. Each product type impacts "
"different operations in other Odoo applications, such as **Sales** and "
"**Purchase**, and should be chosen carefully."
msgstr ""
"Pri konfiguraciji izdelka je treba na zavihku *Splošne informacije* obrazca "
"izdelka izbrati :guilabel:`Vrsta izdelka`. Vsaka vrsta izdelka vpliva na "
"različne operacije v drugih aplikacijah Odoo, kot sta **Prodaja** in "
"**Nabava**, zato jo je treba skrbno izbrati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Goods`: tangible, material objects (e.g., anything from a "
"hamburger to a house)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Blago`: otipljivi, materialni predmeti (npr. karkoli od "
"hamburgerja do hiše)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:45
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Service`: intangible, immaterial offerings (e.g., a repair, a "
"haircut, call center assistance)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Storitev`: neotipljive, nematerialne ponudbe (npr. popravilo, "
"striženje, pomoč klicnega centra)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:47
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Combo`: any mix of goods and services (e.g., a new car (*good*) "
"with an oil change included (*service*))"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kombinacija`: katerakoli mešanica blaga in storitev (npr. nov "
"avto (*blago*) z vključeno menjavo olja (*storitev*))"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:51
msgid ""
"Due to their immaterial nature, services are not trackable in Odoo's "
"**Inventory** application."
msgstr ""
"Zaradi njihove nematerialne narave storitve niso sledljive v aplikaciji "
"**Zaloga** sistema Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:56
msgid "Configure goods"
msgstr "Konfiguracija blaga"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:58
msgid ""
"Selecting :guilabel:`Goods` as the :guilabel:`Product Type` enables a few "
"fields and tabs in the product form:"
msgstr ""
"Izbira :guilabel:`Blago` kot :guilabel:`Vrsta izdelka` omogoči nekatera "
"polja in zavihke v obrazcu izdelka:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:61
msgid ""
":ref:`Invoicing Policy <inventory/product_management/invoicing-policy>` "
"field: This field determines at what point in the sales process a customer "
"is invoiced."
msgstr ""
"Polje :ref:`Način fakturiranja <inventory/product_management/invoicing-"
"policy>`: To polje določa, kdaj v procesu prodaje je stranka fakturirana."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:65
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` field **only** appears if the **Sales** app "
"is installed."
msgstr ""
"Polje :guilabel:`Način fakturiranja` se prikaže **le**, če je nameščena "
"aplikacija **Prodaja**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:67
msgid ""
":ref:`Tracking <inventory/product_management/tracking-inventory>` field: "
"This field determines whether and how Odoo tracks inventory for this product."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Sledenje <inventory/product_management/tracking-inventory>` polje: To "
"polje določa, ali in kako Odoo sledi zalogam za ta izdelek."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:69
msgid ""
"*Inventory* tab: From here, :doc:`purchasing and manufacturing routes <../../"
"shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes>`, as well as product "
"logistics such as product weight and delivery time, can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Zavihek *Zaloge*: Tukaj lahko določite :doc:`nabavne in proizvodne poti <../"
"../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes>`, kot tudi logistiko "
"izdelka, na primer težo izdelka in dobavni rok."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:72
msgid ""
"Smart buttons: Some smart buttons appear above the form "
"when :guilabel:`Goods` is selected; others appear when :guilabel:`Track "
"Inventory` is selected. For example, the :guilabel:`Forecasted Report` "
"button displays when :guilabel:`Track Inventory` is selected. In general, "
"most smart buttons on a product form link to :ref:`inventory operations "
"<inventory/product_management/inventory-ops-by-product-type>`."
msgstr ""
"Pametni gumbi: Nekateri pametni gumbi se prikažejo nad obrazcem, ko je "
"izbrano :guilabel:`Blago`; drugi se prikažejo, ko je "
"izbrano :guilabel:`Sledenje zalogi`. Na primer, gumb :guilabel:`Napovedano "
"poročilo` se prikaže, ko je izbrano :guilabel:`Sledenje zalogi`. Na splošno "
"večina pametnih gumbov na obrazcu izdelka povezuje do :ref:`operacij zaloge "
"<inventory/product_management/inventory-ops-by-product-type>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:78
msgid "Designate a product as a good or service."
msgstr "Označite izdelek kot blago ali storitev."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:84
msgid "Invoicing policy"
msgstr "Način fakturiranja"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:86
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` field appears on the product form only when "
"a product is for sale (i.e., when :guilabel:`Sales` is selected, and the "
"**Sales** app is installed)."
msgstr ""
"Polje :guilabel:`Politika fakturiranja` se v obrazcu izdelka prikaže le, ko "
"je izdelek namenjen prodaji (tj. ko je izbrana :guilabel:`Prodaja` in je "
"nameščena aplikacija **Prodaja**)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:89
msgid ""
"When configuring a product for sale, it is necessary to choose "
"an :doc:`invoicing policy <../../../../sales/sales/invoicing/"
"invoicing_policy>`:"
msgstr ""
"Pri konfiguraciji izdelka za prodajo je treba izbrati :doc:`politiko "
"fakturiranja <../../../../sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy>`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:92
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Ordered quantities`: Customers are invoiced when the sales order "
"is confirmed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Naročene količine`: Strankam se izstavi račun, ko je prodajni "
"nalog potrjen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivered quantities`: Customers are invoiced when the delivery "
"is completed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dostavljene količine`: Strankam se izstavi račun, ko je dostava "
"zaključena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:98
msgid "Tracked vs. untracked goods"
msgstr "Sledeno ali nesledeno blago"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:100
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Tracking` field on the product form drives many of Odoo's "
"**Inventory** operations."
msgstr ""
"Polje :guilabel:`Sledenje` na obrazcu izdelka vodi mnoge operacije **Zalog** "
"v sistemu Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:102
msgid ""
"*Tracked* products are those for which stock and inventory are maintained. "
"Examples include finished goods and, often, the raw materials or components "
"needed to make them."
msgstr ""
"*Sledeni* izdelki so tisti, za katere se vzdržuje stanje in zaloga. Primeri "
"vključujejo končne izdelke in pogosto surovine ali komponente, potrebne za "
"njihovo izdelavo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:105
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Tracking` field, a drop-down menu appears, offering three "
"ways to track inventory: :guilabel:`By Unique Serial Number`, :guilabel:`By "
"Lots`, or :guilabel:`By Quantity`."
msgstr ""
"V polju :guilabel:`Sledenje` se prikaže spustni meni, ki ponuja tri načine "
"za sledenje zalogi: :guilabel:`Po edinstveni serijski številki`, "
":guilabel:`Po serijah` ali :guilabel:`Po količini`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:108
msgid "Configure a tracked good."
msgstr "Konfiguracija sledenega blaga."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:111
msgid ""
"*Untracked* products (sometimes referred to as *non-inventory* products) are "
"typically consumed quickly, so stock (or inventory) does *not* need to be "
"maintained. Non-inventory products are often essential, but exact counts are "
"unnecessary. Examples include: office supplies, packaging materials, or "
"items used in production that do not need to be individually tracked."
msgstr ""
"*Nesledeni* izdelki (včasih imenovani *nezalogeni* izdelki) se običajno "
"porabijo hitro, zato *ni* potrebno vzdrževati zaloge. Nezalogeni izdelki so "
"pogosto bistveni, vendar natančno štetje ni potrebno. Primeri vključujejo: "
"pisarniški material, embalažni material ali artikle, uporabljene v "
"proizvodnji, ki jih ni treba posamezno slediti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:116
msgid ""
"To mark a product as untracked, select :guilabel:`None` in "
"the :guilabel:`Tracking` field."
msgstr ""
"Za označitev izdelka kot nesledenega izberite :guilabel:`Brez` v polju "
":guilabel:`Sledenje` ."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:119
msgid ""
"Select a :guilabel:`Tracking` option if it is necessary to track a product's "
"stock at various locations, perform inventory valuation, use lots or serial "
"numbers, or create reordering rules."
msgstr ""
"Izberite možnost :guilabel:`Sledenje`, če je treba slediti zalogi izdelka na "
"različnih lokacijah, opraviti vrednotenje zalog, uporabiti serije ali "
"serijske številke oziroma ustvariti pravila za preurejanje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:123
msgid ""
":doc:`Tracking storable products using lot and serial numbers <../"
"product_tracking>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Sledenje skladiščnih izdelkov z uporabo številk serij in šarž <../"
"product_tracking>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:128
msgid "Inventory operations by product type"
msgstr "Skladiščne operacije glede na vrsto izdelka"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:130
msgid ""
":ref:`Whether a good is tracked or untracked <inventory/product_management/"
"tracking-inventory>` affects common **Inventory** operations, like transfers "
"and reordering rules."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Ali je blago sledeno ali nesledeno <inventory/product_management/"
"tracking-inventory>`, vpliva na pogoste operacije v aplikaciji **Zaloga**, "
"kot so prenosi in pravila za naročanje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:133
msgid ""
"The table below summarizes which operations (and smart buttons) are enabled "
"for tracked vs. untracked goods. Click highlighted chart items to navigate "
"to detailed sections and related documents."
msgstr ""
"Spodnja tabela povzema, katere operacije (in pametni gumbi) so omogočeni za "
"sledeno in nesledeno blago. Kliknite označene elemente grafikona za "
"navigacijo do podrobnih razdelkov in povezanih dokumentov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:141
msgid "Inventory operation"
msgstr "Zaloga operacija"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:142
