#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_one_step.rst:3
msgid "One-step receipt and delivery"
msgstr "Enostopenjski prejem in dostava"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_one_step.rst:9
msgid ""
"In Odoo *Inventory*, both incoming and outgoing shipments are configured to "
"process in one step, by default. This means purchases will be received "
"directly into stock, and deliveries will be moved directly from stock to "
"customers."
msgstr ""
"V aplikaciji Odoo *Zaloga* sta dohodne in odhodne pošiljke privzeto "
"konfigurirane za obdelavo v enem koraku. To pomeni, da bodo nakupi prejeti "
"neposredno v zalogo, dostave pa bodo premaknjene neposredno iz zaloge do "
"strank."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_one_step.rst:14
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:28
msgid ""
"Incoming and outgoing shipments do **not** need to be configured with the "
"same amount of steps."
msgstr ""
"Dohodne in odhodne pošiljke **ni** treba konfigurirati z enakim številom "
"korakov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_one_step.rst:16
msgid ""
"For example, a warehouse's settings can be configured so products can be "
"received directly in one step, and delivered in three steps (pick + pack + "
"ship)."
msgstr ""
"Na primer, nastavitve skladišča je mogoče konfigurirati tako, da se izdelki "
"prejmejo neposredno v enem koraku in dostavijo v treh korakih (pobiranje + "
"pakiranje + pošiljanje)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_one_step.rst:22
msgid ""
"To configure one-step receipts and deliveries for a warehouse, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Warehouses`, and "
"select a warehouse to edit."
msgstr ""
"Za konfiguracijo enokoračnih prejemov in dostav za skladišče pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`aplikacija Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> Skladišča` in "
"izberite skladišče za urejanje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_one_step.rst:25
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Warehouse Configuration` tab, set :guilabel:`Incoming "
"Shipments` to :guilabel:`Receive goods directly (1 step)`, and "
"set :guilabel:`Outgoing Shipments` to :guilabel:`Deliver goods directly (1 "
"step)`."
msgstr ""
"Pod zavihkom :guilabel:`Konfiguracija skladišča` "
"nastavite :guilabel:`Dohodne pošiljke` na :guilabel:`Prejmi blago neposredno "
"(1 korak)` in nastavite :guilabel:`Odhodne pošiljke` na :guilabel:`Dostavi "
"blago neposredno (1 korak)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_one_step.rst:29
msgid "Incoming and outgoing shipments set to one-step on warehouse form."
msgstr ""
"Dohodne in odhodne pošiljke nastavljene na en korak na obrazcu skladišča."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_one_step.rst:34
msgid ""
"Since one-step receipt and delivery is the default for incoming and outgoing "
"shipments in Odoo, the *Multi-Step Routes* feature is *not* required."
msgstr ""
"Ker sta enokoračni prejem in dostava privzeta za dohodne in odhodne pošiljke "
"v Odoo, funkcija *Večkoračne poti* *ni* potrebna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_one_step.rst:37
msgid ""
"However, for the :guilabel:`Shipments` settings to appear on a warehouse "
"form, the feature **must** be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Vendar morajo biti nastavitve :guilabel:`Pošiljke`, da se prikažejo na "
"obrazcu skladišča, **vključene**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_one_step.rst:40
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:39
msgid ""
"To enable *Multi-Step Routes*, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
