#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:3
msgid "Two-step receipt and delivery"
msgstr "Dvokoračni prevzem in dostava"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:10
msgid ""
"Depending on a company's needs, receiving and shipping products in and out "
"of the warehouse might require multi-step operations. In Odoo *Inventory*, "
"this can be done using *Multi-Step Routes*."
msgstr ""
"Odvisno od potreb podjetja lahko prejem in odpošiljanje izdelkov v in iz "
"skladišča zahteva večkoračne operacije. V Odoo *Zalogi* je to mogoče storiti "
"z uporabo *Večkoračnih poti*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:13
msgid ""
"In the two-step receipt process, products are received in an input area, "
"then transferred to stock. This kind of process for incoming shipments might "
"be beneficial for warehouses with specific storage locations, such as "
"freezers and refrigerators, secured locked areas, or special aisles and "
"shelves."
msgstr ""
"V procesu dvokoračnega prevzema se izdelki najprej prejmejo na območju za "
"vnos, nato pa se prenesejo v zalogo. Tovrstni proces za dohodne pošiljke je "
"lahko koristen za skladišča s posebnimi lokacijami za shranjevanje, kot so "
"zamrzovalniki in hladilniki, varovana zaklenjena območja ali posebni prehodi "
"in police."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:17
msgid ""
"Products can be sorted according to where they are going to be stored, and "
"employees can stock all the products going to a specific location. The "
"products are *not* available for further processing, until they are "
"transferred into stock."
msgstr ""
"Izdelke je mogoče razvrstiti glede na to, kje bodo shranjeni, zaposleni pa "
"lahko uskladiščijo vse izdelke, ki gredo na določeno lokacijo. Izdelki "
"*niso* na voljo za nadaljnjo obdelavo, dokler niso preneseni v zalogo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:21
msgid ""
"In the two-step delivery process, products are first picked from their "
"respective location in the warehouse, then transferred to an output location "
"before being shipped to the customer."
msgstr ""
"Pri dvostopenjskem postopku dostave se izdelki najprej poberejo z ustrezne "
"lokacije v skladišču, nato pa se prenesejo na izhodno lokacijo, preden se "
"odpošljejo kupcu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:24
msgid ""
"This might be beneficial for companies using a First In, First Out (FIFO), "
"Last In, First Out (LIFO), or First Expired, First Out (FEFO) removal "
"strategy."
msgstr ""
"To je lahko koristno za podjetja, ki uporabljajo strategijo odstranjevanja "
"Prvi noter, prvi ven (FIFO), Zadnji noter, prvi ven (LIFO) ali Prvi potekel, "
"prvi ven (FEFO)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:30
msgid ""
"For example, a warehouse's settings can be configured so products can be "
"received in two steps (input + stock), and delivered in three steps (pick + "
"pack + ship)."
msgstr ""
"Nastavitve skladišča je na primer mogoče konfigurirati tako, da se izdelki "
"prejmejo v dveh korakih (vnos + zaloga) in dostavijo v treh korakih "
"(pobiranje + pakiranje + pošiljanje)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:36
msgid ""
"In Odoo *Inventory*, both incoming and outgoing shipments are configured to "
"process in one step, by default. To change these settings, the *Multi-Step "
"Routes* feature must be enabled."
msgstr ""
"V aplikaciji Odoo *Inventory* sta tako prejete kot izdane pošiljke privzeto "
"konfigurirane za obdelavo v enem koraku. Če želite spremeniti te nastavitve, "
"morate omogočiti funkcijo *Večstopenjske poti*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:44
msgid "Enabled Multi-Step Routes feature in Inventory app settings."
msgstr ""
"Omogočena funkcija Večstopenjske poti v nastavitvah aplikacije Inventory."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:48
msgid ""
"Next, configure a warehouse for two-step receipts and deliveries. Navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Warehouses`, and "
"select a warehouse to edit."
msgstr ""
"Nato konfigurirajte skladišče za dvostopenjske prevzeme in dostave. Pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Inventory --> Konfiguracija --> Skladišča` in "
"izberite skladišče za urejanje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:51
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Warehouse Configuration` tab, set :guilabel:`Incoming "
"Shipments` to :guilabel:`Receive goods in input and then stock (2 steps)`, "
"and set :guilabel:`Outgoing Shipments` to :guilabel:`Send goods in output "
"and then deliver (2 steps)`."
msgstr ""
"Na zavihku :guilabel:`Konfiguracija skladišča` nastavite :guilabel:`Prejete "
"pošiljke` na :guilabel:`Prejem blaga v vnos in nato zalogo (2 koraka)` ter "
"nastavite :guilabel:`Izdane pošiljke` na :guilabel:`Pošiljanje blaga v izhod "
"in nato dostava (2 koraka)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:55
msgid "Incoming and outgoing shipments set to two-step on warehouse form."
msgstr ""
"Prejete in izdane pošiljke nastavljene na dva koraka v obrazcu skladišča."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:60
msgid ""
"Selecting two-step receipts and deliveries automatically creates new *Input* "
"and *Output* warehouse locations in the database, named `WH/Input` and `WH/"
"Output`, respectively."
msgstr ""
"Izbira dvostopenjskih prevzemov in dostav samodejno ustvari novi lokaciji "
"skladišča *Vnos* in *Izhod* v bazi podatkov z imenom `WH/Input` in `WH/"
"Output`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:63
msgid ""
"To rename or edit these locations, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory app "
"--> Configuration --> Locations`, and select the desired location."
msgstr ""
"Če želite preimenovati ali urediti te lokacije, pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Inventory --> Konfiguracija --> Lokacije` in "
"izberite želeno lokacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:66
msgid ""
"On the location's form, change the :guilabel:`Location Name`, and make any "
"other necessary changes."
msgstr ""
"V obrazcu lokacije spremenite :guilabel:`Ime lokacije` in naredite druge "
"potrebne spremembe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:70
msgid "Process receipt in two steps (input + stock)"
msgstr "Obdelava prevzema v dveh korakih (vnos + zaloga)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:72
msgid ""
"When products are received in two steps, they first move from the vendor "
"location to an input location. Then, they move from the input location to "
"warehouse stock in the database, upon validation of a purchase order (PO), "
"and a subsequent internal transfer."
msgstr ""
"Ko se izdelki prejmejo v dveh korakih, se najprej prestavijo z lokacije "
"dobavitelja na vhodno lokacijo. Nato se prestavijo z vhodne lokacije v "
"zalogo skladišča v bazi podatkov po potrditvi naročila (PO) in naknadnem "
"internem prenosu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:82
msgid ""
"Add a vendor in the :guilabel:`Vendor` field. Then, fill out the various "
"fields on the |RfQ|, as necessary."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte dobavitelja v polje :guilabel:`Dobavitelj`. Nato po potrebi "
"izpolnite različna polja v |RfQ|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:85
msgid "Filled out new Request for Quotation from vendor."
msgstr "Izpolnjena nova Zahteva za ponudbo od dobavitelja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:98
msgid "Delivery smart button for validated purchase order."
msgstr "Pametni gumb za dostavo za potrjeno naročilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:103
msgid ""
"For businesses with multiple warehouses that have different step "
"configurations, the :guilabel:`Deliver To` field on the |PO| form **must** "
"be specified as the correct *input location* connected to the two-step "
"warehouse."
msgstr ""
"Za podjetja z več skladišči, ki imajo različne konfiguracije korakov, "
"**mora** biti polje :guilabel:`Dostavi na` v obrazcu |PO| določeno kot "
"pravilna *vhodna lokacija*, povezana z dvostopenjskim skladiščem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:107
msgid ""
"This can be done by selecting the warehouse from the drop-down menu that "
"includes the `Receipts` label at the end of the name."
msgstr ""
"To lahko storite tako, da iz spustnega menija izberete skladišče, ki "
"vključuje oznako `Receipts` na koncu imena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:113
msgid ""
"From the warehouse receipt form, the products ordered can be received into "
"the warehouse. To receive the products, click :guilabel:`Validate`. Once "
"validated, the receipt moves to the :guilabel:`Done` stage, and the products "
"move to the :guilabel:`WH/Input` location."
msgstr ""
"Iz obrazca prevzema skladišča je mogoče naročene izdelke prejeti v "
"skladišče. Za prejem izdelkov kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`. Ko je potrjen, "
"prevzem preide v fazo :guilabel:`Opravljeno` in izdelki se prestavijo na "
"lokacijo :guilabel:`WH/Input`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:117
msgid "Receipt form for products ordered from vendor."
msgstr "Obrazec za prejem izdelkov, naročenih pri dobavitelju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:126
msgid "Process internal transfer"
msgstr "Obdelajte interno premestitev"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:128
msgid ""
"Once the receipt is validated, an internal transfer is created and ready to "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Ko je prejem potrjen, je ustvarjena in pripravljena za obdelavo interna "
"premestitev."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:130
msgid ""
"To view the internal transfer, navigate to the :menuselection:`Inventory "
"app`, and locate the :guilabel:`Internal Transfers` task card."
msgstr ""
"Za ogled interne premestitve se pomaknite do :menuselection:`aplikacije "
"Zaloga` in poiščite kartico opravila :guilabel:`Interne premestitve`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:133
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`# To Process` button on the task card to reveal a list "
"of all internal transfers to process, and select the transfer associated "
"with the previously validated receipt."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite gumb :guilabel:`# za obdelavo` na kartici opravila, da se prikaže "
"seznam vseh internih premestitev za obdelavo, in izberite premestitev, "
"povezano s predhodno potrjenim prejemom."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:136
msgid ""
"Once ready, click :guilabel:`Validate` to complete the transfer, and move "
"the product from :guilabel:`WH/Input` to :guilabel:`WH/Stock`."
msgstr ""
"Ko ste pripravljeni, kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`, da dokončate premestitev "
"in premaknete izdelek iz :guilabel:`WH/Input` v :guilabel:`WH/Stock`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:139
msgid ""
"Once the transfer is validated, the products enter inventory, and are "
"available for customer deliveries or manufacturing orders."
msgstr ""
"Ko je premestitev potrjena, izdelki vstopijo v zalogo in so na voljo za "
"dobave strankam ali proizvodne naloge."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:142
msgid "Internal transfer form for products ordered from vendor."
msgstr "Obrazec interne premestitve za izdelke, naročene pri dobavitelju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:149
msgid "Process delivery order in two steps (pick + ship)"
msgstr "Obdelajte dobavni nalog v dveh korakih (nabiranje + odpošiljanje)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:151
msgid ""
"When products are delivered in two steps, they move from warehouse stock to "
"an output location. Then, they move from the output location to a customer "
"location in the database, upon validation of a picking order, and a "
"subsequent delivery order (DO)."
msgstr ""
"Ko se izdelki dobavljajo v dveh korakih, se premaknejo iz zaloge skladišča "
"na izhodno lokacijo. Nato se premaknejo z izhodne lokacije na lokacijo "
"stranke v bazi podatkov ob potrditvi naloga za nabiranje in naknadnega "
"dobavnega naloga (DO)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:164
msgid "Filled out new sales order form."
msgstr "Izpolnjen obrazec novega prodajnega naloga."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:168
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Order Lines` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a product`, and "
"select a product to add to the sales order quotation."
msgstr ""
"Pod zavihkom :guilabel:`Vrstice naloga` kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj izdelek` "
"in izberite izdelek, ki ga želite dodati v ponudbo prodajnega naloga."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:177
msgid "Delivery smart button on validated sales order form."
msgstr "Pametni gumb za dobavo na obrazcu potrjenega prodajnega naloga."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:182
msgid "Process picking"
msgstr "Obdelajte nabiranje"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:184
msgid ""
"Once the sales order is confirmed, a picking order is generated and ready to "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Ko je prodajni nalog potrjen, je ustvarjen nalog za nabiranje in pripravljen "
"za obdelavo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:186
msgid ""
"To complete the picking, navigate to the :guilabel:`Inventory app`, and "
"locate the :guilabel:`Pick` task card on the :guilabel:`Inventory Overview` "
"dashboard. Alternatively, the picking order can also be accessed via "
"the :guilabel:`Delivery` smart button at the top of the sales order form."
msgstr ""
"Za dokončanje nabiranja se pomaknite do :guilabel:`aplikacije Zaloga` in na "
"nadzorni plošči :guilabel:`Pregled zaloge` poiščite kartico "
"opravila :guilabel:`Nabiranje`. Alternativno je mogoče nalog za nabiranje "
"dostopati tudi prek pametnega gumba :guilabel:`Dobava` na vrhu obrazca "
"prodajnega naloga."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:190
msgid ""
"From the :guilabel:`Inventory Overview` page, click the :guilabel:`# To "
"Process` button on the :guilabel:`Pick` task card. This reveals a list of "
"all pickings to process."
msgstr ""
"Na strani :guilabel:`Pregled zaloge` kliknite gumb :guilabel:`# za obdelavo` "
"na kartici opravila :guilabel:`Nabiranje`. To prikaže seznam vseh nabiranje "
"za obdelavo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:193
msgid ""
"Click on the picking (WH/PICK) operation associated with the sales order to "
"reveal the picking order."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na operacijo nabiranja (WH/PICK), povezano s prodajnim nalogom, da "
"se prikaže nalog za nabiranje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:196
msgid "Picking order form for products included in sales order."
msgstr "Obrazec naloga za nabiranje za izdelke, vključene v prodajni nalog."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:200
msgid ""
"Manually set the quantity by changing the value in the :guilabel:`Quantity` "
"column, to match the value in the :guilabel:`Demand` column."
msgstr ""
"Ročno nastavite količino tako, da spremenite vrednost v "
"stolpcu :guilabel:`Količina`, da se ujema z vrednostjo v "
"stolpcu :guilabel:`Povpraševanje`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:203
msgid ""
"Once ready, click :guilabel:`Validate` to complete the picking, and move the "
"product from :guilabel:`WH/Stock` to :guilabel:`WH/Output.`"
msgstr ""
"Ko je pripravljeno, kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`, da dokončate nabiranje in "
"premaknete izdelek iz :guilabel:`WH/Stock` v :guilabel:`WH/Output.`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:209
msgid ""
"Once the picking is validated, a delivery order is created, and ready to "
"process. Clicking the :guilabel:`Delivery` smart button on the sales order "
"form reveals the newly created delivery order."
msgstr ""
"Ko je nabiranje potrjeno, se ustvari dobavnica in je pripravljena za "
"obdelavo. Klik na pametno gumb :guilabel:`Dobava` na obrazcu prodajnega "
"naloga prikaže novo ustvarjeno dobavnico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:212
msgid ""
"Alternatively, to view the delivery order, navigate back to "
"the :guilabel:`Inventory Overview` page, via the breadcrumbs, and locate "
"the :guilabel:`Delivery Orders` task card."
msgstr ""
"Druga možnost za ogled dobavnice je vrnitev na stran :guilabel:`Pregled "
"zaloge` prek drobtinic in iskanje kartice opravila :guilabel:`Dobavnice`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:215
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`# To Process` button on the task card to reveal a list "
"of all delivery orders to process, and select the order associated with the "
"previously validated picking."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite gumb :guilabel:`# za obdelavo` na kartici opravila, da se prikaže "
"seznam vseh dobavnic za obdelavo, in izberite nalog, povezan s predhodno "
"potrjenim nabiranjem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:218
msgid "Delivery order form for products ordered by customer."
msgstr "Obrazec dobavnice za izdelke, ki jih naroči stranka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:222
msgid ""
"To deliver the products, change the value in the :guilabel:`Quantity` field "
"to match the ordered quantity in the :guilabel:`Demand` field."
msgstr ""
"Za dostavo izdelkov spremenite vrednost v polju :guilabel:`Količina`, da se "
"ujema z naročeno količino v polju :guilabel:`Povpraševanje`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:3
msgid "Three-step receipt"
msgstr "Sprejem v treh korakih"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:5
msgid ""
"Some companies require a quality control process before receiving goods from "
"suppliers. To accomplish this, Odoo has a three-step process for receiving "
"goods."
msgstr ""
"Nekatera podjetja zahtevajo postopek nadzora kakovosti pred sprejemom blaga "
"od dobaviteljev. Za dosego tega ima Odoo trikoraki postopek za sprejem blaga."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:8
msgid ""
"In the three-step receipt process, products are received in an input area, "
"then transferred to a quality area for inspection. Products that pass the "
"quality inspection are then transferred into stock. The products are not "
"available for further processing until they are transferred out of the "
"quality area and into stock."
msgstr ""
"Pri postopku sprejema v treh korakih se izdelki sprejmejo na območju za "
"sprejem, nato se prenesejo na območje za kakovost za pregled. Izdelki, ki "
"prestanejo pregled kakovosti, se nato prenesejo na zalogo. Izdelki niso na "
"voljo za nadaljnjo obdelavo, dokler niso preneseni iz območja kakovosti na "
"zalogo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:16
msgid ""
"Odoo is configured by default to :doc:`receive and deliver goods in one step "
"<receipts_delivery_one_step>`, so the settings need to be changed in order "
"to utilize three-step receipts. First, make sure the *Multi-Step Routes* "
"option is enabled in :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> "
"Settings --> Warehouse`. Note that activating :guilabel:`Multi-Step Routes` "
"will also activate *Storage Locations*."
msgstr ""
"Odoo je privzeto konfiguriran za :doc:`sprejem in dostavo blaga v enem "
"koraku <receipts_delivery_one_step>`, zato je treba spremeniti nastavitve, "
"da se uporablja sprejem v treh korakih. Najprej se prepričajte, da je "
"možnost *Večkorake poti* omogočena v :menuselection:`Zaloga --> "
"Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve --> Skladišče`. Upoštevajte, da "
"aktiviranje :guilabel:`Večkorakih poti` aktivira tudi *Lokacije "
"skladiščenja*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:22
msgid "Activate multi-step routes and storage locations in Inventory settings."
msgstr ""
"Aktivirajte večkorake poti in lokacije skladiščenja v nastavitvah zaloge."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:26
msgid ""
"Next, the warehouse needs to be configured for three-step receipts. To do "
"that, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Warehouses`, "
"and select the desired warehouse to be edited. Doing so reveals the detail "
"form for that specific warehouse."
msgstr ""
"Nato je treba skladišče konfigurirati za sprejem v treh korakih. To storite "
"tako, da greste na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> "
"Skladišča` in izberete želeno skladišče za urejanje. S tem se prikaže "
"obrazec s podrobnostmi za to določeno skladišče."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:30
msgid ""
"On that :guilabel:`Warehouse` detail form page, select :guilabel:`Receive "
"goods in input, then quality and then stock (3 steps)` "
"for :guilabel:`Incoming Shipments`."
msgstr ""
"Na strani obrazca s podrobnostmi :guilabel:`Skladišče` "
"izberite :guilabel:`Sprejmi blago na sprejem, nato kakovost in nato zalogo "
"(3 koraki)` za :guilabel:`Dohodne pošiljke`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:33
msgid "Set incoming shipment option to receive in three steps."
msgstr "Nastavite možnost dohodne pošiljke za sprejem v treh korakih."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:37
msgid ""
"Activating three-step receipts and deliveries creates two new internal "
"locations: *Input* (WH/Input), and *Quality Control* (WH/Quality Control). "
"To rename these locations, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Locations`, then click on the desired location to change "
"(or update) the name."
msgstr ""
"Aktiviranje sprejema in dostave v treh korakih ustvari dve novi notranji "
"lokaciji: *Sprejem* (WH/Input) in *Nadzor kakovosti* (WH/Quality Control). "
"Za preimenovanje teh lokacij pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Zaloga --"
"> Konfiguracija --> Lokacije`, nato kliknite na želeno lokacijo za spremembo "
"(ali posodobitev) imena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:43
msgid "Receive in three steps (input + quality + stock)"
msgstr "Sprejem v treh korakih (sprejem + kakovost + zaloga)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:46
msgid "Create a purchase order"
msgstr "Ustvari naročilo dobavitelju"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:48
msgid ""
"To create a new :abbr:`RfQ (Request for Quotation)`, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Purchase app --> New`, which reveals a blank :abbr:`RfQ "
"(Request for Quotation)` form page. On this page, select "
"a :guilabel:`Vendor`, add a storable :guilabel:`Product`, and "
"click :guilabel:`Confirm Order`."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje novega :abbr:`PzP (Povpraševanje za ponudbo)` pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Nabava --> Novo`, kar prikaže prazen "
"obrazec :abbr:`PzP (Povpraševanje za ponudbo)`. Na tej strani "
"izberite :guilabel:`Dobavitelj`, dodajte :guilabel:`Izdelek`, ki ga je "
"mogoče shraniti, in kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi naročilo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:52
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Receipt` smart button will appear in the top right, and the "
"receipt will be associated with the purchase order. Clicking on "
"the :guilabel:`Receipt` smart button will show the receipt order."
msgstr ""
"Pameten gumb :guilabel:`Sprejem` se bo prikazal v zgornjem desnem kotu in "
"sprejem bo povezan z naročilom dobavitelju. Klik na pametni "
"gumb :guilabel:`Sprejem` bo prikazal naročilo za sprejem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:56
msgid "After confirming a purchase order, a Receipt smart button will appear."
msgstr "Po potrditvi naročila dobavitelju se prikaže pametni gumb Sprejem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:61
msgid "Process a receipt"
msgstr "Obdelava prejema"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:63
msgid ""
"Once the purchase order (PO) is confirmed, a receipt (`WH/IN`) operation is "
"generated and ready to process."
msgstr ""
"Ko je nakupno naročilo (PO) potrjeno, je ustvarjena operacija prejema (`WH/"
"IN`) in pripravljena na obdelavo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:66
msgid ""
"The receipt can be confirmed from the original purchase order form, or it "
"can be accessed by navigating to the :menuselection:`Inventory app`, and "
"locating the :guilabel:`Receipts` task card."
msgstr ""
"Prejem je mogoče potrditi iz izvirnega obrazca nakupnega naročila ali pa se "
"do njega dostopa tako, da se odpre aplikacija :menuselection:`Zaloga` in "
"poišče kartice opravila :guilabel:`Prejemi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:69
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`# To Process` button to reveal all incoming receipts to "
"process. Click the receipt associated with the previous purchase order."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Št. za obdelavo`, da se prikažejo vsi prejemi za "
"obdelavo. Kliknite prejem, povezan s prejšnjim nakupnim naročilom."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:72
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Validate` to validate the receipt, and move the product to "
"the destination location, :guilabel:`WH/Input`."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`, da potrdite prejem in premaknete izdelek na "
"ciljno lokacijo :guilabel:`WH/Input`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:75
msgid "Receipt operation for product being moved to WH/Input location."
msgstr "Operacija prejema za izdelek, ki se premika na lokacijo WH/Input."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:80
msgid "Process a transfer to Quality Control"
msgstr "Obdelava prenosa v kontrolo kakovosti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:82
msgid ""
"Once the receipt has been validated, an internal transfer operation to move "
"the product to quality control is ready to process."
msgstr ""
"Ko je prejem potrjen, je pripravljena operacija notranjega prenosa za premik "
"izdelka v kontrolo kakovosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:85
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Inventory Overview` in the breadcrumbs to navigate back to "
"the dashboard, and locate the :guilabel:`Internal Transfers` task card."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Pregled zaloge` v drobtinah, da se vrnete na nadzorno "
"ploščo, in poiščite kartico opravila :guilabel:`Notranji prenosi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:88
msgid ""
"Select the :guilabel:`# To Process` button to reveal all internal transfers "
"to process. Then, choose the internal transfer associated with the validated "
"receipt."
msgstr ""
"Izberite gumb :guilabel:`Št. za obdelavo`, da se prikažejo vsi notranji "
"prenosi za obdelavo. Nato izberite notranji prenos, povezan s potrjenim "
"prejemom."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:91
msgid ""
"Once ready, click :guilabel:`Validate` to complete the transfer, and move "
"the product from :guilabel:`WH/Input` to :guilabel:`WH/Quality Control`."
msgstr ""
"Ko je pripravljeno, kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`, da dokončate prenos in "
"premaknete izdelek iz :guilabel:`WH/Input` v :guilabel:`WH/Quality Control`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:94
msgid "Internal transfer for product being moved to quality control zone."
msgstr ""
"Notranji prenos za izdelek, ki se premika v območje kontrole kakovosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:99
msgid "Process a transfer to stock"
msgstr "Obdelava prenosa na zalogo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:101
msgid ""
"Once the internal transfer to move the product to quality control has been "
"validated, another internal transfer operation to move the product into "
"warehouse stock is ready to process."
msgstr ""
"Ko je notranji prenos za premik izdelka v kontrolo kakovosti potrjen, je "
"pripravljena še ena operacija notranjega prenosa za premik izdelka v "
"skladiščno zalogo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:104
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`YourCompany: Internal Transfers` in the breadcrumbs to "
"reveal the list of all internal transfers to process. Then, select the new "
"internal transfer to move the product from `WH/Quality Control` to `WH/"
"Stock`."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`VašePodjetje: Notranji prenosi` v drobtinah, da se "
"prikaže seznam vseh notranjih prenosov za obdelavo. Nato izberite novi "
"notranji prenos za premik izdelka iz `WH/Quality Control` v `WH/Stock`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:108
msgid ""
"Once ready, click :guilabel:`Validate` to complete the transfer, and move "
"the product from :guilabel:`WH/Quality Control` to :guilabel:`WH/Stock`."
msgstr ""
"Ko je pripravljeno, kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`, da dokončate prenos in "
"premaknete izdelek iz :guilabel:`WH/Quality Control` v :guilabel:`WH/Stock`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps.rst:111
msgid "Internal transfer for product being moved to warehouse stock."
msgstr "Notranji prenos za izdelek, ki se premika v skladiščno zalogo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:5
msgid ""
"A *storage category* is used with :doc:`putaway rules <putaway>` to assign a "
"storage location to incoming products while accounting for the capacity of "
"that location. Assigning categories to storage locations tells Odoo these "
"locations meet specific requirements, such as temperature or accessibility. "
"Odoo then evaluates these locations, based on defined capacity, and "
"recommends the best one on the warehouse transfer form."
msgstr ""
"*Kategorija shranjevanja* se uporablja skupaj s :doc:`pravili odlaganja "
"<putaway>`, da se dohodnim izdelkom dodeli lokacija shranjevanja ob "
"upoštevanju zmogljivosti te lokacije. Dodelitev kategorij lokacijam "
"shranjevanja pove Odooju, da te lokacije izpolnjujejo določene zahteve, kot "
"so temperatura ali dostopnost. Odoo nato ovrednoti te lokacije na podlagi "
"določene zmogljivosti in priporoči najboljšo na obrazcu skladiščnega prenosa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:11
msgid "Follow these steps to complete the setup:"
msgstr "Sledite tem korakom za dokončanje nastavitve:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:13
msgid ""
":ref:`Enable features in the settings <inventory/routes/enable-storage-"
"categories>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Povolte funkce v nastavení <inventory/routes/enable-storage-"
"categories>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:14
msgid ":ref:`Define capacity limitations <inventory/routes/define-storage>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Definujte omezení kapacity <inventory/routes/define-storage>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:15
msgid ""
"Assign a :ref:`category to storage locations <inventory/routes/assign-"
"location>`"
msgstr ""
"Dodelite :ref:`kategorijo skladiščnim lokacijam <inventory/routes/assign-"
"location>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:16
msgid ""
"Add the storage category as an attribute to a :ref:`putaway rule <inventory/"
"routes/set-putaway-attribute>`"
msgstr ""
"Dodajte kategorijo skladiščenja kot atribut :ref:`pravilu odlaganja "
"<inventory/routes/set-putaway-attribute>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:20
msgid ":doc:`putaway`"
msgstr ":doc:`putaway`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:25
msgid "Enable storage categories"
msgstr "Omogoči kategorije shranjevanja"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:27
msgid ""
"To enable storage categories, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`. Then, in the *Warehouse* section, ensure "
"the :guilabel:`Storage Locations` and :guilabel:`Multi-Step Routes` features "
"are enabled."
msgstr ""
"Za omogočitev kategorij shranjevanja pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve`. Nato v razdelku *Skladišče* "
"zagotovite, da sta omogočeni funkciji :guilabel:`Lokacije shranjevanja` "
"in :guilabel:`Večstopenjske poti`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:31
msgid ""
"To set capacities by :ref:`package type <inventory/routes/set-capacity-"
"package>`, also make sure :guilabel:`Packages` is enabled in the "
"*Operations* section. Click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Za nastavitev zmogljivosti po :ref:`vrsti paketa <inventory/routes/set-"
"capacity-package>` zagotovite tudi, da je v razdelku *Operacije* "
"omogočeno :guilabel:`Paketi`. Kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:34
msgid ""
"Enable Storage Locations and Multi-Step Routes to enable storage categories."
msgstr ""
"Povolte Skladové lokace a Vícekrokové trasy pro aktivaci skladových "
"kategorií."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:38
msgid "Storage location setup"
msgstr "Nastavitev lokacije shranjevanja"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:40
msgid ""
"Set up storage locations to work with the storage category. A parent "
"location must be set up, with child locations (or *sublocations*) assigned "
"to it. This is because the putaway rule's :ref:`Store to <inventory/routes/"
"set-putaway-attribute>` location will be set to the parent location, and "
"the :ref:`storage category <inventory/routes/assign-location>` will be set "
"to the child location."
msgstr ""
"Nastavite lokacije shranjevanja za delo s kategorijo shranjevanja. Nastaviti "
"je treba nadrejeno lokacijo s podrejenimi lokacijami (ali *podlokacijami*), "
"dodeljenimi njej. To je zato, ker bo lokacija :ref:`Shrani v <inventory/"
"routes/set-putaway-attribute>` pravila odlaganja nastavljena na nadrejeno "
"lokacijo, :ref:`kategorija shranjevanja <inventory/routes/assign-location>` "
"pa bo nastavljena na podrejeno lokacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:45
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Locations`."
msgstr ""
"Pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> Lokacije`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:47
msgid ""
"First, set up a parent location. This can be as simple as the default `WH/"
"Stock` location. Alternatively, create a new parent location by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`New` button on the :guilabel:`Locations` page. On this parent "
"location form, specify a :guilabel:`Location Name` and :guilabel:`Parent "
"Location`. Select :guilabel:`Internal` as the :guilabel:`Location Type`."
msgstr ""
"Najprej nastavite nadrejeno lokacijo. To je lahko tako preprosto kot "
"privzeta lokacija `WH/Stock`. Alternativno ustvarite novo nadrejeno lokacijo "
"s klikom na gumb :guilabel:`Novo` na strani :guilabel:`Lokacije`. Na tem "
"obrazcu nadrejene lokacije navedite :guilabel:`Ime lokacije` "
"in :guilabel:`Nadrejeno lokacijo`. Izberite :guilabel:`Notranja` "
"kot :guilabel:`Vrsta lokacije`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:52
msgid ""
"Then, create *sublocations* of this parent location by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`New` button. On the location form, specify "
"a :guilabel:`Location Name`, and set the :guilabel:`Parent Location` to the "
"parent location that was just created."
msgstr ""
"Nato ustvarite *podlokacije* te nadrejene lokacije s klikom na "
"gumb :guilabel:`Novo`. Na obrazcu lokacije navedite :guilabel:`Ime lokacije` "
"in nastavite :guilabel:`Nadrejeno lokacijo` na nadrejeno lokacijo, ki je "
"bila pravkar ustvarjena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:57
msgid ""
"A beverage company stores all of its cans of lemonade on pallets in one "
"section of its warehouse."
msgstr ""
"Podjetje za pijače shranjuje vse svoje pločevinke limonade na paletah v enem "
"delu skladišča."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:59
msgid ""
"First, they create a location named `Pallets` in the `WH/Stock` location. "
"Then, they create two sublocations, named `PAL1` and `PAL2`. Both have `WH/"
"Stock/Pallets` set as the parent location."
msgstr ""
"Najprej ustvarijo lokacijo z imenom `Palete` v lokaciji `WH/Stock`. Nato "
"ustvarijo dve podlokaciji z imeni `PAL1` in `PAL2`. Obe imata nastavljeno "
"`WH/Stock/Palete` kot nadrejeno lokacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:62
msgid "Create a sublocation."
msgstr "Ustvarite podlokacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:68
msgid "Define storage category limitations"
msgstr "Določite omejitve kategorije shranjevanja"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:70
msgid ""
"Before a storage category is applied to locations, it must be configured "
"with specific limitations in order to decide the optimal storage location. "
"Capacity can be limited by weight, product, and package type."
msgstr ""
"Preden se kategorija shranjevanja uporabi za lokacije, jo je treba "
"konfigurirati z določenimi omejitvami, da se odloči za optimalno lokacijo "
"shranjevanja. Zmogljivost je lahko omejena po teži, izdelku in vrsti paketa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:74
msgid ""
"To create a storage category, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Storage Categories`, and click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje kategorije skladiščenja pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> Kategorije skladiščenja` in "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:77
msgid ""
"On the storage category form, type a name for the category in "
"the :guilabel:`Storage Category` field."
msgstr ""
"Na obrazcu kategorije skladiščenja vnesite ime kategorije v "
"polje :guilabel:`Kategorija skladiščenja`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:81
msgid ""
"Weight limits can be combined with capacity by package or product (e.g. a "
"maximum of one hundred products with a total weight of two hundred "
"kilograms)."
msgstr ""
"Omejitve teže je mogoče kombinirati s kapaciteto po paketih ali izdelkih "
"(npr. največ sto izdelkov s skupno težo dvesto kilogramov)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:84
msgid ""
"While it is possible to limit capacity by product and package type at the "
"same location, it may be more practical to store items in different amounts "
"across various locations, as shown in the :ref:`limit capacity by package "
"<inventory/routes/set-capacity-package>` example."
msgstr ""
"Čeprav je mogoče omejiti zmogljivost po izdelku in vrsti paketa na isti "
"lokaciji, je morda bolj praktično shranjevati predmete v različnih količinah "
"na različnih lokacijah, kot je prikazano v primeru :ref:`omejitve "
"zmogljivosti po paketu <inventory/routes/set-capacity-package>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:88
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Allow New Product` field defines when the location is "
"considered available to store a product:"
msgstr ""
"Polje :guilabel:`Dovoli nov izdelek` določa, kdaj se lokacija šteje za "
"razpoložljivo za skladiščenje izdelka:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:91
msgid ""
":guilabel:`If location is empty`: a product can be added there only if the "
"location is empty."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Če je lokacija prazna`: izdelek je mogoče dodati le, če je "
"lokacija prazna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:92
msgid ""
":guilabel:`If products are the same`: a product can be added there only if "
"the same product is already there."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Če so izdelki enaki`: izdelek je mogoče dodati le, če je tam že "
"enak izdelek."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Allow mixed products`: several different products can be stored "
"in this location at the same time."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dovoli mešane izdelke`: več različnih izdelkov je lahko hkrati "
"shranjenih na tej lokaciji."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:98
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:151
msgid ""
"Odoo does **not** automatically split quantities across multiple storage "
"locations. If an incoming receipt contains several units or packages and the "
"first recommended location exceeds its capacity, Odoo still routes all items "
"to that same location instead of selecting another one with available space."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **ne deli** samodejno količin po več lokacijah skladiščenja. Če "
"prehodni prejem vsebuje več enot ali paketov in prva priporočena lokacija "
"preseže svojo zmogljivost, Odoo vse predmete še vedno usmeri na isto "
"lokacijo namesto da bi izbral drugo z razpoložljivim prostorom."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:103
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:156
msgid ""
"*(Example: If a location can hold 10 units and 12 units arrive, all 12 are "
"still assigned to that location.)*"
msgstr ""
"*(Primer: Če lahko lokacija sprejme 10 enot in prispe 12 enot, vseh 12 "
"ostane dodeljenih tej lokaciji.)*"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:107
msgid "Limit capacity by weight"
msgstr "Omejitev zmogljivosti po teži"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:109
msgid ""
"A maximum product weight can be set in the :guilabel:`Max Weight` field. "
"This limit applies to each location assigned this storage category. If a "
"product weight is defined, the value must be set to greater than `0`."
msgstr ""
"Največjo težo izdelka je mogoče nastaviti v polju :guilabel:`Največja teža`. "
"Ta omejitev velja za vsako lokacijo, ki ji je dodeljena ta kategorija "
"shranjevanja. Če je teža izdelka določena, mora biti vrednost nastavljena na "
"več kot `0`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:114
msgid "Limit capacity by product"
msgstr "Omejitev zmogljivosti po izdelku"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:116
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Capacity by Product` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a Line` to "
"enter a product, and set the maximum capacity that should be stored at each "
"location in the :guilabel:`Quantity` field."
msgstr ""
"Na zavihku :guilabel:`Capacity by Product` kliknite :guilabel:`Add a Line`, "
"da vnesete izdelek, in v polju :guilabel:`Quantity` nastavite največjo "
"zmogljivost, ki naj bo shranjena na posamezni lokaciji."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:120
msgid ""
"To ensure only a maximum of five `Large Cabinets` and two `Corner Desk Right "
"Sit` are stored at a single storage location, specify those amounts in "
"the :guilabel:`Capacity by Product` tab."
msgstr ""
"Da zagotovite, da sta na eni lokaciji shranjena največ pet `Large Cabinets` "
"in dve `Corner Desk Right Sit`, navedite te količine na "
"zavihku :guilabel:`Capacity by Product`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:123
msgid "Show storage category limiting by product count."
msgstr "Prikaz kategorije skladiščenja z omejitvijo po številu izdelkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:129
msgid "Limit capacity by package type"
msgstr "Omejitev zmogljivosti po vrsti paketa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:131
msgid ""
"Limiting capacity by :doc:`package <../../product_management/configure/"
"package>` makes it possible to enforce real-time storage capacity checks "
"based on package type (e.g., crates, bins, boxes, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Omejevanje zmogljivosti po :doc:`paketu <../../product_management/configure/"
"package>` omogoča izvajanje preverjanj zmogljivosti skladiščenja v realnem "
"času na podlagi vrste pakiranja (npr. zaboji, posode, škatle itd.)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:135
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add a line` to add a :ref:`package type <inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/package-type>` to the storage category. Alternatively, "
"create a new package type on the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab of the product "
"form (in the :guilabel:`Packaging` section), or from the :guilabel:`Product "
"Packagings` page."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Add a line`, da dodate :ref:`vrsto paketa <inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/package-type>` v kategorijo skladiščenja. Lahko pa "
"ustvarite novo vrsto paketa na zavihku :guilabel:`Inventory` obrazca izdelka "
"(v razdelku :guilabel:`Packaging`) ali na strani :guilabel:`Product "
"Packagings`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:141
msgid ""
"To help create putaway rules for pallet-stored items, create the `High "
"frequency pallets` storage category."
msgstr ""
"Za pomoč pri ustvarjanju pravil za odlaganje za artikel, shranjen na "
"paletah, ustvarite kategorijo skladiščenja `High frequency pallets`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:144
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Capacity by Package` tab, specify the number of packages "
"for the designated :guilabel:`Package Type`, and set a maximum of `2.00` "
"`Pallets` for a specific location."
msgstr ""
"Na zavihku :guilabel:`Kapaciteta po paketih` določite število paketov za "
"določeno :guilabel:`Vrsto paketa` in nastavite največ `2.00` `Pallets` za "
"določeno lokacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:147
msgid "Create a storage category."
msgstr "Ustvarite kategorijo skladiščenja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:162
msgid "Assign storage locations"
msgstr "Dodelitev lokacij skladiščenja"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:164
msgid ""
"After the storage category is created, it can be assigned to the "
"sublocations. Go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> "
"Locations`, and open the desired sublocation. Then, select the created "
"category in the :guilabel:`Storage Category` field."
msgstr ""
"Ko je kategorija skladiščenja ustvarjena, jo je mogoče dodeliti "
"podlokacijam. Pojdite na :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> "
"Locations` in odprite želeno podlokacijo. Nato v polju :guilabel:`Storage "
"Category` izberite ustvarjeno kategorijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:169
msgid ""
"Assign the `High frequency pallets` storage category (which limits pallets "
"stored at any location to two pallets) to the `WH/Stock/Pallets/PAL1` "
"sublocation."
msgstr ""
"Dodelite kategorijo skladiščenja `High frequency pallets` (ki na katerikoli "
"lokaciji omejuje shranjene palete na dve paleti) podlokaciji `WH/Stock/"
"Pallets/PAL1`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:172
msgid ""
"When a Storage Category is created, it can be linked to a warehouse location."
msgstr ""
"Ko je kategorija skladiščenja ustvarjena, jo je mogoče povezati z lokacijo "
"skladišča."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:175
msgid ""
"Repeat this step for all sublocations to which the storage category should "
"apply."
msgstr ""
"Ponovite ta korak za vse podlokacije, za katere naj velja kategorija "
"skladiščenja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:178
msgid ""
"On the storage category form, the :icon:`oi-arrows-v` :guilabel:`Locations` "
"smart button shows which storage locations the category has been assigned to."
msgstr ""
"Na obrazcu kategorije skladiščenja pametno gumb :icon:`oi-arrows-"
"v` :guilabel:`Locations` prikazuje, katerim lokacijam skladiščenja je bila "
"kategorija dodeljena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:184
msgid "Create a putaway rule"
msgstr "Ustvarjanje pravila za odlaganje"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:186
msgid ""
"With the :ref:`storage category <inventory/routes/define-storage>` "
"and :ref:`locations <inventory/routes/assign-location>` set up, create "
"the :doc:`putaway rule <putaway>` by navigating to :menuselection:`Inventory "
"app --> Configuration --> Putaway Rules`."
msgstr ""
"Ko sta :ref:`kategorija skladiščenja <inventory/routes/define-storage>` "
"in :ref:`lokacije <inventory/routes/assign-location>` nastavljene, "
"ustvarite :doc:`pravilo za odlaganje <putaway>` tako, da se pomaknete "
"na :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Putaway Rules`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:190
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`New` button to create the putaway rule. Specify a "
"location in the :guilabel:`Store to` field."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite gumb :guilabel:`New`, da ustvarite pravilo za odlaganje. V "
"polju :guilabel:`Store to` navedite lokacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:193
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Sublocation` field to specify that you want to use a "
"storage category on the sublocations of the :guilabel:`Store to` field:"
msgstr ""
"Uporabite polje :guilabel:`Sublocation`, da navedete, da želite uporabiti "
"kategorijo skladiščenja za podlokacije polja :guilabel:`Store to`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:196
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Last Used`: The last location that had a move associated with it "
"for that product or product category is used. If there is no last location "
"used, the destination is whatever is specified in the :guilabel:`Store to` "
"field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nazadnje uporabljeno`: Uporabi se zadnja lokacija, ki je imela "
"povezan premik za ta izdelek ali kategorijo izdelkov. Če ni zadnje "
"uporabljene lokacije, je cilj tisto, kar je določeno v "
"polju :guilabel:`Shrani v`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:199
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Closest Location`: The locations specified as part of the storage "
"category are used. A storage category is mandatory in the :guilabel:`Having "
"Category` field. The locations in the storage category must be sublocations "
"of the location in the :guilabel:`Store to` field. If the closest locations "
"in the storage category are full, the :guilabel:`Store to` location is used."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Closest Location`: uporabljajo se lokacije, navedene kot del "
"kategorije skladiščenja. V polju :guilabel:`Having Category` je obvezna "
"kategorija skladiščenja. Lokacije v kategoriji skladiščenja morajo biti "
"podlokacije lokacije v polju :guilabel:`Store to`. Če so najbližje lokacije "
"v kategoriji skladiščenja polne, se uporabi lokacija :guilabel:`Store to`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:205
msgid ""
"Continuing the example from above, the `High frequency pallets` storage "
"category is assigned to the putaway rule directing pallets of lemonade to "
"locations with the `High frequency pallets` storage category :ref:`assigned "
"to them <inventory/routes/assign-location>`."
msgstr ""
"Nadaljujoč zgornji primer je kategorija skladiščenja `High frequency "
"pallets` dodeljena pravilu odlaganja, ki usmerja palet limonade na lokacije "
"z kategorijo skladiščenja `High frequency pallets` :ref:`dodeljeno njim "
"<inventory/routes/assign-location>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:209
msgid "Storage Categories used in putaway rules."
msgstr "Kategorije shranjevanja, uporabljene v pravilih odlaganja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:213
msgid ""
"If products are not routing to secondary locations for a storage category "
"and a product weight is defined, verify that the storage "
"category's :guilabel:`Max Weight` value is set to a number greater than `0`."
msgstr ""
"Če izdelki niso usmerjeni na sekundarne lokacije za kategorijo shranjevanja "
"in je opredeljena teža izdelka, preverite, ali je "
"vrednost :guilabel:`Največja teža` kategorije shranjevanja nastavljena na "
"število, večje od `0`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:218
msgid "Use case: limit capacity by package"
msgstr "Primer uporabe: omejitev kapacitete po paketih"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:220
msgid ""
"To limit the capacity of a storage location by a specific number of "
"packages, :ref:`create a storage category with a Capacity By Package "
"<inventory/routes/set-capacity-package>`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite omejiti kapaciteto lokacije skladiščenja na določeno število "
"paketov, :ref:`ustvarite kategorijo skladiščenja s kapaciteto po paketih "
"<inventory/routes/set-capacity-package>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:223
msgid ""
"Continuing the examples from above, the `High frequency pallets` storage "
"category is assigned to the `PAL1` and `PAL2` locations."
msgstr ""
"Nadaljujoč zgornje primere je kategorija skladiščenja `High frequency "
"pallets` dodeljena lokacijam `PAL1` in `PAL2`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:226
msgid ""
"Then, :ref:`putaway rules <inventory/routes/putaway-rule>` are set, so that "
"any pallets received in the warehouse are directed to be stored in `PAL1` "
"and `PAL2` locations."
msgstr ""
"Nato so :ref:`nastavljena pravila odlaganja <inventory/routes/putaway-"
"rule>`, tako da so vse palete, prejete v skladišču, usmerjene v shranjevanje "
"na lokacijah `PAL1` in `PAL2`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:229
msgid ""
"Depending on the number of pallets on-hand at each of the storage locations, "
"when two pallets of lemonade cans is received, the following scenarios "
"happen:"
msgstr ""
"Odvisno od števila palet na zalogi na posamezni lokaciji skladiščenja, ko "
"prejmete dve paleti pločevink limonade, se zgodijo naslednji scenariji:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:232
msgid ""
"If `PAL1` and `PAL2` are empty, the pallet is redirected to `WH/Stock/"
"Pallets/PAL1`."
msgstr ""
"Če sta `PAL1` in `PAL2` prazni, je paleta preusmerjena na `WH/Stock/Pallets/"
"PAL1`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:233
msgid "If `PAL1` is full, the pallet is redirected to `WH/Stock/Pallets/PAL2`."
msgstr "Če je `PAL1` polna, je paleta preusmerjena na `WH/Stock/Pallets/PAL2`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:234
msgid ""
"If `PAL1` and `PAL2` are full, the pallet is redirected to `WH/Stock/"
"Pallets`."
msgstr ""
"Če sta `PAL1` in `PAL2` polni, je paleta preusmerjena na `WH/Stock/Pallets`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:235
msgid ""
"If `PAL1` is partially full (for example, with one pallet), Odoo treats more "
"than one received pallet as a single pallet on the receipt. You must "
"manually separate the two pallets into separate storage locations. Click "
"the :guilabel:`Details` link to the right of the :guilabel:`Units` field, "
"and then in the :guilabel:`Detailed Operations` box, click :guilabel:`Add a "
"line`. Finally, split the receipt by quantity into separate locations, then "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Če je `PAL1` delno poln (na primer z eno paleto), Odoo obravnava več kot eno "
"prejeto paleto kot eno paleto na prejemnici. Dve paleti morate ročno ločiti "
"na ločene lokacije shranjevanja. Kliknite povezavo :guilabel:`Podrobnosti` "
"na desni strani polja :guilabel:`Enote`, nato v polju :guilabel:`Podrobne "
"operacije` kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj vrstico`. Nazadnje razdelite prejemnico "
"po količini na ločene lokacije, nato kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category.rst:241
msgid ""
"Update the Detailed Operations box to route pallets to the correct locations."
msgstr ""
"Posodobite polje Podrobne operacije, da usmerite palete na pravilne lokacije."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:3
msgid "Routes and push/pull rules"
msgstr "Poti in pravila potiskanja/vlečenja"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:16
msgid ""
"*Routes* in Odoo control the movement of products between different "
"locations, whether internal or external, using a combination of push and "
"pull rules. These rules help automate the movement of products based on "
"specific conditions. They can be configured to create advanced use cases "
"such as:"
msgstr ""
"*Poti* v sistemu Odoo nadzorujejo gibanje izdelkov med različnimi "
"lokacijami, bodisi notranjimi bodisi zunanjimi, z uporabo kombinacije "
"potisnih in vlečnih pravil. Ta pravila pomagajo avtomatizirati premik "
"izdelkov na podlagi določenih pogojev. Nastavite jih lahko tako, da "
"ustvarijo napredne primere uporabe, kot so:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:20
msgid "Managing product manufacturing chains."
msgstr "Upravljanje proizvodnih verig izdelkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:21
msgid "Managing default locations per product."
msgstr "Upravljanje privzetih lokacij na posamezen izdelek."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:22
msgid ""
"Defining warehouse movement for quality control, after-sales services, or "
"supplier returns."
msgstr ""
"Določanje skladiščnih premikov za nadzor kakovosti, poprodajne storitve ali "
"vračila dobaviteljem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:23
msgid "Helping rental management automate return moves for rented products."
msgstr ""
"Pomoč pri upravljanju izposoje pri avtomatizaciji premikov vračil "
"izposojenih izdelkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:26
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorials: Push & Pull Rules <https://www.youtube.com/watch?"
"v=qkhDUezyZuc>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Videoposnetki Odoo: Pravila potiskanja in vlečenja <https://www.youtube.com/"
"watch?v=qkhDUezyZuc>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:27
msgid ":doc:`Standard routes in Odoo <../daily_operations>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Standardne poti v Odoo <../daily_operations>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:34
msgid ""
"To access routes and select them on products, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings`. In the "
"*Warehouse* section, ensure the :guilabel:`Multi-Step Routes` "
"and :guilabel:`Storage Locations` features are enabled, then "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Za dostop do poti in njihovo izbiro na izdelkih pojdite v "
":menuselection:`Zaloga --> Nastavitve --> Nastavitve`. V razdelku "
"*Skladišče* poskrbite, da sta omogočeni funkciji :guilabel:`Večstopenjske "
"poti` in :guilabel:`Lokacije shrambe`, nato pa kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:38
msgid ""
"Additionally, routes are generated depending on the warehouse's reception "
"and delivery configurations. To access these settings, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Warehouses` and "
"select the relevant warehouse. In the *Warehouse Configuration* tab, enable "
"the desired inbound and outbound flows in the :guilabel:`Incoming Shipments` "
"and :guilabel:`Outgoing Shipments` fields."
msgstr ""
"Poleg tega se poti ustvarjajo glede na konfiguracijo prejema in dobave "
"skladišča. Za dostop do teh nastavitev pojdite v :menuselection:`Zaloga --> "
"Nastavitve --> Skladišča` in izberite ustrezno skladišče. V zavihku "
"*Konfiguracija skladišča* omogočite želene vhodne in izhodne poteke v poljih "
":guilabel:`Prejete pošiljke` in :guilabel:`Izhodne pošiljke`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:45
msgid ""
"To use 1-step, 2-step, or 3-step receptions or deliveries, only "
"the :guilabel:`Incoming Shipments` and :guilabel:`Outgoing Shipments` fields "
"should be set. Do **not** create or modify rules to set up these flows."
msgstr ""
"Za uporabo 1-stopenjskih, 2-stopenjskih ali 3-stopenjskih prejemov ali dobav "
"je treba nastaviti le polji :guilabel:`Prejete pošiljke` in "
":guilabel:`Izhodne pošiljke`. Za nastavitev teh potekov **ne** ustvarjajte "
"ali spreminjajte pravil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:50
msgid ":doc:`../../warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:55
msgid "Standard warehouse routes"
msgstr "Standardne skladiščne poti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:57
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically generates warehouse routes based on "
"the :guilabel:`Incoming Shipments` and :guilabel:`Outgoing Shipments` fields "
"of the warehouse. These routes automatically apply to every product in the "
"warehouse, and do **not** need to be :ref:`manually applied <inventory/"
"routes/apply>` on individual products."
msgstr ""
"Odoo samodejno ustvari skladiščne poti na podlagi polj :guilabel:`Prejete "
"pošiljke` in :guilabel:`Izhodne pošiljke` skladišča. Te poti se samodejno "
"uporabijo za vsak izdelek v skladišču in jih **ni** treba :ref:`ročno "
"uporabiti <inventory/routes/apply>` na posameznih izdelkih."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:62
msgid ""
"Depending on the route, products move through the following warehouse "
"locations, where `<WH>` is the warehouse's short name:"
msgstr ""
"Glede na pot se izdelki premikajo skozi naslednje lokacije skladišča, pri "
"čemer je `<WH>` kratko ime skladišča:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:65
msgid "|ST|: The main stock location, used by all flows."
