"naslovom :guilabel:`Operacije` aktivirajte možnosti :guilabel:`Pakirne "
"enote` in :guilabel:`Serijski, valovni in grozdni prenosi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/cluster.rst:54
msgid "Activate *Packages* and *Batch Transfers* features in the settings."
msgstr ""
"Aktivirajte funkciji *Pakirne enote* in *Serijski prenosi* v nastavitvah."

