#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/closest_location.rst:76
msgid ""
"To see how the closest location removal strategy works, consider the "
"following example, featuring the popular product, `iPhone Charger`, which is "
"stored in `WH/Stock/Shelf A/Pallets`, `WH/Stock/Shelf A/Rack 1`, and `WH/"
"Stock/Shelf A/Rack2`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite videti, kako deluje strategija odstranjevanja najbližje lokacije, "
"si oglejte naslednji primer s priljubljenim izdelkom `iPhone Charger`, ki je "
"shranjen v `WH/Stock/Shelf A/Pallets`, `WH/Stock/Shelf A/Rack 1` in `WH/"
"Stock/Shelf A/Rack2`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/closest_location.rst:80
msgid ""
"Fifteen, five, and thirty units are in stock at each respective location."
msgstr "Petnajst, pet in trideset enot je na zalogi na posamezni lokaciji."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/closest_location.rst:83
msgid ""
"To check the on-hand stock at each storage location, open "
"the :guilabel:`Locations` report by clicking :menuselection:`Inventory app --"
"> Reporting --> Locations`. Filter by :guilabel:`On Hand`, as well as "
"product (if necessary)."
msgstr ""
"Za preverjanje zaloge na posamezni skladiščni lokaciji odprite "
"poročilo :guilabel:`Lokacije` tako, da kliknete :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Zaloga --> Poročanje --> Lokacije`. Filtrirajte po :guilabel:`Na zalogi` in "
"po izdelku (če je potrebno)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/closest_location.rst:87
msgid "Show on-hand stock at all locations."
msgstr "Prikaži razpoložljivo zalogo na vseh lokacijah."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/closest_location.rst:90
msgid ""
"Create a :ref:`delivery order <inventory/delivery/one-step>` for eighteen "
"units of the `iPhone Charger` by navigating to the :menuselection:`Sales "
"app` and creating a new quotation."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarite :ref:`dobavnico <inventory/delivery/one-step>` za osemnajst enot "
"izdelka `iPhone Charger` tako, da se pomaknete v :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Prodaja` in ustvarite novo ponudbo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/closest_location.rst:93
msgid ""
"After adding the products, clicking :guilabel:`Confirm` creates a delivery "
"order that reserves items stored at the closest location, using the removal "
"strategy."
msgstr ""
"Po dodajanju izdelkov klik na :guilabel:`Potrdi` ustvari dobavnico, ki "
"rezervira artikle, shranjene na najbližji lokaciji, s pomočjo strategije "
"odstranjevanja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/closest_location.rst:96
msgid ""
"For more details about *where* the units were picked, click "
"the :guilabel:`Details` link, located on the far right. Doing so opens "
"the :guilabel:`Detailed Operations` pop-up window that displays how the "
"reserved items were picked, according to the removal strategy."
msgstr ""
"Za več podrobnosti o tem, *od kod* so bile enote pobrane, kliknite "
"povezavo :guilabel:`Podrobnosti`, ki se nahaja na skrajni desni. To odpre "
"pojavno okno :guilabel:`Podrobne operacije`, ki prikazuje, kako so bili "
"rezervirani artikli pobrani glede na strategijo odstranjevanja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/closest_location.rst:100
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Detailed Operations` pop-up window, the :guilabel:`Pick "
"From` field displays where the quantities to fulfill the :guilabel:`Demand` "
"are picked. All fifteen of the units stored at the closest location, `WH/"
"Stock/Shelf A/Pallets`, are picked first. The remaining three units are then "
"selected from the second closest location, `WH/Stock/Shelf A/Rack 1`."
msgstr ""
"V pojavnem oknu :guilabel:`Podrobne operacije` polje :guilabel:`Poberi iz` "
"prikazuje, od kod so pobrane količine za "
"izpolnitev :guilabel:`Povpraševanja`. Najprej je pobranih vseh petnajst "
"enot, shranjenih na najbližji lokaciji `WH/Stock/Shelf A/Pallets`. Preostale "
"tri enote so nato izbrane z druge najbližje lokacije `WH/Stock/Shelf A/Rack "
"1`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/closest_location.rst:105
msgid "Display Pick From quantities for the order for iPhone chargers."
msgstr "Prikaz količin v polju Poberi iz za naročilo polnilcev za iPhone."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/closest_location.rst:109
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/least_packages.rst:133
msgid ":doc:`About removal strategies <../removal_strategies>`"
msgstr ":doc:`O strategijah odstranjevanja <../removal_strategies>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/closest_location.rst:110
msgid ""
":ref:`Set up removal strategy <inventory/warehouses_storage/removal-config>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Nastavite strategijo odstranjevanja <inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"removal-config>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:3
msgid "FEFO removal"
msgstr "Odstranjevanje FEFO"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *First Expired, First Out* (FEFO) removal strategy targets products for "
"removal based on their assigned *removal dates*."
msgstr ""
"Strategija odstranjevanja *First Expired, First Out* (FEFO) izbira izdelke "
"za odstranitev na podlagi dodeljenih datumov odstranitve."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:8
msgid ""
"Products **must** be removed from inventory before their removal date, which "
"is set as a certain number of days before the product's *expiration date*."
msgstr ""
"Izdelke je **treba** odstraniti iz zaloge pred njihovim *datumom "
"odstranitve*, ki je določen kot določeno število dni pred *datumom poteka* "
"izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:11
msgid ""
"The expiration date of a product is determined by adding the date the "
"product was received to the number of days specified in "
"the :guilabel:`Expiration Date` field of the product form."
msgstr ""
"Datum poteka izdelka se določi tako, da datumu prejema izdelka prištejemo "
"število dni, navedeno v polju :guilabel:`Datum poteka` v obrazcu izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:14
msgid ""
"The removal date takes this expiration date, and subtracts the number of "
"days specified in the :guilabel:`Removal Date` field of the product form."
msgstr ""
"Datum odstranitve vzame ta datum poteka in odšteje število dni, navedeno v "
"polju :guilabel:`Datum odstranitve` v obrazcu izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:22
msgid ""
"Lots and serial numbers differentiate identical products and track "
"information like arrival or expiration dates. To enable this feature, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings`. Under "
"the :guilabel:`Traceability` heading, check the box beside :guilabel:`Lots & "
"Serial Numbers`. After :guilabel:`Lots & Serial Numbers` is enabled, "
"the :guilabel:`Expiration Dates` feature appears. Enable it to track "
"expiration dates, best-before dates, removal dates, and alert dates."
msgstr ""
"Serije in serijske številke razlikujejo enake izdelke in sledijo "
"informacijam, kot so datumi prihoda ali poteka. Za omogočitev te funkcije "
"pojdite na :menuselection:`Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve`. Pod "
"naslovom :guilabel:`Sledljivost` označite polje poleg :guilabel:`Serije in "
"serijske številke`. Ko je :guilabel:`Serije in serijske številke` omogočeno, "
"se pojavi funkcija :guilabel:`Datum poteka`. Omogočite jo za sledenje "
"datumov poteka, datumov uporabe, datumov odstranitve in datumov opozoril."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:29
msgid ""
"Enable Lots & Serial Numbers and Expiration Dates in the Inventory settings."
msgstr ""
"Omogočite serije in serijske številke ter datume poteka v nastavitvah zaloge."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:33
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fifo.rst:30
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/lifo.rst:34
msgid "Enable tracking by lots or serial numbers"
msgstr "Omogoči sledenje po serijah ali serijskih številkah"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:35
msgid ""
"Next, ensure the intended product is tracked by lots or serial numbers by "
"navigating to the product form through :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Products --> Products` and selecting the desired product. On the product "
"form, open the :guilabel:`General Information` tab. In "
"the :guilabel:`Tracking` field, select either :guilabel:`By Unique Serial "
"Number` or :guilabel:`By Lots`."
msgstr ""
"Nato zagotovite, da se želenemu izdelku sledi s serijami ali serijskimi "
"številkami, tako da odprete obrazec izdelka prek :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Inventar --> Izdelki --> Izdelki` in izberete želeni izdelek. Na obrazcu "
"izdelka odprite zavihek :guilabel:`Splošni podatki`. V polju "
":guilabel:`Sledenje` izberite bodisi :guilabel:`Po edinstveni serijski "
"številki` ali :guilabel:`Po serijah`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:41
msgid "Enable tracking by lot."
msgstr "Omogoči sledenje po serijah."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:45
msgid "Set FEFO dates"
msgstr "Nastavitev datumov FEFO"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:47
msgid ""
"Next, set the dates for the product. In the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab of the "
"product form, under the :guilabel:`Traceability` heading, select "
"the :guilabel:`Expiration Date` checkbox. The :guilabel:`Dates` heading "
"appears. Specify the :guilabel:`Expiration Date`, :guilabel:`Best Before "
"Date`, :guilabel:`Removal Date`, and :guilabel:`Alert Date` settings for the "
"product. See :ref:`Removal date <inventory/warehouses_storage/removal-date>` "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"Nato določite datume za izdelek. V zavihku :guilabel:`Inventar` na obrazcu "
"izdelka, pod naslovom :guilabel:`Sledljivost`, izberite potrditveno polje "
":guilabel:`Datum izteka roka`. Prikaže se naslov :guilabel:`Datumi`. "
"Določite nastavitve za :guilabel:`Datum izteka roka`, :guilabel:`Datum "
"minimalne trajnosti`, :guilabel:`Datum odstranitve` in :guilabel:`Datum "
"opozorila` za izdelek. Za več informacij glejte :ref:`Datum odstranitve "
"<inventory/warehouses_storage/removal-date>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:54
msgid "Assign lots and serial numbers"
msgstr "Dodelite serije in serijske številke"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:56
msgid ""
"After enabling the features, assign lot or serial numbers to products using "
"an :doc:`inventory adjustment <../../warehouses_storage/inventory_management/"
"count_products>` or during :ref:`product reception <inventory/"
"product_management/assign-lots>`."
msgstr ""
"Po omogočitvi funkcij dodelite serije ali serijske številke izdelkom s "
"pomočjo :doc:`prilagoditve zaloge <../../warehouses_storage/"
"inventory_management/count_products>` ali med :ref:`prejemom izdelkov "
"<inventory/product_management/assign-lots>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:61
msgid "Set removal strategies"
msgstr "Nastavite strategije odstranjevanja"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:63
msgid ""
"After lot or serial numbers have been assigned, set the removal strategy on "
"the storage location or product category."
msgstr ""
"Ko so serije ali serijske številke dodeljene, nastavite strategijo "
"odstranitve na lokaciji skladiščenja ali kategoriji izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:66
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fifo.rst:53
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/lifo.rst:57
msgid "Find the Locations or Categories from the Configuration menu."
msgstr "Poiščite lokacije ali kategorije v meniju Konfiguracija."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:70
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fifo.rst:57
msgid "On the location"
msgstr "Na lokaciji"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:72
msgid ""
"Open :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Locations`. Select "
"the desired location. On the location form, under the :guilabel:`Logistics` "
"heading, select :guilabel:`First Expiry First Out (FEFO)` from the list of "
"removal strategies."
msgstr ""
"Odprite :menuselection:`aplikacija Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> Lokacije`. "
"Izberite želeno lokacijo. Na obrazcu lokacije pod "
"naslovom :guilabel:`Logistika` izberite :guilabel:`Prvi poteče, prvi ven "
"(FEFO)` s seznama strategij odstranitve."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:76
msgid "Set First Expiry First Out as the location removal strategy."
msgstr ""
"Nastavite Prvi poteče, prvi ven kot strategijo odstranitve za lokacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:80
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fifo.rst:67
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/least_packages.rst:74
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/lifo.rst:73
msgid "On the product category"
msgstr "Na kategoriji izdelka"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:82
msgid ""
"Configure removal strategies on product categories by going "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Categories` and "
"selecting the intended product category. Next, in the :guilabel:`Force "
"Removal Strategy` field, specify :guilabel:`First Expiry First Out (FEFO)`."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurirajte strategije odstranitve na kategorijah izdelkov tako, da "
"greste na :menuselection:`aplikacija Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> "
"Kategorije` in izberete želeno kategorijo izdelka. Nato v "
"polju :guilabel:`Vsili strategijo odstranitve` določite :guilabel:`Prvi "
"poteče, prvi ven (FEFO)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:86
msgid "Set First Expiry First Out as the product category removal strategy."
msgstr ""
"Nastavite Prvi poteče, prvi ven kot strategijo odstranitve za kategorijo "
"izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:90
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fifo.rst:77
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/least_packages.rst:84
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/lifo.rst:84
msgid ""
"When there are different removal strategies applied on both the location and "
"product category for a product, the value set on the :guilabel:`Force "
"Removal Strategy` field set on a product category form is applied as top "
"priority."
msgstr ""
"Ko so različne strategije odstranitve uporabljene tako na lokaciji kot na "
"kategoriji izdelka za izdelek, se kot prednostna uporabi vrednost, "
"nastavljena v polju :guilabel:`Vsili strategijo odstranitve` na obrazcu "
"kategorije izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:97
msgid "Removal date"
msgstr "Datum odstranitve"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:99
msgid ""
"Before setting this date, ensure that the :guilabel:`Tracking` property "
"field is set to :guilabel:`By Lots` or :guilabel:`By Unique Serial Number`."
msgstr ""
"Pred nastavitvijo tega datuma se prepričajte, da je polje lastnosti "
":guilabel:`Sledenje` nastavljeno na :guilabel:`Po serijah` ali :guilabel:`Po "
"edinstveni serijski številki`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:102
msgid ""
"Set this number of days by navigating to the product "
"form's :guilabel:`Inventory` tab. Next, select the :guilabel:`Expiration "
"Date` option, which makes the :guilabel:`Removal Date` field (and other date "
"fields) appear."
msgstr ""
"Nastavite to število dni z navigacijo do zavihka :guilabel:`Inventar` na "
"obrazcu izdelka. Nato izberite možnost :guilabel:`Datum izteka roka`, ki "
"prikaže polje :guilabel:`Datum odstranitve` (in druga polja za datum)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:107
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Lots and Serial Numbers` and :guilabel:`Expiration Dates` "
"features **must** be enabled in :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings` to track expiration dates."
msgstr ""
"Funkciji :guilabel:`Serije in serijske številke` in :guilabel:`Datumi "
"poteka` **morata** biti omogočeni v :menuselection:`Aplikacija Zaloga --> "
"Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve`, da lahko sledite datumom poteka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:111
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Expiration Date`, :guilabel:`Best Before "
"Date`, :guilabel:`Removal Date`, and the :guilabel:`Alert Date`."
msgstr ""
"Nastavite :guilabel:`Datum izteka roka`, :guilabel:`Datum minimalne "
"trajnosti`, :guilabel:`Datum odstranitve` in :guilabel:`Datum opozorila`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:115
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab of the product, `Egg`, the "
"following :guilabel:`Dates` are set by the user:"
msgstr ""
"V zavihku :guilabel:`Zaloga` izdelka `Jajce` uporabnik nastavi "
"naslednje :guilabel:`Datume`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:118
msgid ":guilabel:`Expiration Date`: `30` days after receipt"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Datum poteka`: `30` dni po prejemu"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:119
msgid ":guilabel:`Removal Date`: `15` days before expiration date"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Datum odstranitve`: `15` dni pred datumom poteka"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:121
msgid "Display expiration and removal dates set on the product form."
msgstr "Prikaz datumov poteka in odstranitve, nastavljenih v obrazcu izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:124
msgid ""
"A shipment of Eggs arrive at the warehouse on January 1st. So, the "
"expiration date of the Eggs is **January 31st** (Jan 1st + 30). By "
"extension, the removal date is **January 16th** (Jan 31 - 15)."
msgstr ""
"Pošiljka jajc prispe v skladišče 1. januarja. Torej je datum poteka jajc "
"**31. januar** (1. jan + 30). Posledično je datum odstranitve **16. januar** "
"(31. jan - 15)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:130
msgid ""
"To view the expiration dates of items in stock, go "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Products --> Lots / Serial Numbers`. By "
"default, this report is grouped by location. If necessary, remove that "
"grouping in the search bar and group by product. Expand the product to show "
"its lots. Next, click the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(settings "
"adjust)` icon, located on the far-right, and select the "
"columns: :guilabel:`Expiration Date` and :guilabel:`Removal Date`."
msgstr ""
"Za ogled datumov preteka artiklov na zalogi pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`aplikacija Zaloga --> Izdelki --> Serije / Serijske "
"številke`. Privzeto je to poročilo grupirano po lokaciji. Po potrebi "
"odstranite to grupiranje v iskalni vrstici in grupirajte po izdelku. "
"Razširite izdelek, da prikažete njegove serije. Nato kliknite "
"ikono :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(nastavitve prilagodi)`, ki se "
"nahaja na skrajni desni, in izberite stolpce: :guilabel:`Datum preteka` "
"in :guilabel:`Datum odstranitve`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:136
msgid "Show expiration dates from the Lots / Serial Numbers list."
msgstr "Prikažite datume preteka s seznama Serije / Serijske številke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:139
msgid ""
"Alternatively, view these dates by clicking the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial "
"Numbers` smart button on the product form."
msgstr ""
"Alternativno si oglejte te datume s klikom na pametni gumb :guilabel:`Serije/"
"Serijske številke` na obrazcu izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:142
msgid ""
"Show expiration dates from the Lots/Serial Numbers list on the product form."
msgstr ""
"Prikaz rokov uporabnosti s seznama Serij/Serijskih številk na obrazcu "
"izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:148
msgid ""
"Using the :abbr:`FEFO (First Expired, First Out)` removal strategy ensures "
"that products with the nearest removal date are picked first."
msgstr ""
"Uporaba strategije odstranjevanja :abbr:`FEFO (First Expired, First Out)` "
"zagotavlja, da so najprej izbrani izdelki z najbližjim datumom odstranitve."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:151
msgid ""
"To understand how this removal strategy works, consider the following "
"example below about the product, `Carton of Eggs`, which is a box containing "
"twelve eggs."
msgstr ""
"Za razumevanje delovanja te strategije odstranjevanja si oglejte spodnji "
