#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:5
msgid ""
"Set up the DHL shipping connector in Odoo to manage DHL shipments to clients "
"directly within Odoo. Configuring a DHL shipping method simplifies the "
"process of :doc:`calculating shipping rates <../setup_configuration>` "
"and :doc:`generating shipping labels <labels>`."
msgstr ""
"Nastavite DHL povezovalnik pošiljanja v Odoo za upravljanje DHL pošiljk "
"strankam neposredno v Odoo. Konfiguracija načina dostave DHL poenostavi "
"postopek :doc:`izračuna stroškov pošiljanja <../setup_configuration>` "
"in :doc:`ustvarjanja nalepk za pošiljanje <labels>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:13
msgid "Configure the DHL shipping method"
msgstr "Konfiguracija načina dostave DHL"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:15
msgid ""
"To enable DHL delivery methods, :ref:`install <general/install>` the **DHL "
"Express Shipping** module. DHL delivery methods can be configured and added "
"as a line item to sales orders, which allows for automatic computation of "
"shipping rates and generation of shipping labels."
msgstr ""
"Za omogočitev načinov dostave DHL :ref:`namestite <general/install>` modul "
"**DHL Express Shipping**. Načine dostave DHL je mogoče konfigurirati in "
"dodati kot postavko v prodajna naročila, kar omogoča samodejni izračun "
"stroškov pošiljanja in ustvarjanje nalepk za pošiljanje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:19
msgid ""
"To create a DHL shipping method, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory app --"
"> Configuration --> Delivery Methods`, then click :guilabel:`New` to open a "
"delivery method form. If a shipping method has already been created, it can "
"be selected from this screen."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje načina dostave DHL pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> Načini dostave`, nato "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`, da odprete obrazec načina dostave. Če je bil "
"način pošiljanja že ustvarjen, ga lahko izberete na tem zaslonu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:23
msgid "The form for a DHL shipping method."
msgstr "Obrazec za način pošiljanja DHL."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:27
