msgstr ""
"Začnite s konfiguracijo načina pošiljanja tako, da v polje :guilabel:`Način "
"pošiljanja` vnesete njegov naslov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:32
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Provider` drop-down menu, select the :guilabel:`DHL` "
"option, and a new :guilabel:`DHL Configuration` tab appears at the bottom of "
"the form."
msgstr ""
"V spustnem meniju :guilabel:`Ponudnik` izberite možnost :guilabel:`DHL` in "
