msgstr "Zavihek Konfiguracija DHL"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:42
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`DHL Configuration` tab on the shipping method form is used to "
"connect the user's DHL account to Odoo and configure the shipping method's "
"details."
msgstr ""
"Zavihek :guilabel:`Konfiguracija DHL` na obrazcu načina pošiljanja se "
