#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:124
msgid ""
"Once the DHL connection is set up, use the smart buttons at the top of the "
"form to publish, turn on production mode, or activate debug logging."
msgstr ""
"Ko je povezava DHL vzpostavljena, uporabite pametne gumbe na vrhu obrazca za "
"objavo, vklop produkcijskega načina ali aktivacijo beleženja napak."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:127
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unpublished`/:guilabel:`Published`: Determines if this shipping "
"method is available on the user's **eCommerce** website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Neobjavljeno`/:guilabel:`Objavljeno`: Določa, ali je ta način "
"pošiljanja na voljo na uporabnikovi spletni strani **eCommerce**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:130
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Test Environment`/:guilabel:`Production Environment`: Determines "
"whether label creation is for testing and canceled immediately (Test) or "
"generates a real shipping label that is charged to the DHL account "
"(Production)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Testno okolje`/:guilabel:`Produkcijsko okolje`: Določa, ali je "
"ustvarjanje nalepk namenjeno testiranju in takoj preklicano (Testno) ali "
"ustvari pravo nalepko za pošiljanje, ki se zaračuna na račun DHL "
"(Produkcijsko)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:133
msgid ""
":guilabel:`No Debug`/:guilabel:`Debug Requests`: Determines whether API "
"requests and responses are logged in Odoo (turn on :ref:`developer mode "
"<developer-mode>` and go to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Technical --> "
"Logging`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Brez razhroščevanja`/:guilabel:`Razhroščevanje zahtev`: Določa, "
"ali se zahteve in odgovori API beležijo v Odoo (vklopite :ref:`razvijalski "
"način <developer-mode>` in pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Nastavitve "
"--> Tehnično --> Beleženje`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:3
msgid "Dispatch management system"
msgstr "Sistem za upravljanje odprem"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:10
msgid ""
"The *dispatch management system* feature in Odoo is used to plan and build "
"shipments. Key features include:"
msgstr ""
"Funkcija *sistem za upravljanje odprem* v Odoo se uporablja za načrtovanje "
"in pripravo pošiljk. Ključne funkcije vključujejo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:13
msgid ""
"**Load building**: Group products for specific carriers, assign "
"those :doc:`batches <../picking_methods/batch>` to loading docks, and manage "
"vehicle assignments based on fleet capacity. This ensures the right products "
"are packed into the appropriate trucks for delivery."
msgstr ""
"**Priprava tovora**: združevanje izdelkov za določene prevoznike, dodelitev "
"teh :doc:`serij <../picking_methods/batch>` nakladalnim rampam in "
"upravljanje dodelitve vozil na podlagi kapacitete voznega parka. To "
"zagotavlja, da so pravi izdelki naloženi v ustrezna tovorna vozila za "
"dostavo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:16
msgid ""
":doc:`Fleet management <../../../../hr/fleet>`: Track and manage the "
"capacity of in-house delivery vehicles."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Upravljanje voznega parka <../../../../hr/fleet>`: spremljanje in "
"upravljanje kapacitete notranjih dostavnih vozil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:22
msgid ""
"To use the dispatch management system, the following setup must be completed:"
msgstr ""
"Za uporabo sistema za upravljanje odprem je treba opraviti naslednjo "
"nastavitev:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:24
msgid ":ref:`Install <general/install>` the **Fleet** application."
msgstr ":ref:`Namestite <general/install>` aplikacijo **Vozni park**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:25
msgid ""
"Enable :ref:`necessary features <inventory/shipping_receiving/inventory-"
"features>` in the **Inventory** app."
msgstr ""
"Omogočite :ref:`potrebne funkcije <inventory/shipping_receiving/inventory-"
"features>` v aplikaciji **Zaloga**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:27
msgid ""
"Enable and configure the :ref:`Mapbox integration <general/integrations/"
"geolocation-routes>`."
msgstr ""
"Omogočite in konfigurirajte :ref:`integracijo z Mapboxom <general/"
"integrations/geolocation-routes>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:28
msgid ""
"Configure vehicle :ref:`capacity (volume and weight) <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/vehicle-capacity>`."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurirajte :ref:`kapaciteto vozila (prostornina in teža) <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/vehicle-capacity>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:30
msgid "Enter vehicle :doc:`car models <../../../../hr/fleet/models>`."
msgstr "Vnesite :doc:`modele vozil <../../../../hr/fleet/models>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:31
msgid ""
"Set up :ref:`vehicles as delivery methods <inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"delivery-method-for-carrier>`."
msgstr ""
"Nastavite :ref:`vozila kot načine dostave <inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"delivery-method-for-carrier>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:33
msgid "Create :ref:`dock locations <inventory/shipping_receiving/docks>`."
msgstr "Ustvarite :ref:`lokacije dokov <inventory/shipping_receiving/docks>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:36
msgid ""
"Dispatch management can evaluate capacity on a vehicle **only** if a weight "
"and volume are assigned to a product on the *Inventory* tab of its product "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Sistem za upravljanje odprem lahko oceni kapaciteto vozila **samo**, če sta "
"teža in prostornina dodeljena izdelku na zavihku *Zaloga* njegovega obrazca."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:42
msgid "Inventory settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve zaloge"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:44
msgid ""
"To set the required inventory settings, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr ""
"Za nastavitev potrebnih nastavitev zaloge pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:47
msgid ""
"In the *Operations* section, select the :guilabel:`Batch, Wave & Cluster "
"Transfers` checkbox to prepare batches of orders for delivery."
msgstr ""
"V razdelku *Operacije* označite potrditveno polje :guilabel:`Paketni, val in "
"grozdni prenosi`, da pripravite pakete naročil za dostavo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:50
msgid ""
"In the *Shipping* section, select the :guilabel:`Delivery Methods` "
"and :guilabel:`Transport Management` checkboxes. Doing so allows specific "
"vehicles to be :ref:`set as carriers <inventory/shipping_receiving/delivery-"
"method-for-carrier>`."
msgstr ""
"V razdelku *Odprema* izberite potrditvena polja :guilabel:`Načini dostave` "
"in :guilabel:`Upravljanje prevoza`. To omogoča, da se določena vozila "
":ref:`nastavijo kot prevozniki <inventory/shipping_receiving/delivery-method-"
"for-carrier>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:54
msgid "Set delivery and transport settings in the Inventory configuration."
msgstr "Nastavite nastavitve dostave in prevoza v konfiguraciji Inventarja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:57
msgid ""
"In the *Warehouse* section, select the :guilabel:`Storage Locations` "
"checkbox to assign specific locations in the warehouse as loading zones for "
"delivery trucks."
msgstr ""
"V razdelku *Skladišče* označite potrditveno polje :guilabel:`Skladiščne "
"lokacije`, da določite specifične lokacije v skladišču kot nakladalna "
"območja za tovorna vozila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:60
msgid ""
"Once all the configurations are complete, be sure to click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "Ko so vse nastavitve končane, ne pozabite klikniti :guilabel:`Shrani`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:62
msgid ""
"Then, enable and configure the :ref:`Mapbox integration <general/"
"integrations/geolocation-routes>` to be able to create :ref:`delivery routes "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/delivery-route>`."
msgstr ""
"Nato omogočite in konfigurirajte :ref:`integracijo z Mapboxom <general/"
"integrations/geolocation-routes>`, da boste lahko ustvarili :ref:`dostavne "
"poti <inventory/shipping_receiving/delivery-route>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:68
msgid "Vehicle capacity"
msgstr "Kapaciteta vozila"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:70
msgid ""
"To configure the vehicle capacity, go to :menuselection:`Fleet app --> "
"Configuration --> Categories`."
msgstr ""
"Za konfiguracijo kapacitete vozila pojdite na :menuselection:`Vozni park --> "
"Konfiguracija --> Kategorije`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:73
msgid ""
"Next, click :guilabel:`New` to add a new category, or click into an existing "
"category to modify it. In the :guilabel:`Name` field, enter the type of "
"vehicle (e.g., `Pick-up truck`, `Van`, or `Cargo truck`). Then, enter the "
"vehicle capacity in the :guilabel:`Max Weight` (in kilograms) "
"and :guilabel:`Max Volume` (in cubic meters) fields."
msgstr ""
"Nato kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`, da dodate novo kategorijo, ali kliknite na "
"obstoječo kategorijo, da jo spremenite. V polje :guilabel:`Ime` vnesite tip "
"vozila (npr. `Pick-up truck`, `Van` ali `Tovornjak`). Nato vnesite "
"kapaciteto vozila v polji :guilabel:`Največja teža` (v kilogramih) "
"in :guilabel:`Največja prostornina` (v kubičnih metrih)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:79
msgid "Vehicle categories with defined weight and volume."
msgstr "Kategorije vozil z določeno težo in prostornino."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:83
msgid ""
"The units of measurement for vehicle capacity are assigned at the global "
"level in the **Settings** app, in the :guilabel:`Units of Measure` section."
msgstr ""
"Merske enote za kapaciteto vozila so dodeljene na globalni ravni v "
"aplikaciji **Nastavitve**, v razdelku :guilabel:`Merske enote`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:86
msgid "Show units of measure settings."
msgstr "Prikaži nastavitve merskih enot."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:90
msgid ":ref:`Vehicle category <fleet/categories>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Kategorija vozila <fleet/categories>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:94
msgid "Car model"
msgstr "Model vozila"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:96
msgid ""
"Configuring a vehicle's car model is required when adding vehicles in Odoo. "
"Ensure the correct *Category* is selected for a car model. Doing so "
"automatically applies weight and volume capacities to all vehicles of that "
"type."
msgstr ""
"Konfiguracija modela vozila je obvezna pri dodajanju vozil v Odoo. "
"Prepričajte se, da je za model vozila izbrana pravilna *Kategorija*. S tem "
"se vsem vozilom te vrste samodejno dodelijo kapacitete teže in prostornine."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:100
msgid ""
"To configure, navigate to :menuselection:`Fleet app --> Configuration --> "
"Models`."
msgstr ""
"Za konfiguracijo pojdite na :menuselection:`Vozni park --> Konfiguracija --> "
"Modeli`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:102
msgid ""
"From the :guilabel:`Models` list, select an existing model, or "
"click :guilabel:`New` in the top-left corner to create a new model. Then, "
"set the relevant :guilabel:`Category` field to the relevant vehicle category."
msgstr ""
"Na seznamu :guilabel:`Modeli` izberite obstoječi model ali "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Novo` v zgornjem levem kotu, da ustvarite nov model. "
"Nato nastavite ustrezno polje :guilabel:`Kategorija` na ustrezno kategorijo "
"vozila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:107
msgid ":doc:`Create car model <../../../../hr/fleet/models>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Ustvarite model vozila <../../../../hr/fleet/models>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:112
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:92
msgid "Delivery method"
msgstr "Način dostave"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:114
msgid ""
"Optionally, delivery vehicles can be assigned as a delivery method *carrier*."
msgstr ""
"Po želji lahko dostavna vozila dodelite kot *prevoznika* načina dostave."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:116
msgid ""
"To configure delivery methods, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Delivery Methods`. Select an existing delivery method, or "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Za konfiguracijo načinov dostave pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> Načini dostave`. Izberite obstoječi način "
"dostave ali kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:120
msgid ":doc:`Configure delivery method <../setup_configuration>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Konfigurirajte način dostave <../setup_configuration>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:122
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Delivery Method` form, enter a name for the delivery "
"method. It is recommended to use identifying information, such as the "
"vehicle description and license plate number (e.g. `Truck 123-ABCD`)."
msgstr ""
"V obrazcu :guilabel:`Način dostave` vnesite ime za način dostave. "
"Priporočljivo je uporabiti identifikacijske podatke, kot so opis vozila in "
"registrska tablica (npr. `Tovornjak 123-ABCD`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:126
msgid ""
"Since the delivery methods are managed internally, set "
"the :guilabel:`Provider` to either :guilabel:`Fixed Price` "
"or :guilabel:`Based on Rules`. For more information about how shipping "
"prices are calculated, refer to the :doc:`Delivery method <../"
"setup_configuration>` article."
msgstr ""
"Ker se načini dostave upravljajo interno, nastavite :guilabel:`Ponudnik` "
"na :guilabel:`Fiksna cena` ali :guilabel:`Na podlagi pravil`. Za več "
"informacij o tem, kako se izračunajo cene dostave, glejte članek :doc:`Način "
"dostave <../setup_configuration>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:130
msgid ""
"Next, set a :guilabel:`Delivery Product`, which is the product that shows up "
"as the customer's :ref:`delivery charge <inventory/shipping/sales-order>` on "
"the sales order or invoice."
msgstr ""
"Nato nastavite :guilabel:`Izdelek za dostavo`, ki je izdelek, ki se prikaže "
"kot strankino :ref:`breme dostave <inventory/shipping/sales-order>` na "
"prodajnem nalogu ali računu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:133
msgid ""
"Optionally, in the :guilabel:`Availability` tab, set "
"the :guilabel:`Countries`, :guilabel:`States`, or :guilabel:`Zip Prefixes` "
"to limit the range of local delivery."
msgstr ""
"Po želji na zavihku :guilabel:`Razpoložljivost` "
"nastavite :guilabel:`Države`, :guilabel:`Države` ali :guilabel:`Predpone "
"poštnih številk`, da omejite obseg lokalne dostave."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:136
msgid ""
"Example delivery method with the Zip Prefixes set to San Francisco's zip "
"code."
msgstr ""
"Primer načina dostave z nastavljenimi predponami poštnih številk na poštno "
"številko San Francisca."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:142
msgid "Dock locations"
msgstr "Lokacije nakladalnih ramp"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:144
msgid ""
"Each loading dock must have a dedicated location. To create dock locations, "
"go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Locations` and "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Vsaka nakladalna rampa mora imeti dodeljeno lokacijo. Za ustvarjanje lokacij "
"dokov pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> "
"Lokacije` in kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:147
msgid ""
"After dock locations are set up in Odoo, configure them in the operation "
"type. Navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> "
"Operations Types` and open an existing delivery operation type, or "
"click :guilabel:`New` to create a new one."
msgstr ""
"Ko so lokacije dokov nastavljene v Odoo, jih konfigurirajte v tipu "
"operacije. Pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --"
"> Tipi operacij` in odprite obstoječi tip dostavne operacije ali "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`, da ustvarite novega."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:151
msgid ""
"After defining the other fields in the operation type form, scroll to the "
"*Batch & wave transfers* section and select the :guilabel:`Dispatch "
"Management` checkbox. The :guilabel:`Dock locations` field appears. Define "
"the dock locations for this operation type."
msgstr ""
"Po določitvi drugih polj v obrazcu tipa operacije se pomaknite do razdelka "
"*Paketni in valovni prenosi* in označite potrditveno "
"polje :guilabel:`Upravljanje odprem`. Polje :guilabel:`Lokacije dokov` se "
"prikaže. Določite lokacije dokov za ta tip operacije."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:155
msgid "Location configuration."
msgstr "Konfiguracija lokacije."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:163
msgid "Build loads"
msgstr "Sestavljanje tovorov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:165
msgid ""
"After setup is complete, optionally :ref:`assign orders to a carrier "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/assign-carrier>` and :ref:`group them into "
"batches <inventory/shipping_receiving/create-batch>`. Then, :ref:`configure "
"the batch form <inventory/shipping_receiving/batch-form>`, as needed."
msgstr ""
"Po končani nastavitvi po želji :ref:`dodelite naročila prevozniku <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/assign-carrier>` in :ref:`jih združite v pakete "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/create-batch>`. Nato po "
"potrebi :ref:`konfigurirajte obrazec paketa <inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"batch-form>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:170
msgid ""
"To group products, go to the :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Operations --"
"> Deliveries`, which reveals a list of outgoing deliveries."
msgstr ""
"Za združevanje izdelkov pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Zaloga --> "
"Operacije --> Dostave`, kar prikaže seznam odhodnih dostav."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:174
msgid ""
"Because this article is about a specific use case, explore details about "
"each picking method in their dedicated articles."
msgstr ""
"Ker ta članek obravnava specifičen primer uporabe, raziščite podrobnosti o "
"vsaki metodi nabiranja v njihovih namenskih člankih."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:177
msgid ":doc:`../picking_methods/batch`"
msgstr ":doc:`../picking_methods/batch`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:178
msgid ":doc:`Wave picking <../picking_methods/wave>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Valovno nabiranje <../picking_methods/wave>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:179
msgid ":doc:`../picking_methods/cluster`"
msgstr ":doc:`../picking_methods/cluster`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:184
msgid "Carrier assignment"
msgstr "Dodelitev prevoznika"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:186
msgid ""
"Reveal the *Carrier* column, if it is not visible by default, by clicking "
"the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(settings)` icon in the top-right "
"corner, and selecting the :guilabel:`Carrier` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Prikažite stolpec *Prevoznik*, če ni privzeto viden, s klikom na "
"ikono :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(nastavitve)` v zgornjem desnem "
"kotu in označitvijo potrditvenega polja :guilabel:`Prevoznik`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:191
msgid ""
"Other useful columns to enable can be :guilabel:`Zip` "
"code, :guilabel:`Shipping Weight`, and :guilabel:`Shipping Volume`."
msgstr ""
"Drugi uporabni stolpci, ki jih je mogoče omogočiti, so poštna "
"številka :guilabel:`Zip`, :guilabel:`Teža pošiljke` in :guilabel:`Volumen "
"pošiljke`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:194
msgid ""
"Select the delivery orders for the batch by selecting the checkboxes on the "
"left. Next, click into the line's :guilabel:`Carrier` fields. In the "
"resulting drop-down menu, choose the desired vehicle's :ref:`delivery method "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/delivery-method-for-carrier>`. "
"A :guilabel:`Confirmation` pop-up window appears, indicating the number of "
"orders being added to the batch. Click :guilabel:`Confirm`, and the carrier "
"is updated for all the selected records."
msgstr ""
"Izberite dobavna naročila za paket tako, da označite potrditvena polja na "
"levi strani. Nato kliknite polji :guilabel:`Prevoznik` v vrstici. V pojavnem "
"meniju izberite :ref:`način dostave <inventory/shipping_receiving/delivery-"
"method-for-carrier>` želenega vozila. Pojavno okno :guilabel:`Potrditev` "
"prikazuje število naročil, ki se dodajajo paketu. "
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi` in prevoznik se posodobi za vse izbrane zapise."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:200
msgid "Set carrier."
msgstr "Nastavi prevoznika."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:203
msgid ""
"The delivery method `Truck 1-MER-001` is set as the :guilabel:`Carrier` for "
"two delivery orders."
msgstr ""
"Metoda dostave `Tovornjak 1-MER-001` je nastavljena "
"kot :guilabel:`Prevoznik` za dve dobavni naročili."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:208
msgid "Create batch"
msgstr "Ustvari sklop"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:210
msgid ""
"With the carrier set, begin adding orders to a batch or wave transfer by "
"ticking the checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Ko je prevoznik nastavljen, začnite dodajati naročila v sklop ali val "
"prenosa tako, da označite potrditveno polje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:213
msgid ""
"If a delivery order is already assigned to a batch transfer, assigning a "
"batch transfer here does **not** update it."
msgstr ""
"Če je dobavno naročilo že dodeljeno sklopu prenosa, dodelitev sklopa prenosa "
"tukaj **ne** posodobi tega naročila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:216
msgid ""
"Then, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` button, and click "
"either :guilabel:`Add to batch` or :guilabel:`Add to wave`. In the pop-up "
"window, ensure :guilabel:`Add to` is set to :guilabel:`a new [batch/wave] "
"transfer`, then click :guilabel:`Confirm`."
msgstr ""
"Nato kliknite gumb :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Dejanja` in "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj v sklop` ali :guilabel:`Dodaj v val`. V pojavnem "
"oknu se prepričajte, da je :guilabel:`Dodaj v` nastavljeno na :guilabel:`nov "
"[sklop/val] prenos`, nato kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:220
msgid "Example wave."
msgstr "Primer vala."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:223
msgid "Delivery orders are selected to be grouped into a wave transfer."
msgstr "Dobavna naročila so izbrana za združitev v val prenosa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:226
msgid "Alternative batch creation method"
msgstr "Alternativna metoda ustvarjanja sklopa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:228
msgid ""
"Another place to create batches is by going to "
"the :menuselection:`Inventory` app, and in the :guilabel:`Delivery Orders` "
"card, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon. "
"In the resulting drop-down menu, click :guilabel:`Prepare batch`."
msgstr ""
"Drug kraj za ustvarjanje paketov je v aplikaciji :menuselection:`Zaloga`, v "
"kartici :guilabel:`Dobavni nalogi` kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"v` :guilabel:`(navpični elipsi)`. V pojavnem meniju "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Pripravi paket`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:233
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Transport Management` drop-down menu contains other tools for "
"fleet management:"
msgstr ""
"Spustni meni :guilabel:`Upravljanje prevoza` vsebuje druga orodja za "
"upravljanje voznega parka:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:235
msgid ":guilabel:`Manage Batches`: open list of batches"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Upravljaj sklope`: odpri seznam sklopov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:236
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dock Dispatching`: open weekly calendar view of scheduled batch "
"operations"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Odpošiljanje z doka`: odpre tedenski pogled koledarja načrtovanih "
"paketnih operacij"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:237
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Batches by Route`: Kanban view of batches grouped by fulfillment "
"route"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Paketi po poti`: pogled Kanban paketov, razvrščenih po poti "
"izpolnjevanja"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:238
msgid ":guilabel:`Calendar`: open hourly calendar view of scheduled operations"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Koledar`: odpre urni pogled koledarja načrtovanih operacij"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:239
msgid ":guilabel:`Statistics`: open pivot table of the batch transfers"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Statistika`: odpre vrtilno tabelo paketnih prenosov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:241
msgid "Show prepare batch option from the Transport Management drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Prikaži možnost priprave paketa iz spustnega menija Upravljanje prevoza."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:247
msgid "Batch form"
msgstr "Obrazec paketa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:249
msgid "On the batch transfer form, fill the following fields out accordingly:"
msgstr "Na obrazcu za paketni prenos ustrezno izpolnite naslednja polja:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:251
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Responsible`: Assign an employee to the picking. Leave blank if "
"*any* worker can fulfill this picking."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Odgovorna oseba`: Dodelite zaposlenega nabiranju. Pustite prazno, "
"če *katerikoli* delavcan opravi to nabiranje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:255
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Scheduled Date`: Specify the date by which "
"the :guilabel:`Responsible` person should complete the transfer to the "
"output location."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Načrtovani datum`: Določite datum, do katerega "
"mora :guilabel:`Odgovorna oseba` zaključiti prenos na izhodno lokacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:257
msgid ":guilabel:`Dock Location`: Select the loading location."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Lokacija doka`: Izberite nakladalno lokacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:258
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vehicle`: Select the vehicle, which will auto-fill "
"the :guilabel:`Vehicle Category`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vozilo`: Izberite vozilo, ki bo samodejno "
"izpolnilo :guilabel:`Kategorijo vozila`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:259
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vehicle Category`: Determine if the order exceeds "
"the :ref:`vehicle's capacity limits <inventory/shipping_receiving/vehicle-"
"capacity>`"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kategorija vozila`: Določite, ali naročilo presega :ref:`omejitve "
"kapacitete vozila <inventory/shipping_receiving/vehicle-capacity>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:263
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Volume` bar indicates that the transport truck is nearing "
"capacity."
msgstr ""
"Vrstica :guilabel:`Prostornina` kaže, da se tovorno vozilo približuje "
"kapaciteti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:265
msgid "Show batch form."
msgstr "Prikaži obrazec paketa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:271
msgid "Prepare delivery route"
msgstr "Priprava poti dostave"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:273
msgid ""
"To help the driver prepare, click the :guilabel:`Map` button at the top of "
"the batch or wave form to view delivery destinations on a map. Selecting an "
"individual delivery order pinpoints its location."
msgstr ""
"Za pomoč vozniku pri pripravi kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Zemljevid` na vrhu "
"obrazca paketa ali vala za ogled dostavnih lokacij na zemljevidu. Izbira "
"posameznega naročila dostave točno določi njegovo lokacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:277
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Map` button is only visible for transfers with "
"the :guilabel:`In progress` status."
msgstr ""
"Gumb :guilabel:`Zemljevid` je viden samo za prenose s statusom :guilabel:`V "
"teku`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:279
msgid "Show map in Odoo, with information of the delivery orders."
msgstr "Prikaži zemljevid v Odoo z informacijami o naročilih dostave."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:282
msgid ""
"Additionally, use the :guilabel:`View in Google Maps` button to generate a "
"route from the warehouse to the delivery points."
msgstr ""
"Dodatno uporabite gumb :guilabel:`Poglej v Google zemljevidih` za "
"ustvarjanje poti od skladišča do točk dostave."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:285
msgid "Show Google Map route."
msgstr "Prikaži pot v Google zemljevidu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:289
msgid "Prepare consignment note (CMR)"
msgstr "Priprava spremnega lista (CMR)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:291
msgid ""
"The CMR convention (Convention on the Contract for the International "
"Carriage of Goods by Road) governs the transportation of cargo by road. The "
"majority of European states have ratified the convention."
msgstr ""
"Konvencija CMR (Konvencija o pogodbi za mednarodni cestni prevoz blaga) "
"ureja cestni prevoz tovora. Večina evropskih držav je konvencijo "
"ratificirala."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:295
msgid ""
"A standard waybill or transport document was developed to aid in this "
"treaty. This is called a consignment note (also known as a |CMR| waybill). "
"Senders are required to produce these forms. A waybill consists of four "
"parts:"
msgstr ""
"Za pomoč pri izvajanju te pogodbe je bil razvit standardni tovorni list ali "
"transportni dokument. Imenuje se spremni list (znan tudi kot |CMR| tovorni "
"list). Pošiljatelji morajo te obrazce pripraviti. Tovorni list je sestavljen "
"iz štirih delov:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:299
msgid "Sender's copy (in red)"
msgstr "Izvod za pošiljatelja (rdeč)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:300
msgid "Receiver's copy (in blue)"
msgstr "Izvod za prejemnika (moder)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:301
msgid "Carrier's copy (in green)"
msgstr "Izvod za prevoznika (zelen)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:302
msgid "Second carrier's copy (in black)"
msgstr "Izvod za drugega prevoznika (črn)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:304
msgid ""
"Odoo completes these forms using the information it has; any additional "
"information must be added manually."
msgstr ""
"Odoo izpolni te obrazce s pomočjo informacij, ki jih ima; vse dodatne "
"informacije je treba dodati ročno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:308
msgid "Single-delivery |CMR|"
msgstr "Posamezna dostava |CMR|"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:310
msgid ""
"Print a |CMR| for a delivery order by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Operations --> Deliveries`. Open the "
"delivery order that requires a consignment note."
msgstr ""
"Natisnite |CMR| za dobavnico tako, da se pomaknete na "
":menuselection:`Aplikacija Inventar --> Operacije --> Dobave`. Odprite "
"dobavnico, ki zahteva spremni list."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:313
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon, then select :icon:`fa-"
"print` :menuselection:`Print --> Consignment Note (CMR)`. A consignment note "
"is generated."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Dejanja)`, nato izberite :icon:`fa-"
"print` :menuselection:`Natisni --> Spremni list (CMR)`. Ustvari se spremni "
"list."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:316
msgid "A CMR note for a shipment of produce, going to Belgium."
msgstr "Spremni list CMR za pošiljko pridelkov, namenjenih v Belgijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:320
msgid "Batch delivery |CMR|"
msgstr "Skupinska dostava |CMR|"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:322
msgid ""
"Print |CMRs| for a batch order by navigating to :menuselection:`Inventory "
"app --> Operations --> Batch Transfers`. Open the batch transfer that "
"requires consignment notes."
msgstr ""
"Natisnite |CMRs| za paketno naročilo s pomočjo menija "
":menuselection:`Inventar --> Operacije --> Paketni prenosi`. Odprite paketni "
"prenos, ki zahteva spremne liste."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:325
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon, then select :icon:`fa-"
"print` :menuselection:`Print --> Consignment Note (CMR)`. A consignment note "
"is generated for each delivery in the batch transfer."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Dejanja)`, nato izberite :icon:`fa-"
"print` :menuselection:`Natisni --> Spremni list (CMR)`. Za vsako dobavo v "
"paketnem prenosu se ustvari spremni list."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:3
msgid "EasyPost integration"
msgstr "Integracija EasyPost"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:5
msgid ""
"Set up the EasyPost delivery connector in Odoo to manage EasyPost shipments "
"to clients directly within Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Nastavite EasyPost povezovalnik za dostavo v Odoo za upravljanje EasyPost "
"pošiljk strankam neposredno v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:8
msgid ""
"EasyPost is a service that allows users to connect with multiple carriers, "
"like UPS, USPS, FedEx, DHL, and more. Odoo can then connect to EasyPost to "
"purchase labels from those carriers."
msgstr ""
"EasyPost je storitev, ki uporabnikom omogoča povezavo z več prevozniki, kot "
"so UPS, USPS, FedEx, DHL in drugi. Odoo se nato lahko poveže z EasyPost za "
"nakup nalepk teh prevoznikov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:11
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:9
msgid "To configure it, complete these steps:"
msgstr "Za konfiguracijo izvedite naslednje korake:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:13
msgid ""
":ref:`Create an EasyPost account <inventory/shipping_receiving/easypost-"
"account>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Ustvarite račun EasyPost <inventory/shipping_receiving/easypost-"
"account>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:14
msgid ""
":ref:`Integrate carrier accounts if the carrier is not enabled on the "
"EasyPost account <inventory/shipping_receiving/integrate-easypost-carrier>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Integrirajte račune prevoznikov, če prevoznik ni omogočen na računu "
"EasyPost <inventory/shipping_receiving/integrate-easypost-carrier>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:16
msgid ""
":ref:`Obtain Test and Production API keys <inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"easypost-api-keys>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Pridobite testne in produkcijske ključe API <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/easypost-api-keys>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:17
msgid ""
":ref:`Set up the delivery method in Odoo <inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"easypost-method>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Nastavite način dostave v Odoo <inventory/shipping_receiving/easypost-"
"method>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:19
msgid ""
"Upon completion, it is possible to calculate shipping costs based on package "
"size and weight, have the charges applied directly to an EasyPost business "
"account, and automatically print EasyPost tracking labels in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Po dokončanju je mogoče izračunati stroške pošiljanja glede na velikost in "
"težo paketa, stroške zaračunati neposredno na poslovni račun EasyPost in "
"samodejno natisniti nalepke za sledenje EasyPost v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:28
msgid ""
"To begin, go to the `EasyPost <https://www.easypost.com>`__ website to "
"create or log into the company's EasyPost business account."
msgstr ""
"Za začetek pojdite na spletno mesto `EasyPost <https://www.easypost.com>`__ "
"in ustvarite ali se prijavite v podjetni poslovni račun EasyPost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:31
msgid ""
"Follow the website's steps to complete registration and sign up for shipping "
"services. Some shipping services (like USPS and DHL Express) are "
"automatically enabled."
msgstr ""
"Sledite korakom na spletnem mestu za dokončanje registracije in prijavo za "
"storitve pošiljanja. Nekatere storitve pošiljanja (kot sta USPS in DHL "
"Express) so samodejno omogočene."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:37
msgid "Integrating other carrier accounts"
msgstr "Integracija drugih računov prevoznikov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:39
msgid ""
"To use a different carrier, it is possible to `enable Wallet Carrier "
"Accounts <https://support.easypost.com/hc/en-us/articles/21336276718605-"
"Enabling-Wallet-Carriers-Using-the-EasyPost-Dashboard>`__ to purchase labels "
"from EasyPost. Alternatively, if a user has their own carrier account, they "
"can `enable it on EasyPost <https://support.easypost.com/hc/en-us/articles/"
"25246240687373-Bring-Your-Own-Carrier-Account-to-EasyPost>`__. Then, after "
"these accounts are enabled, Odoo can integrate with the EasyPost account and "
"manage labels."
msgstr ""
"Če želite uporabiti drugega prevoznika, lahko `omogočite račune prevoznikov "
"Wallet <https://support.easypost.com/hc/en-us/articles/21336276718605-"
"Enabling-Wallet-Carriers-Using-the-EasyPost-Dashboard>`__ za nakup nalepk iz "
"EasyPost. Druga možnost je, da uporabnik, če ima lastni račun prevoznika, "
"`ga omogoči na EasyPost <https://support.easypost.com/hc/en-us/articles/"
"25246240687373-Bring-Your-Own-Carrier-Account-to-EasyPost>`__. Ko so ti "
"računi omogočeni, se lahko Odoo integrira z računom EasyPost in upravlja "
"nalepke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:50
msgid "Obtain Test and Production API keys"
msgstr "Pridobite testne in produkcijske ključe API"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:52
msgid ""
"After completing the setup, create Test and Production API keys. On the "
"EasyPost website, click the :guilabel:`Account Settings` link, then open "
"the :guilabel:`API Keys` page."
msgstr ""
"Po dokončani nastavitvi ustvarite testne in produkcijske ključe API. Na "
"spletnem mestu EasyPost kliknite povezavo :guilabel:`Nastavitve računa`, "
"nato odprite stran :guilabel:`Ključi API`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:55
msgid ""
"If these API keys have not yet been created, click :guilabel:`Add Additional "
"API Key`. Select either :guilabel:`Production` or :guilabel:`Test`. The API "
"key is automatically created. Follow the same process to create both keys."
msgstr ""
"Če ti ključi API še niso bili ustvarjeni, kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj dodatni "
"ključ API`. Izberite :guilabel:`Produkcija` ali :guilabel:`Test`. Ključ API "
"je samodejno ustvarjen. Sledite istemu postopku za ustvarjanje obeh ključev."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:59
msgid "Create API keys on the EasyPost API Keys page."
msgstr "Ustvarite ključe API na strani EasyPost Ključi API."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:65
msgid "Delivery method configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija načina dostave"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:67
msgid ""
"With those necessary credentials, configure the EasyPost delivery method in "
"Odoo by going to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> "
"Delivery Methods`."
msgstr ""
"S potrebnimi poverilnicami konfigurirajte način dostave EasyPost v Odoo "
"tako, da greste na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> "
"Načini dostave`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:70
msgid "On the *Delivery Methods* page, click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr "Na strani *Načini dostave* kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:72
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Provider` field, select :guilabel:`Easypost` from the drop-"
"down menu. Doing so reveals the *Easypost Configuration* tab at the bottom "
"of the form, where the EasyPost API keys should be entered."
msgstr ""
"V polju :guilabel:`Ponudnik` izberite :guilabel:`Easypost` iz spustnega "
"menija. S tem se na dnu obrazca prikaže zavihek *Konfiguracija Easypost*, "
"kjer je treba vnesti ključe API EasyPost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:76
msgid ""
"For details on configuring the other fields on the delivery method, such "
"as :guilabel:`Delivery Product`, refer to the :doc:`new_delivery_method` "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"Za podrobnosti o konfiguriranju drugih polj na načinu dostave, kot "
"je :guilabel:`Izdelek dostave`, glejte "
"dokumentacijo :doc:`new_delivery_method`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:80
msgid ""
"To generate EasyPost shipping labels through Odoo, ensure "
"the :guilabel:`Integration Level` option is set to :guilabel:`Get Rate and "
"Create Shipment`."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje nalepk za pošiljanje EasyPost prek Odoo zagotovite, da je "
"možnost :guilabel:`Raven integracije` nastavljena na :guilabel:`Pridobi ceno "
"in ustvari pošiljko`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:83
msgid "In the *Easypost Configuration* tab, complete the following fields:"
msgstr "V zavihku *Konfiguracija Easypost* izpolnite naslednja polja:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:85
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Test API Key`: the Test API key in the EasyPost Account Settings."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Testni ključ API`: testni ključ API v nastavitvah računa EasyPost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:86
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Production API Key`: the Production API key in the EasyPost "
"Account Settings."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Produkcijski ključ API`: produkcijski ključ API v nastavitvah "
"računa EasyPost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:87
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Label Format`: "
"Choose :guilabel:`PNG`, :guilabel:`PDF`, :guilabel:`ZPL`, "
"or :guilabel:`EPL2` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Oblika nalepke`: "
"Izberite :guilabel:`PNG`, :guilabel:`PDF`, :guilabel:`ZPL` "
"ali :guilabel:`EPL2` iz spustnega menija."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Generate Return Label`: Select to automatically generate a return "
"label when validating the delivery."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Ustvari nalepko za vračilo`: Izberite za samodejno ustvarjanje "
"nalepke za vračilo pri potrjevanju dostave."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:92
msgid ""
"Save the delivery method by clicking the :icon:`fa-cloud-"
"upload` :guilabel:`(Save manually)` icon."
msgstr ""
"Shranite način dostave s klikom na ikono :icon:`fa-cloud-"
"upload` :guilabel:`(Shrani ročno)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:94
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Load your Easypost carrier accounts` link under the API "
"keys."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite povezavo :guilabel:`Naloži svoje račune prevoznikov Easypost` pod "
"ključi API."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:96
msgid "Load the EasyPost carrier accounts into Odoo."
msgstr "Naložite račune prevoznikov EasyPost v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:99
msgid ""
"The *Select a carrier* pop-up window opens. Select a shipping carrier from "
"the drop-down menu, then click :guilabel:`Select`."
msgstr ""
"Odpre se pojavno okno *Izberite prevoznika*. Izberite prevoznika iz "
"spustnega menija, nato kliknite :guilabel:`Izberi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:102
msgid ""
"After the carrier type has been selected, complete the :guilabel:`Default "
"Package Type` and :guilabel:`Default Service Level` fields."
msgstr ""
"Ko je vrsta prevoznika izbrana, izpolnite polji :guilabel:`Privzeta vrsta "
"pakiranja` in :guilabel:`Privzeta raven storitve`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:105
msgid ""
"Select a package type and service level that should be used for the carrier."
msgstr ""
"Izberite vrsto pakiranja in raven storitve, ki naj se uporabljata za "
"prevoznika."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:109
msgid "Turn on the Easypost integration"
msgstr "Vključite integracijo Easypost"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:111
msgid ""
"After the EasyPost connection is set up, use the smart buttons at the top of "
"the form to publish, turn on production mode, or activate debug logging."
msgstr ""
"Ko je povezava EasyPost vzpostavljena, uporabite pametne gumbe na vrhu "
"obrazca za objavo, vklop produkcijskega načina ali aktiviranje beleženja za "
"odpravljanje napak."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unpublished/Published`: determines if this delivery method is "
"available on the user's **eCommerce** website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Neobjavljeno/Objavljeno`: določa, ali je ta način dostave na "
"voljo na uporabnikovem spletnem mestu **eCommerce**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:116
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Test Environment/Production Environment`: determines whether "
"label creation is for testing and cancelled immediately (Test) or generating "
"a real shipping label that is charged to the EasyPost account (Production)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Testno okolje/Produkcijsko okolje`: določa, ali je ustvarjanje "
"nalepke za testiranje in takoj preklicano (testno) ali ustvarjanje prave "
"nalepke za pošiljanje, ki se zaračuna na račun EasyPost (produkcija)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:119
msgid ""
":guilabel:`No Debug/Debug Requests`: determines whether API requests and "
"responses are logged in Odoo (turn on **developer mode** and go "
"to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Technical --> Logging`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Brez odpravljanja napak/Odpravljanje napak zahtev`: določa, ali "
"se zahteve in odzivi API beležijo v Odoo (vključite **način razvijalca** in "
"pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Nastavitve --> Tehnično --> "
"Beleženje`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:3
msgid "Envia.com integration"
msgstr "Integracija Envia.com"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:5
msgid ""
"Envia.com is a shipping service that connects businesses with multiple "
"carriers in Odoo. Key features include:"
msgstr ""
"Envia.com je storitev dostave, ki povezuje podjetja z več prevozniki v Odoo. "
"Ključne funkcije vključujejo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:8
msgid ""
"**Multi-carrier & international shipping**: Compare rates across carriers "
"and select the best option for domestic or global shipments."
msgstr ""
"**Večprevozniška in mednarodna dostava**: Primerjajte cene med prevozniki in "
"izberite najboljšo možnost za domače ali mednarodne pošiljke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:10
msgid ""
"**Automated label generation**: Generate shipping labels at order "
"confirmation."
msgstr ""
"**Samodejno ustvarjanje nalepk**: Ustvarite nalepke za pošiljanje ob "
"potrditvi naročila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:11
msgid ""
"**Real-time rate calculation**: Fetch rates based on package details and "
"destination."
msgstr ""
"**Izračun cen v realnem času**: Pridobite cene na podlagi podatkov o paketu "
"in namembnem kraju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:14
msgid "Setup in Envia"
msgstr "Nastavitev v Envia"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:16
msgid ""
"To integrate `Envia.com <https://www.envia.com>`_ with Odoo, first create an "
"account and activate the necessary shipping carriers. Then, obtain the API "
"credentials, which is used to connect Envia.com to the Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"Za integracijo `Envia.com <https://www.envia.com>`_ z Odoo najprej ustvarite "
"račun in aktivirajte potrebne prevoznike. Nato pridobite poverilnice API, ki "
"se uporabljajo za povezavo Envia.com z bazo podatkov Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:21
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:13
msgid "Create an account and activate carriers"
msgstr "Ustvarite račun in aktivirajte prevoznike"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:23
msgid "Begin by going to `Envia.com <https://www.envia.com>`_."
msgstr "Začnite tako, da obiščete `Envia.com <https://www.envia.com>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:25
msgid ""
"After signing in, in the left sidebar, click :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Print Options and Carriers`. Next, select the country to set the currency "
"and display available shipping carriers."
msgstr ""
"Po prijavi v levi stranski vrstici kliknite :menuselection:`Nastavitve --> "
"Možnosti tiskanja in prevozniki`. Nato izberite državo, da nastavite valuto "
"in prikažete razpoložljive prevoznike."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:29
msgid ""
"When signing up, make sure to select the correct language **and** country in "
"the upper right-hand corner. This affects the currency of the account!"
msgstr ""
"Pri registraciji se prepričajte, da v zgornjem desnem kotu izberete pravilen "
"jezik **in** državo. To vpliva na valuto računa!"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:32
msgid "Registry process in website with Envia.com."
msgstr "Postopek registracije na spletni strani z Envia.com."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:35
msgid ""
"After deciding on the desired carrier, click :guilabel:`Activate`, then "
"click :guilabel:`Services` to select the carrier's available shipping "
"options."
msgstr ""
"Ko se odločite za želenega prevoznika, kliknite :guilabel:`Aktiviraj`, nato "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Storitve`, da izberete razpoložljive možnosti dostave "
"prevoznika."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:39
msgid ""
"Billing is always processed in the currency of the country that matches the "
"primary billing address. If the company operates in multiple countries, "
"consider creating separate accounts for each location."
msgstr ""
"Obračunavanje se vedno obdela v valuti države, ki ustreza primarnem naslovu "
"za obračunavanje. Če podjetje posluje v več državah, razmislite o "
"ustvarjanju ločenih računov za vsako lokacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:44
msgid ""
"Envia will send an SMS or WhatsApp message to confirm the email address and "
"phone number."
msgstr ""
"Envia bo poslal SMS ali sporočilo WhatsApp za potrditev e-poštnega naslova "
"in telefonske številke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:46
msgid "Select carrier services."
msgstr "Izberite storitve prevoznika."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:50
msgid "Generate Envia.com credentials"
msgstr "Ustvarite poverilnice Envia.com"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:52
msgid ""
"Go to `Envia.com <https://www.envia.com>`_, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Developers --> API Keys`, on the left menu, then "
"click :guilabel:`add` to generate a new key."
msgstr ""
"Pojdite na `Envia.com <https://www.envia.com>`_, pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Razvijalci --> Ključi API` v levem meniju, nato "
"kliknite :guilabel:`dodaj`, da ustvarite nov ključ."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:55
msgid ""
"This key is required to authenticate Odoo's connection with Envia.com. "
"Retrieve it at any time by returning to the :guilabel:`API Keys` section."
msgstr ""
"Ta ključ je potreben za avtentikacijo povezave Odoo z Envia.com. Kadarkoli "
"ga lahko pridobite tako, da se vrnete v razdelek :guilabel:`Ključi API`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:58
msgid "API Keys in Envia.com."
msgstr "Ključi API v Envia.com."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:62
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:81
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:90
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/ups_credentials.rst:165
msgid "Setup in Odoo"
msgstr "Nastavitev v Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:64
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the :guilabel:`Envia Shipping` "
"(`delivery_envia`) module, and proceed to the following sections to "
"configure the integration in Odoo."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Namestite <general/install>` modul :guilabel:`Envia Shipping` "
"(`delivery_envia`) in nadaljujte z naslednjimi razdelki za konfiguracijo "
"integracije v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:68
msgid "Envia.com shipping connector configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija povezovalnika za pošiljanje Envia.com"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:70
msgid ""
"After activating the Envia.com connector, create a delivery method by going "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Delivery Methods` and "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Po aktivaciji povezovalnika Envia.com ustvarite način dostave tako, da "
"odprete :menuselection:`Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> Načini dostave` in "
"kliknete :guilabel:`Novo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:73
msgid "Fill out the following form fields:"
msgstr "Izpolnite naslednja polja obrazca:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:75
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Shipping Method`: Name of the shipping method, e.g. `Envia.com`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Način pošiljanja`: Ime načina pošiljanja, npr. `Envia.com`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:76
msgid ":guilabel:`Provider`: Select :guilabel:`Envia` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Ponudnik`: V spustnem meniju izberite :guilabel:`Envia`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Product`: The product listed on the sales order as the "
"delivery charge. A specific delivery product for Envia.com must be created."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Izdelek za dostavo`: Izdelek, naveden na prodajnem nalogu kot "
"strošek dostave. Ustvariti je treba poseben izdelek za dostavo za Envia.com."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:79
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Envia Configuration` tab, enter the :guilabel:`Envia "
"Production Access Token`."
msgstr ""
"V zavihku :guilabel:`Konfiguracija Envia` vnesite :guilabel:`Envia "
"Production Access Token`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:80
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Envia Configuration` tab, enter the :guilabel:`Envia "
"Sandbox Access Token`."
msgstr ""
"V zavihku :guilabel:`Konfiguracija Envia` vnesite :guilabel:`Envia Sandbox "
"Access Token`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:81
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Insurance percentage`: If insurance is needed, place a percentage "
"of the value to insure. If not, leave it as 0. Keep in mind that the "
"insurance price is calculated only after the label has been generated, "
"including for LTL shipments."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Odstotek zavarovanja`: Če je potrebno zavarovanje, vnesite "
"odstotek vrednosti za zavarovanje. Če ne, pustite vrednost 0. Upoštevajte, "
"da se cena zavarovanja izračuna šele po ustvarjanju nalepke, vključno z LTL "
"pošiljkami."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:86
msgid ""
"It is mandatory to fill both the production and sandbox tokens, but it could "
"be left as a random character as it is not validated at this point."
msgstr ""
"Obvezno je izpolniti žetone za produkcijo in za peskovnik, vendar je lahko "
"vnesen naključen znak, saj se na tej točki ne preverja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:89
msgid "Additional considerations for the :guilabel:`Envia Default Package`:"
msgstr "Dodatna opozorila za :guilabel:`Privzeti paket Envia`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:91
msgid ""
"The package is specified in :guilabel:`mm` and :guilabel:`kg`. The weight "
"refers to the container itself, not its contents. Leave the weight as `0` if "
"no weight is reported, and set the max weight to `0` if there is no "
"specified limit."
msgstr ""
"Paket je določen v :guilabel:`mm` in :guilabel:`kg`. Teža se nanaša na sam "
"vsebnik, ne na njegovo vsebino. Pustite težo na `0`, če teža ni navedena, in "
"nastavite največjo težo na `0`, če ni določene omejitve."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Envia Package Type`: Set to :guilabel:`Box` by default. Ensure "
"the correct type is selected, as it affects the available carriers and "
"options displayed, which vary depending on this selection."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vrsta paketa Envia`: Privzeto nastavljeno na :guilabel:`Škatla`. "
"Poskrbite, da je izbrana pravilna vrsta, saj to vpliva na razpoložljive "
"prevoznike in prikazane možnosti, ki se razlikujejo glede na ta izbor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:98
msgid ""
"Once previous fields are properly set, navigate to the :guilabel:`Envia "
"Configuration` tab, and in the :guilabel:`Envia.com Service Name` field, "
"click the :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`(refresh)` icon to sync the "
"carriers. In the pop-up window that appears, select a carrier and a service "
"level from the list."
msgstr ""
"Ko so prejšnja polja pravilno nastavljena, pojdite v "
"zavihek :guilabel:`Konfiguracija Envia` in v polju :guilabel:`Ime storitve "
"Envia.com` kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`(osveži)`, da "
"sinhronizirate prevoznike. V pojavnem oknu, ki se prikaže, izberite "
"prevoznika in raven storitve s seznama."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:103
msgid "Envia.com carrier and services popup."
msgstr "Pojavno okno s prevozniki in storitvami Envia.com."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:107
msgid ""
"Envia keeps the main currency of the account fixed. In order to provide more "
"precise conversions for the costs of shipping, specify the currency that is "
"set for the account on Envia. If necessary, Odoo offers the option to change "
"the country. By default it uses the country associated with the company."
msgstr ""
"Envia ima glavno valuto računa fiksno. Za natančnejše preračune stroškov "
"pošiljanja določite valuto, ki je nastavljena za račun na Envia. Po potrebi "
"Odoo ponuja možnost spremembe države. Privzeto uporablja državo, povezano s "
"podjetjem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:113
msgid ""
"If more than one shipping option is needed, create more shipping methods in "
"Odoo and modify any parameter like the package, carrier, or service."
msgstr ""
"Če je potrebna več kot ena možnost pošiljanja, ustvarite več načinov "
"pošiljanja v Odoo in spremenite katerikoli parameter, kot so paket, "
"prevoznik ali storitev."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:119
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:256
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:148
msgid "Shipping information"
msgstr "Podatki o pošiljanju"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:121
msgid ""
"To use Envia.com to generate shipping labels, the following information "
"**must** be filled out accurately and completely in Odoo:"
msgstr ""
"Za uporabo Envia.com za ustvarjanje nalepk za pošiljanje je **treba** v Odoo "
"natančno in popolno izpolniti naslednje podatke:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:124
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:261
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:153
msgid ""
"**Customer information**: When creating a quotation, ensure the "
"selected :guilabel:`Customer` has a valid phone number, email address, and "
"shipping address."
msgstr ""
"**Podatki o stranki**: Pri ustvarjanju ponudbe poskrbite, da ima "
"izbrana :guilabel:`Stranka` veljavno telefonsko številko, e-poštni naslov in "
"naslov za dostavo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:127
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:264
msgid ""
"To verify, select the :guilabel:`Customer` field to open their contact page. "
"Here, add their shipping address in the :guilabel:`Contact` field, along "
"with their :guilabel:`Mobile` number and :guilabel:`Email` address."
msgstr ""
"Za preverjanje izberite polje :guilabel:`Stranka`, da odprete njeno "
"kontaktno stran. Tukaj dodajte naslov za dostavo v polje :guilabel:`Kontakt` "
"skupaj s številko :guilabel:`Mobilni telefon` in :guilabel:`E-pošta`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:130
msgid ""
"**Product weight**: Ensure all products in a delivery order have a "
"specified :guilabel:`Weight` in the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab of their "
"product form. Refer to the :ref:`Product weight section <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/configure-weight>` of this article for detailed "
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"**Teža izdelka**: Poskrbite, da imajo vsi izdelki v dobavnem nalogu "
"navedeno :guilabel:`Teža` v zavihku :guilabel:`Zaloga` njihovega obrazca "
"izdelka. Za podrobna navodila glejte :ref:`razdelek Teža izdelka <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/configure-weight>` v tem članku."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:133
msgid ""
"**Warehouse address**: By default all packages are sent from the specified "
"address in the warehouse, make sure to set the address for correct label "
"generation."
msgstr ""
"**Naslov skladišča**: Privzeto so vsi paketi poslani z naslova, ki je "
"naveden v skladišču, zato poskrbite, da nastavite naslov za pravilno "
"generiranje nalepk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:137
