#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/invoicing.rst:5
msgid ""
"Invoicing customers for shipping after delivery ensures accurate charges "
"based on real-time shipping factors like distance, weight, and method."
msgstr ""
"Fakturiranje strank za pošiljanje po dostavi zagotavlja natančne stroške na "
"podlagi dejanskih dejavnikov pošiljanja, kot so razdalja, teža in način."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/invoicing.rst:8
msgid "In Odoo, shipping costs can be invoiced in two ways:"
msgstr "V Odoo je mogoče stroške pošiljanja fakturirati na dva načina:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/invoicing.rst:10
msgid ""
"Agree with the customer on a fixed cost and :ref:`include it in the sale "
