":ref:`povezavi združljivega tiskalnika z Odoojem <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/configure-printers>`, pojdite na "
":menuselection:`Inventar --> Konfiguracija --> Upravljanje tiskalnikov` in "
"izberite želeni tiskalnik."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:300
msgid ""
"In the printer configuration form, select the :guilabel:`Shipping Documents` "
"report in the :guilabel:`Linked Reports` field."
msgstr ""
"Na obrazcu za konfiguracijo tiskalnika izberite poročilo "
":guilabel:`Dokumenti za pošiljanje` v polju :guilabel:`Povezana poročila`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:305
