msgid "Package content"
msgstr "Vsebina paketa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:316
msgid ""
"A *package content* PDF includes the package's barcode, packed date, along "
"with a list of contained products and quantities."
msgstr ""
"PDF z *vsebino paketa* vključuje črtno kodo paketa, datum pakiranja ter "
"seznam vsebovanih izdelkov in količin."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:319
msgid ""
"To print this form automatically, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Operation Types`, and select the desired operation type. "
"Then, go to the :guilabel:`Hardware` tab, and tick the :guilabel:`Package "
"Contents` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Za samodejni izpis tega obrazca pojdite na :menuselection:`aplikacija Zaloga "
"--> Konfiguracija --> Vrste operacij` in izberite želeno vrsto operacije. "
"Nato pojdite na zavihek :guilabel:`Strojna oprema` in označite potrditveno "
"polje :guilabel:`Vsebina paketa`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:324
msgid ""
"If the option is not available, enable the :doc:`Packages <../../"
"product_management/configure/package>` feature, by going "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings`, ticking "
"the :guilabel:`Packages` checkbox, and clicking :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Če možnost ni na voljo, omogočite funkcijo :doc:`Paketi <../../"
"product_management/configure/package>`, tako da greste "
"na :menuselection:`aplikacija Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve`, "
"označite potrditveno polje :guilabel:`Paketi` in kliknete :guilabel:`Shrani`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:329
msgid ""
"After enabling the feature in the :guilabel:`Hardware` tab, validating the "
"operation prints a PDF of the package contents."
msgstr ""
"Po omogočitvi funkcije v zavihku :guilabel:`Strojna oprema` potrjevanje "
"operacije izpiše PDF z vsebino paketa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:334
msgid ""
"Package contents form showing the package contents, barcode, and pack date."
msgstr ""
"Obrazec vsebine paketa, ki prikazuje vsebino paketa, črtno kodo in datum "
"pakiranja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:338
msgid "Package contents showing the package contents, barcode, and pack date."
msgstr ""
"Vsebina paketa, ki prikazuje vsebino paketa, črtno kodo in datum pakiranja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:343
msgid "Package label"
msgstr "Nalepka paketa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:345
msgid ""
"A *package label* that shows the package's barcode and pack date can be "
"configured to print upon clicking the *Put in Pack* button."
msgstr ""
"*Nalepka paketa*, ki prikazuje črtno kodo paketa in datum pakiranja, se "
"lahko nastavi tako, da se izpiše ob kliku na gumb *Spakuj*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:349
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Put in Pack` button is available **only** when "
"the :doc:`Packages <../../product_management/configure/package>` feature is "
"enabled in :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr ""
"Gumb :guilabel:`Spakuj` je na voljo **samo**, ko je funkcija :doc:`Paketi "
"<../../product_management/configure/package>` omogočena "
"v :menuselection:`aplikacija Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:353
msgid ""
"After it is enabled, the :guilabel:`Put in Pack` button is available on all "
"inventory operations (e.g. receipt, pickings, internal transfers, delivery "
"orders, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Ko je omogočena, je gumb :guilabel:`Spakuj` na voljo pri vseh operacijah z "
"zalogo (npr. prejem, pobiranje, notranji prenosi, dobavnice itd.)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:356
msgid ""
"To automatically print the package label when the :guilabel:`Put in Pack` "
"button is clicked, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> "
"Operation Types`. Select the desired operation type, and tick "
"the :guilabel:`Package Label` checkbox in the :guilabel:`Hardware` tab. "
"Labels can be printed in :guilabel:`PDF` or :guilabel:`ZPL` file formats, as "
"defined in the :guilabel:`Print label as` field."
msgstr ""
"Za samodejni izpis nalepke paketa, ko je kliknjen gumb :guilabel:`Spakuj`, "
"pojdite na :menuselection:`aplikacija Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> Vrste "
"operacij`. Izberite želeno vrsto operacije in označite potrditveno "
"polje :guilabel:`Nalepka paketa` v zavihku :guilabel:`Strojna oprema`. "
"Nalepke je mogoče natisniti v datotečnih formatih :guilabel:`PDF` "
"ali :guilabel:`ZPL`, kot je določeno v polju :guilabel:`Natisni nalepko kot`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:364
msgid "PDF of package barcode and package date."
msgstr "PDF s črtno kodo paketa in datumom pakiranja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:3
msgid "Sendcloud integration"
msgstr "Integracija s Sendcloud"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:5
msgid ""
"Sendcloud is a shipping service aggregator that facilitates the integration "
"of European shipping carriers with Odoo. Once integrated, users can select "
"shipping carriers on inventory operations in their Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"Sendcloud je agregator dostave, ki omogoča integracijo evropskih prevoznikov "
"z Odoo. Po integraciji lahko uporabniki izberejo prevoznike za operacije z "
"zalogo v svoji bazi podatkov Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:10
msgid "Setup in Sendcloud"
msgstr "Nastavitev v Sendcloud"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:15
msgid ""
"To get started, `create or log in to a Sendcloud account <https://"
"account.sendcloud.com/signup/ ?"
"utm_source=odoo&utm_medium=partnerships&utm_campaign=partner_integrations_page>`_. "
"On the Sendcloud platform, follow the `Sendcloud integration documentation "
"<https://support.sendcloud.com/hc/en-us/articles/360059470491-Odoo-Native-"
"integration>`_ to configure the account and generate the connector "
"credentials."
msgstr ""
"Za začetek `ustvarite račun Sendcloud ali se vanj prijavite <https://"
"account.sendcloud.com/signup/ "
"?utm_source=odoo&utm_medium=partnerships&utm_campaign=partner_integrations_page>"
"`_. Na platformi Sendcloud sledite `dokumentaciji za integracijo Sendcloud "
"<https://support.sendcloud.com/hc/en-us/articles/360059470491-Odoo-Native-"
"integration>`_ za konfiguracijo računa in ustvarjanje poverilnic za "
"povezovalnik."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:22
msgid ""
"For new account creation, Sendcloud will ask for a :abbr:`VAT (Value-Added "
"Tax Identification)` number or :abbr:`EORI (Economic Operators' Registration "
"and Identification)` number. After completing the account setup, activate "
"(or deactivate) the shipping carriers that will be used in the Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"Pri ustvarjanju novega računa bo Sendcloud zahteval številko :abbr:`DDV "
"(identifikacijska številka za davek na dodano vrednost)` ali "
"številko :abbr:`EORI (registracija in identifikacija gospodarskih "
"subjektov)`. Po dokončanju nastavitve računa aktivirajte (ali deaktivirajte) "
"prevoznike, ki bodo uporabljeni v bazi podatkov Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:28
msgid ""
"Odoo integration of Sendcloud works on free Sendcloud plans *only* if a bank "
"account is linked, since Sendcloud won't ship for free. To use shipping "
"rules, or individual custom carrier contacts, a paid plan of Sendcloud is "
"**required**."
msgstr ""
"Integracija Odoo s Sendcloud deluje na brezplačnih načrtih Sendcloud *samo*, "
"če je povezan bančni račun, saj Sendcloud ne bo pošiljal brezplačno. Za "
"uporabo pravil dostave ali posameznih kontaktov prevoznikov po meri je "
"**potreben** plačljiv načrt Sendcloud."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:35
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:185
msgid "Warehouse configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija skladišča"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:37
msgid ""
"Once logged into the Sendcloud account, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings "
"--> Shipping --> Addresses`, and fill in the field for :guilabel:`Warehouse "
"address`."
msgstr ""
"Ko ste prijavljeni v račun Sendcloud, pojdite na :menuselection:`Nastavitve "
"--> Dostava --> Naslovi` in izpolnite polje za :guilabel:`Naslov skladišča`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:40
msgid "Adding addresses in the Sendcloud settings."
msgstr "Dodajanje naslovov v nastavitvah Sendcloud."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:43
msgid ""
"To allow Sendcloud to process returns as well, a :guilabel:`Return Address` "
"is required. Under the :guilabel:`Miscellaneous section`, there is a field "
"called :guilabel:`Address Name (optional)`. The Odoo warehouse name should "
"be entered here, and the characters should be exactly the same."
msgstr ""
"Če želite, da Sendcloud obdeluje tudi vračila, je potreben :guilabel:`Naslov "
"za vračilo`. Pod :guilabel:`razdelkom Razno` je polje z "
"imenom :guilabel:`Ime naslova (neobvezno)`. Tukaj je treba vnesti ime "
"skladišča Odoo, znaki pa morajo biti popolnoma enaki."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:0
msgid "**SendClould configuration**"
msgstr "**Konfiguracija SendClould**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Miscellaneous`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Razno`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Address Name (optional)`: `Warehouse #1`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Ime naslova (neobvezno)`: `Skladišče #1`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Brand`: `Default`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Blagovna znamka`: `Privzeto`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:0
msgid "**Odoo warehouse configuration**"
msgstr "**Konfiguracija skladišča Odoo**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Warehouse`: `Warehouse #1`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Skladišče`: `Skladišče #1`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Short Name`: `WH`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Kratko ime`: `WH`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Company`: `My company (San Francisco)`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Podjetje`: `Moje podjetje (San Francisco)`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Address`: `My Company (San Francisco)`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Naslov`: `Moje podjetje (San Francisco)`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:60
msgid ""
"Notice how the inputs for the :guilabel:`Warehouse` field, for both the Odoo "
"configuration and the Sendcloud configuration, are the exact same."
msgstr ""
"Opazite, kako so vnosi za polje :guilabel:`Skladišče` tako v konfiguraciji "
"Odoo kot v konfiguraciji Sendcloud popolnoma enaki."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:64
msgid "Generate Sendcloud credentials"
msgstr "Ustvarjanje poverilnic Sendcloud"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:66
msgid ""
"In the Sendcloud account, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Integrations` in the menu on the right. Next, search for :guilabel:`Odoo "
"Native`. Then, click on :guilabel:`Connect`."
msgstr ""
"V računu Sendcloud pojdite na :menuselection:`Nastavitve --> Integracije` v "
"meniju na desni. Nato poiščite :guilabel:`Odoo Native`. Nato kliknite "
"na :guilabel:`Poveži`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:69
msgid ""
"After clicking on :guilabel:`Connect`, the page redirects to "
"the :guilabel:`Sendcloud API` settings page, where the :guilabel:`Public and "
"Secret Keys` are produced. The next step is to name "
"the :guilabel:`Integration`. The naming convention is as follows: `Odoo "
"CompanyName`, with the user's company name replacing `CompanyName` (e.g. "
"`Odoo Stealthy Wood`)."
msgstr ""
"Po kliku na :guilabel:`Poveži`, se stran preusmeri na stran z nastavitvami "
":guilabel:`Sendcloud API`, kjer se ustvarijo :guilabel:`javni in skrivni "
"ključi`. Naslednji korak je poimenovanje :guilabel:`Integracije`. Konvencija "
"poimenovanja je naslednja: `Odoo ImePodjetja`, pri čemer uporabnikovo ime "
"podjetja nadomesti `ImePodjetja` (npr. `Odoo Stealthy Wood`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:74
msgid ""
"Then, check the box next to :guilabel:`Service Points` and select the "
"shipping services for this integration. After saving, the :guilabel:`Public "
"and Secret Keys` are generated."
msgstr ""
"Nato potrdite polje poleg :guilabel:`Servisne točke` in izberite storitve "
"pošiljanja za to integracijo. Po shranjevanju sta "
"ustvarjena :guilabel:`Javni in skrivni ključi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:77
msgid "Configuring the Sendcloud integration and receiving the credentials."
msgstr "Konfiguracija integracije Sendcloud in prejemanje poverilnic."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:83
msgid ""
"To ensure seamless Sendcloud integration with Odoo, :ref:`install <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/sendcloud-module>` and :ref:`link <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/link-sendcloud-module>` the Sendcloud shipping connector "
"to the Sendcloud account. Then, :ref:`configure Odoo fields <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/sendcloud-shipping-info>`, so Sendcloud can accurately "
"pull shipping data to generate labels."
msgstr ""
"Za zagotovitev nemotene integracije Sendcloud z Odoo :ref:`namestite "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/sendcloud-module>` in :ref:`povežite "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/link-sendcloud-module>` konektor za pošiljanje "
"Sendcloud z računom Sendcloud. Nato :ref:`konfigurirajte polja Odoo "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/sendcloud-shipping-info>`, da lahko Sendcloud "
"pravilno pridobi podatke o pošiljanju za ustvarjanje nalepk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:91
msgid ""
":ref:`Enable pickup points on websites <inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"sendcloud-pickups>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Omogočanje prevzemnih točk na spletnih mestih <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/sendcloud-pickups>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:96
msgid "Install Sendcloud shipping module"
msgstr "Namestitev modula za pošiljanje Sendcloud"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:98
msgid ""
"After the Sendcloud account is set up and configured, it's time to configure "
"the Odoo database. To get started, go to Odoo's :guilabel:`Apps` module, "
"search for the `Sendcloud Shipping`, and :ref:`install it <general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"Ko je račun Sendcloud nastavljen in konfiguriran, je čas za konfiguracijo "
"baze podatkov Odoo. Za začetek pojdite v Odoojevo aplikacijo "
":guilabel:`Aplikacije`, poiščite `Sendcloud Shipping` in ga :ref:`namestite "
"<general/install>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:102
msgid "Sendcloud Shipping module in the Odoo Apps module."
msgstr "Modul Sendcloud Shipping v modulu Aplikace Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:108
msgid "Sendcloud shipping connector configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija konektorja za dostavo Sendcloud"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:110
msgid ""
"Once installed, activate the :guilabel:`Sendcloud Shipping` module "
"in :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings`. "
"The :guilabel:`Sendcloud Connector` setting is found under "
"the :guilabel:`Shipping Connectors` section."
msgstr ""
"Po namestitvi aktivirajte modul :guilabel:`Sendcloud Shipping` "
"v :menuselection:`Zalog --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve`. "
"Nastavitev :guilabel:`Sendcloud Connector` se nahaja v "
"razdelku :guilabel:`Shipping Connectors`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:114
msgid ""
"After activating the :guilabel:`Sendcloud Connector`, click on "
"the :guilabel:`Sendcloud Delivery Methods` link below the listed connector. "
"Once on the :guilabel:`Delivery Methods` page, click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Po aktivaciji :guilabel:`povezovalnika Sendcloud`, kliknite povezavo "
":guilabel:`Načini dostave Sendcloud` pod navedenim povezovalnikom. Ko ste na "
"strani :guilabel:`Načini dostave`, kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:119
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Methods` can also be accessed by going "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Delivery Methods`."
msgstr ""
"Do :guilabel:`Načinov dostave` lahko dostopate tudi tako, da greste na "
":menuselection:`Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> Dostava --> Načini dostave`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:122
msgid ""
"Fill out the following fields in the :guilabel:`New Delivery Method` form:"
msgstr "Izpolnite naslednja polja na obrazcu :guilabel:`Nov način dostave`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:124
msgid ":guilabel:`Delivery Method`: Type `Sendcloud DPD`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Način dostave`: Vnesite `Sendcloud DPD`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:125
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Provider`: Select :guilabel:`Sendcloud` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Ponudnik`: izberite :guilabel:`Sendcloud` iz spustnega menija."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:126
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Product`: Set the product that was configured for this "
"shipping method or create a new product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Product`: nastavite izdelek, ki je bil konfiguriran za "
"to metodo dostave, ali ustvarite nov izdelek."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:128
msgid ":guilabel:`Invoicing Policy`: Select one of the options."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Pravilnik o zaračunavanju`: Izberite eno od možnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:129
msgid "In the :guilabel:`SendCloud Configuration` tab:"
msgstr "V zavihku :guilabel:`Konfiguracija SendCloud`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:131
msgid "Enter the :guilabel:`Sendcloud Public Key`."
