"to pojdite v modul :guilabel:`Aplikacije` v Odoo, poiščite "
"modul :guilabel:`Starshipit Shipping` in kliknite :guilabel:`Aktiviraj`, da "
"ga namestite."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:99
