#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:245
msgid ""
"This can be done by clicking the :guilabel:`Return` smart button on the "
"intended delivery order. If the selected courier supports returns, "
"the :guilabel:`Print Return Label` button will be available."
msgstr ""
"To lahko storite s klikom na pametni gumb :guilabel:`Vračilo` v želenem "
"dobavnem nalogu. Če izbrani kurir podpira vračila, bo na voljo "
"gumb :guilabel:`Natisni nalepko za vračilo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:252
msgid ""
"If a delivery order is cancelled in Odoo, it will be automatically archived "
"in Starshipit. However, the cancellation will not be sent to the courier "
"itself, so make sure to log onto the courier's platform to handle the "
"cancellation manually."
msgstr ""
"Če je dobavni nalog preklican v Odoo, bo samodejno arhiviran v Starshipit. "
"Preklic pa ne bo poslan kurirju samemu, zato se prepričajte, da se prijavite "
"na platformo kurirja in preklic obravnavate ročno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:3
msgid "Third-party shipping carriers"
msgstr "Zunanji prevozniki pošiljk"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:10
msgid ""
"Users can link third-party shipping carriers to Odoo databases, in order to "
"verify carriers' delivery to specific addresses, :doc:`automatically "
"calculate shipping costs <../setup_configuration>`, and :doc:`generate "
"shipping labels <labels>`."
msgstr ""
"Uporabniki lahko povežejo zunanje prevoznike pošiljk z zbirkami podatkov "
"Odoo, da preverijo dostavo prevoznikov na določene naslove, :doc:`samodejno "
"izračunajo stroške pošiljanja <../setup_configuration>` in :doc:`ustvarijo "
"nalepke za pošiljanje <labels>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:14
msgid ""
"In Odoo, shipping carriers can be applied to a sales order (SO), invoice, or "
"delivery order. For tips on resolving common issues when configuring "
"shipping connectors, skip to the :ref:`Troubleshooting <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/third-party-troubles>` section."
msgstr ""
"V Odoo je mogoče prevoznike pošiljk uporabiti za prodajni nalog, račun ali "
"dobavnico. Za nasvete o reševanju pogostih težav pri konfiguraciji "
"povezovalnikov za pošiljanje preskočite na razdelek :ref:`Odpravljanje težav "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/third-party-troubles>`."

