#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:3
msgid "Scrap inventory"
msgstr "Odpis zaloge"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:8
msgid ""
"Sometimes, products in a company's warehouse stock might be found to be "
"damaged or defective, past the point of being reparable. If it is not "
"possible to repair the product or return it to a vendor, it can be scrapped. "
"Odoo **Inventory** allows users to scrap inventory, designating goods or "
"materials that are no longer usable or sellable for disposal (or recycling)."
msgstr ""
"Včasih se lahko zgodi, da so izdelki na zalogi podjetja poškodovani ali "
"pokvarjeni in jih ni mogoče popraviti. Če izdelka ni mogoče popraviti ali "
"vrniti dobavitelju, ga je mogoče izločiti. Odoo **Zaloge** uporabnikom "
"omogoča izločitev zalog, pri čemer se blago ali materiali, ki niso več "
"uporabni ali prodajni, določijo za odstranitev (ali recikliranje)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:13
msgid ""
"Scrapping inventory in a database helps stock counts remain accurate by "
"removing scrapped products from physical inventory and placing it in a "
"virtual scrap location (*Inventory adjustment*)."
msgstr ""
"Izločitev zalog v bazi podatkov pomaga ohranjati natančno štetje zalog, tako "
"da odstrani izločene izdelke iz fizične zaloge in jih premesti na virtualno "
"lokacijo za izločitev (*Popravek zaloge*)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:17
msgid ""
"*Virtual locations* in Odoo are **not** real, physical spaces in a "
"warehouse. Rather, they are designated locations in a database that provide "
"tracking of items that shouldn't be counted in a physical inventory."
msgstr ""
"*Virtualne lokacije* v Odoo **niso** resnični, fizični prostori v skladišču. "
"Gre za določene lokacije v zbirki podatkov, ki omogočajo sledenje elementom, "
"ki se ne smejo šteti v fizični inventuri."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:21
msgid ""
"For more information about virtual locations, see the documentation about "
"the different types of :ref:`location types <inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"location-type>`."
msgstr ""
"Za več informacij o virtualnih lokacijah glejte dokumentacijo o različnih "
"vrstah :ref:`vrst lokacij <inventory/warehouses_storage/location-type>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:27
msgid "Scrap from stock"
msgstr "Odpis iz zaloge"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:29
msgid ""
"To create a new scrap order (SP) for an in-stock product, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Operations --> Scrap`, and "
"click :guilabel:`New`. This opens a new |SP| form."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje novega naloga za odpis (SP) za izdelek na zalogi se pomaknite "
"na :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Operations --> Scrap` in "
"kliknite :guilabel:`New`. To odpre nov obrazec |SP|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:32
msgid ""
"Click the drop-down menu in the :guilabel:`Product` field and select the "
"product that should be scrapped from inventory. In the :guilabel:`Quantity` "
"field, change the value to the quantity of the product that should be "
"scrapped. By default, this value is set to `0.00`. If the product is tracked "
"by lot or serial number, specify the tracking number in the :guilabel:`Lot/"
"Serial Numbers` field. The :guilabel:`Source Location` defaults to the "
"location where the product is currently stored. The :guilabel:`Scrap "
"Location` defaults to the designated scrap location (:guilabel:`Inventory "
"adjustment`). Either of these locations can be changed by selecting a "
"different location from their respective drop-down menus."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite spustni meni v polju :guilabel:`Izdelek` in izberite izdelek, ki ga "
"je treba izločiti iz zaloge. V polju :guilabel:`Količina` spremenite "
"vrednost na količino izdelka, ki ga je treba izločiti. Privzeto je ta "
"vrednost nastavljena na `0.00`. Če se izdelek spremlja po serijski številki "
"ali številki lota, določite številko za sledenje v polju :guilabel:`Serijske "
"številke/Loti`. Polje :guilabel:`Izvorna lokacija` je privzeto nastavljeno "
"na lokacijo, kjer je izdelek trenutno shranjen. Polje :guilabel:`Lokacija za "
"izločitev` je privzeto nastavljeno na določeno lokacijo za izločitev "
"(:guilabel:`Popravek zaloge`). Katero koli od teh lokacij lahko spremenite "
"tako, da izberete drugo lokacijo v ustreznem spustnem meniju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:42
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:94
