"filter` :guilabel:`Filters` list, expand the :guilabel:`Incoming Date` "
"section and select at least one month or quarter and at least one year."
msgstr ""
"Za ogled izdelkov, količin in njihovih lokacij za določen mesec ali "
"četrtletje kliknite v vrstico :guilabel:`Iskanje`. Na seznamu :icon:`fa-"
"filter` :guilabel:`Filtri` razširite razdelek :guilabel:`Datum prejema` in "
"izberite vsaj en mesec ali četrtletje ter vsaj eno leto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/detailed_stock.rst:65
