msgid ":icon:`oi-view-kanban` Kanban"
msgstr ":icon:`oi-view-kanban` Kanban"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:190
msgid ""
"The Kanban view displays one card per move, with the associated "
"product, :guilabel:`Quantity`, and :guilabel:`Demand`. It offers the least "
"analytical depth of the four views, but is useful for browsing recent moves "
"without configuring a list, pivot, or graph."
msgstr ""
"Kanban prikaz prikaže eno kartico na premik s povezanim izdelkom, "
":guilabel:`Količino` in :guilabel:`Povpraševanjem`. Ponuja najmanj "
"analitične globine od vseh štirih prikazov, vendar je uporaben za brskanje "
"po nedavnih premikih brez konfiguriranja seznama, vrtilne tabele ali grafa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:194
msgid "The Moves Analysis report in the Kanban view."
msgstr "Poročilo Analiza premikov v Kanban prikazu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:200
msgid "Aging report"
msgstr "Poročilo o staranju"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:202
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Aging Report` is a :ref:`Favorites <inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/moves-analysis-search-options>` filter that pre-"
"configures the :guilabel:`Moves Analysis` pivot view to "
"track :guilabel:`Remaining Quantity` and :guilabel:`Remaining Value` month "
"over month for each product. This can help identify slow-moving or aging "
"stock, such as perishable goods approaching the end of their shelf life."
msgstr ""
"The :guilabel:`Poročilo o staranju` je filter :ref:`Priljubljene <inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/moves-analysis-search-options>`, ki vnaprej konfigurira "
"vrtilno tabelo :guilabel:`Analiza premikov` za sledenje :guilabel:`Preostali "
"količini` in :guilabel:`Preostali vrednosti` mesečno za vsak izdelek. To "
"lahko pomaga pri prepoznavanju počasi gibajočih se ali starajočih se zalog, "
"kot so pokvarljivo blago, ki se bliža koncu roka uporabnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:208
msgid ""
"Select the Aging Report favorite filter from the Moves Analysis search bar."
msgstr ""
"Izberite priljubljeni filter Poročilo o staranju v iskalni vrstici Analize "
"premikov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:211
