":guilabel:`Naraščajoče`: podatki so prikazani v naraščajočem vrstnem redu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:324
msgid ""
"When viewing the data as a :guilabel:`Line Chart` graph, the data can be "
"formatted in the following ways:"
msgstr ""
"Pri ogledu podatkov kot grafikon :guilabel:`Črtni grafikon` je mogoče "
"podatke oblikovati na naslednje načine:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:328
msgid ":guilabel:`Cumulative`: the data is increasingly accumulated."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Kumulativno`: podatki se postopoma kopičijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:332
msgid ""
"When viewing the data as a :guilabel:`Pie Chart` graph, all relevant data is "
"displayed by default, and no additional formatting options are available."
msgstr ""
"Pri ogledu podatkov kot grafikon :guilabel:`Tortni grafikon` so vsi ustrezni "
"podatki privzeto prikazani in dodatne možnosti oblikovanja niso na voljo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:336
msgid "Activity view"
msgstr "Pogled dejavnosti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:338
msgid ""
"With the :guilabel:`Activity` view selected, all open maintenance requests "
"are listed in their own row, with the ability to schedule activities related "
"to those requests."
msgstr ""
"Ko je izbran pogled :guilabel:`Dejavnost`, so vsa odprta vzdrževalna "
"zahtevka navedena v svoji vrstici z možnostjo načrtovanja dejavnosti, "
"povezanih s temi zahtevki."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:341
msgid "Maintenance requests on Activity view."
msgstr "Vzdrževalni zahtevki v pogledu dejavnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:345
msgid ""
"Maintenance requests are listed in the :guilabel:`Maintenance Request` "
"column as activities. Clicking a request opens a :guilabel:`Maintenance "
"Request` popover that indicates the status of the request, and the "
"responsible technician. To schedule an activity directly from the popover, "
"click :guilabel:`➕ Schedule an activity`. This opens a :guilabel:`Schedule "
"Activity` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Vzdrževalni zahtevki so navedeni v stolpcu :guilabel:`Vzdrževalni zahtevek` "
"kot dejavnosti. S klikom na zahtevek se odpre pojavno "
"okno :guilabel:`Vzdrževalni zahtevek`, ki prikazuje stanje zahtevka in "
"odgovornega tehnika. Če želite načrtovati dejavnost neposredno iz pojavnega "
"okna, kliknite :guilabel:`⊕ Načrtuj dejavnost`. To odpre pojavno "
"okno :guilabel:`Načrtuj dejavnost`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:350
msgid ""
"From the pop-up window, choose the :guilabel:`Activity Type`, provide "
"a :guilabel:`Summary`, schedule a :guilabel:`Due Date`, and choose the "
"responsible user in the :guilabel:`Assigned to` field."
msgstr ""
"V pojavnem oknu izberite :guilabel:`Vrsta dejavnosti`, "
"navedite :guilabel:`Povzetek`, načrtujte :guilabel:`Datum zapadlosti` in "
"izberite odgovornega uporabnika v polju :guilabel:`Dodeljeno`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:354
msgid "Schedule Activity pop-up window."
msgstr "Pojavno okno za načrtovanje dejavnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:358
msgid ""
"Type any additional notes for the new activity in the blank space under the "
"greyed-out :guilabel:`Log a note...` field. When clicked, this changes "
"to :guilabel:`Type \"/\" for commands`."
msgstr ""
"V prazen prostor pod sivim poljem :guilabel:`Zapiši opombo...` vnesite "
"morebitne dodatne opombe za novo dejavnost. Ko kliknete, se to spremeni "
"v :guilabel:`Vnesite \"/\" za ukaze`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:361
msgid ""
"Once ready, click :guilabel:`Schedule` to schedule the activity. "
"Alternatively, click :guilabel:`Schedule & Mark as Done` to close the "
"activity, click :guilabel:`Done & Schedule Next` to close the activity and "
"open a new one, or click :guilabel:`Cancel` to cancel the activity."
msgstr ""
"Ko je pripravljeno, kliknite :guilabel:`Načrtuj`, da načrtujete dejavnost. "
"Druga možnost je, da kliknete :guilabel:`Načrtuj in označi kot opravljeno`, "
"da zaprete dejavnost, kliknete :guilabel:`Opravljeno in načrtuj naslednjo`, "
"da zaprete dejavnost in odprete novo, ali kliknete :guilabel:`Prekliči`, da "
"prekličete dejavnost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:365
msgid ""
"With the :guilabel:`Activity` view selected, each activity type available "
"when scheduling an activity is listed as its own column. These columns "
"are :guilabel:`Email`, :guilabel:`Call`, :guilabel:`Meeting`, :guilabel:`Maintenance "
"Request`, :guilabel:`To-Do`, :guilabel:`Upload Document`, :guilabel:`Request "
"Signature`, and :guilabel:`Grant Approval`."
msgstr ""
"Ko je izbran pogled :guilabel:`Dejavnost`, je vsaka vrsta dejavnosti, ki je "
"na voljo pri načrtovanju dejavnosti, navedena kot lasten stolpec. Ti stolpci "
"so :guilabel:`E-"
"pošta`, :guilabel:`Klic`, :guilabel:`Sestanek`, :guilabel:`Vzdrževalni "
"zahtevek`, :guilabel:`Opravilo`, :guilabel:`Naloži "
"dokument`, :guilabel:`Zahtevaj podpis` in :guilabel:`Odobri`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:370
msgid ""
"To schedule an activity with that specific activity type, click into any "
"blank box on the corresponding row for the desired maintenance request, and "
"click the :guilabel:`➕ (plus)` icon. This opens an :guilabel:`Odoo` pop-up "
"window, wherein the activity can be scheduled."
msgstr ""
"Če želite načrtovati dejavnost s to določeno vrsto dejavnosti, kliknite v "
"prazno polje v ustrezni vrstici za želeni vzdrževalni zahtevek in kliknite "
"ikono :guilabel:`⊕ (plus)`. To odpre pojavno okno :guilabel:`Odoo`, v "
"katerem lahko načrtujete dejavnost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:374
msgid "Odoo pop-up schedule activity window."
msgstr "Pojavno okno Odoo za načrtovanje dejavnosti."

