#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:75
msgid "Dismantle product"
msgstr "Razstavite izdelek"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:77
msgid ""
"After the |MO| is confirmed, the product can be broken down into its "
"component parts."
msgstr "Ko je |MO| potrjen, je mogoče izdelek razstaviti na sestavne dele."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:79
msgid "Retrieve the parts, or by-products, from the product."
msgstr "Pridobite dele oziroma stranske proizvode iz izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:81
msgid ""
"If the by-products are tracked by lot or serial number, open the *By-"
"Products* tab of the |MO|. Click the :icon:`fa-list` :guilabel:`(Show "
"Details)` icon to open the *Move Byproduct* window. Enter the :guilabel:`Lot/"
"Serial Number` for each by-product, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Če se stranski proizvodi sledijo po lotih ali serijskih številkah, odprite "
"zavihek *Stranski proizvodi* v |MO|. Kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-list` "
":guilabel:`(Prikaži podrobnosti)`, da odprete okno *Premakni stranski "
"proizvod*. Za vsak stranski proizvod vnesite :guilabel:`Lot/serijsko "
"številko` in nato kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:85
msgid "Two axle by-products are assigned serial numbers."
msgstr "Dvema stranskima proizvodoma osi sta dodeljeni serijski številki."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:91
msgid "Enter by-products into inventory"
msgstr "Vnesite stranske proizvode v zalogo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:93
msgid ""
"To enter the by-products into inventory, click the :guilabel:`Produce All` "
"button on the |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Za vnos stranskih proizvodov v zalogo kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Proizvedi "
"vse` na |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:95
msgid ""
"To confirm that the products have been entered into inventory, click "
"the :icon:`oi-arrow-up` :guilabel:`Traceability` smart button. A "
"*Traceability Report* opens, showing the manufacturing order responsible for "
"creating the by-products in the :guilabel:`Reference` column, "
"the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial #` associated with the by-products, where it is "
"moving :guilabel:`From` and :guilabel:`To`, and the :guilabel:`Quantity`."
msgstr ""
"Za potrditev, da so bili izdelki vneseni v zalogo, kliknite pametni gumb "
":icon:`oi-arrow-up` :guilabel:`Sledljivost`. Odpre se *Poročilo o "
"sledljivosti*, ki prikazuje proizvodni nalog, odgovoren za ustvarjanje "
"stranskih proizvodov v stolpcu :guilabel:`Sklic`, :guilabel:`Lot/serijsko "
"št.`, povezano s stranskimi proizvodi, premik med lokacijama :guilabel:`Od` "
"in :guilabel:`Do` ter :guilabel:`Količino`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:101
msgid "A traceability report for a car and its by-products."
msgstr "Poročilo o sledljivosti za avtomobil in njegove stranske proizvode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:104
msgid ""
"Similar information can be found on the :icon:`fa-"
"exchange` :guilabel:`Product Moves` smart button of the manufacturing order."
msgstr ""
"Podobne informacije so na voljo prek pametnega gumba :icon:`fa-exchange` "
":guilabel:`Premiki izdelkov` na proizvodnem nalogu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:107
msgid "An Inventory Moves report for a car and its by-products."
msgstr "Poročilo o premikih zaloge za avtomobil in njegove stranske proizvode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:3
msgid "Manufacture with lots and serial numbers"
msgstr "Proizvodnja s serijami in serijskimi številkami"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:8
msgid ""
"In Odoo, *lot numbers* and *serial numbers* are used to identify and track "
"products in Odoo. Serial numbers are used to assign unique numbers to "
"individual products, while lot numbers are used to assign a single number to "
"multiple units of a specific product."
msgstr ""
"V Odoo se *serijske številke* in *serijske številke* uporabljajo za "
"identifikacijo in sledenje izdelkov v Odoo. Serijske številke se uporabljajo "
"za dodelitev edinstvenih številk posameznim izdelkom, medtem ko se serijske "
"številke uporabljajo za dodelitev ene številke več enotam določenega izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:12
msgid ""
"When manufacturing products tracked using lots or serial numbers, Odoo "
"requires the lot or serial number to be assigned to each product before "
"manufacturing can be completed. This ensures that each product is properly "
"tracked from the moment it enters inventory."
msgstr ""
"Pri proizvodnji izdelkov, ki se sledijo s serijami ali serijskimi "
"številkami, Odoo zahteva, da se serija ali serijska številka dodeli vsakemu "
"izdelku, preden se lahko proizvodnja zaključi. To zagotavlja, da se vsak "
"izdelek pravilno sledi od trenutka, ko pride v zalogo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:22
msgid ""
"To track a product using lots or serial numbers, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings`, then scroll "
"down to the :guilabel:`Traceability` section, and tick the :guilabel:`Lots & "
"Serial Numbers` checkbox. Finally, click :guilabel:`Save` to save the change."
msgstr ""
"Za sledenje izdelka s serijami ali serijskimi številkami začnite tako, da se "
"pomaknete na :menuselection:`Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve`, nato "
"se pomaknite navzdol do razdelka :guilabel:`Sledljivost` in označite "
"potrditveno polje :guilabel:`Serije in serijske številke`. Nazadnje "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`, da shranite spremembo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:26
msgid ""
"Next, click on :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Products --> Products`, "
"and open a product to track. In the :guilabel:`Tracking` field, "
"select :guilabel:`By Lots` to track the product using lot numbers, "
"or :guilabel:`By Unique Serial Number` to track the product using serial "
"numbers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:31
msgid ":doc:`Lots <../../inventory/product_management/product_tracking/lots>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Loti <../../inventory/product_management/product_tracking/lots>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:32
msgid ""
":doc:`Serial numbers <../../inventory/product_management/product_tracking/"
"serial_numbers>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Serijske številke <../../inventory/product_management/product_tracking/"
"serial_numbers>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:37
msgid ""
"To manufacture a product tracked with lots, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`. "
"Click :guilabel:`New` to create a new manufacturing order (MO)."
msgstr ""
"Za proizvodnjo izdelka, ki se sledi s serijami, začnite tako, da se "
"pomaknete na :menuselection:`Proizvodnja --> Operacije --> Proizvodna "
"naročila`. Kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`, da ustvarite novo proizvodno naročilo "
"(PN)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:41
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Product` field, select a product tracked using lots, and "
"enter the desired :guilabel:`Quantity`. Click :guilabel:`Confirm` to confirm "
"the |MO|."
msgstr ""
"V polju :guilabel:`Izdelek` izberite izdelek, ki se sledi s serijami, in "
"vnesite želeno :guilabel:`Količino`. Kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`, da "
"potrdite |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:44
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:72
msgid ""
"Once the |MO| is confirmed, a :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` field appears in "
"the top section of the |MO| form. By default, this field is empty."
msgstr ""
"Ko je |MO| potrjeno, se v zgornjem delu obrazca |MO| prikaže "
"polje :guilabel:`Serija/serijska številka`. Privzeto je to polje prazno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:47
msgid ""
"To populate the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` field with a lot number, click "
"the :icon:`fa-plus-square-o` :guilabel:`(plus)` icon to the right of the "
"field. Doing so automatically generates a lot, using the next available "
"number, and enters it in the field."
msgstr ""
"Za izpolnitev polja :guilabel:`Serija/serijska številka` s serijsko številko "
"kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-plus-square-o` :guilabel:`(plus)` na desni strani "
"polja. S tem se samodejno ustvari serija z naslednjo razpoložljivo številko "
"in se vnese v polje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:51
msgid ""
"Alternatively, click on the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` field and select "
"an existing lot number, or manually enter a new lot number and "
"click :guilabel:`Create \"#\"` in the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Druga možnost je, da kliknete na polje :guilabel:`Serija/serijska številka` "
"in izberete obstoječo serijsko številko ali ročno vnesete novo serijsko "
"številko in kliknete :guilabel:`Ustvari \"#\"` v spustnem meniju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:54
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:89
msgid "The \"Lot/Serial Number\" field on an MO."
msgstr "Polje \"Serija/serijska številka\" na PN."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:57
msgid ""
"Either of these methods assign the products in the |MO| a lot number before "
"production is finished. It is also possible to complete production and close "
"the |MO| by clicking :guilabel:`Produce`, without assigning a lot number. "
"Doing so automatically generates and assigns a lot, using the next available "
"number."
msgstr ""
"Katera koli od teh metod dodeli izdelkom v |MO| številko lota, še preden je "
"proizvodnja končana. Prav tako je mogoče dokončati proizvodnjo in zapreti "
"|MO| s klikom na :guilabel:`Proizvedi`, brez dodelitve številke lota. S tem "
"se samodejno ustvari in dodeli lot z uporabo naslednje razpoložljive "
"številke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:65
msgid ""
"To manufacture a product tracked with serial numbers, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`. "
"Click :guilabel:`New` to create a new |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Za proizvodnjo izdelka, ki se sledi s serijskimi številkami, začnite tako, "
"da se pomaknete na :menuselection:`Proizvodnja --> Operacije --> Proizvodna "
"naročila`. Kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`, da ustvarite novo |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:69
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Product` field, select a product tracked using serial "
"numbers, and enter the desired :guilabel:`Quantity`. "
"Click :guilabel:`Confirm` to confirm the |MO|."
msgstr ""
"V polju :guilabel:`Izdelek` izberite izdelek, ki se sledi s serijskimi "
"številkami, in vnesite želeno :guilabel:`Količino`. "
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`, da potrdite |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:75
msgid ""
"The rest of the manufacturing process depends on how many units the |MO| "
"contains."
msgstr ""
"Preostanek proizvodnega procesa je odvisen od tega, koliko enot vsebuje |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:78
msgid "Manufacture single unit"
msgstr "Proizvodnja ene enote"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:80
msgid ""
"If a single unit of the product is being manufactured, "
"clicking :guilabel:`Produce` closes the |MO|, and automatically generates "
"and assigns the next available serial number, which appears in "
"the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` field."
msgstr ""
"Če se proizvaja ena enota izdelka, klik na :guilabel:`Proizvedi vse` zapre "
"|MO| in samodejno generira ter dodeli naslednjo razpoložljivo serijsko "
"številko, ki se pojavi v polju :guilabel:`Lot/Serijska številka`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:84
msgid ""
"To assign a serial number without closing the |MO|, enter a number manually "
"in the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` field, and click :guilabel:`Create "
"\"#\"`, or click the :icon:`fa-plus-square-o` :guilabel:`(plus)` icon to the "
"right of the field to auto-fill it with the next available number."
msgstr ""
"Za dodelitev serijske številke brez zapiranja |MO| ročno vnesite številko v "
"polje :guilabel:`Lot/Serijska številka` in kliknite :guilabel:`Ustvari "
"\"#\"` ali kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-plus-square-o` :guilabel:`(plus)` na "
"desni strani polja, da se samodejno izpolni z naslednjo razpoložljivo "
"številko."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:93
msgid "Manufacture multiple units"
msgstr "Proizvodnja več enot"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:96
msgid ""
"When manufacturing a product tracked using serial numbers, an |MO| can be "
"created for multiple units. However, when serial numbers are assigned to "
"each unit, either at the end of production or before, the |MO| is split into "
"multiple |MOs|, each containing one unit of the product."
msgstr ""
"Pri proizvodnji izdelka, ki se sledi s serijskimi številkami, je mogoče "
"ustvariti |MO| za več enot. Vendar pa se ob dodeljevanju serijskih številk "
"posameznim enotam, bodisi ob koncu proizvodnje bodisi pred njo, |MO| razdeli "
"na več |MOs|, od katerih vsako vsebuje eno enoto izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:100
msgid ""
"Each of the split |MOs| is identified by a numerical tag added to the end of "
"the original |MO| number."
msgstr ""
"Vsako od razdeljenih |MOs| je označeno s številčno oznako, dodano na konec "
"originalne številke |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:104
msgid ""
"|MO| `WH/MO/00109` contains two units of a `Chair`, a product tracked using "
"serial numbers. A serial number is assigned to each unit of the chair. This "
"causes the |MO| to be split into two |MOs|, each containing one unit of the "
"chair. The |MOs| are titled `WH/MO/00109-001` and `WH/MO/00109-002`."
msgstr ""
"|MO| `WH/MO/00109` vsebuje dve enoti `Stola`, izdelka, ki se sledi s "
"serijskimi številkami. Serijska številka je dodeljena vsaki enoti stola. To "
"povzroči, da se |MO| razdeli na dva |MOs|, od katerih vsako vsebuje eno "
"enoto stola. |MOs| imata naslov `WH/MO/00109-001` in `WH/MO/00109-002`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:109
msgid ""
"To assign serial numbers to each unit of an |MO|, click :guilabel:`Produce` "
"to open the *Batch Production* pop-up window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:112
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`First Lot/SN` field of the pop-up window is auto-filled with "
"the next available serial number. The :guilabel:`Number of SN` field "
"defaults to the number of units being manufactured. The values of either "
"field can be changed manually."
msgstr ""
"Polje :guilabel:`Prvi Lot/SN` v pojavnem oknu se samodejno izpolni z "
"naslednjo razpoložljivo serijsko številko. Polje :guilabel:`Število SN` je "
"privzeto nastavljeno na število proizvedenih enot. Vrednosti katerega koli "
"polja je mogoče ročno spremeniti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:116
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Generate` to generate the specified number of serial "
"numbers, beginning with the number entered in the :guilabel:`First Lot/SN` "
"field. The serial numbers are displayed in the text box at the bottom of the "
"pop-up window, and can be manually changed after generation."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Generiraj`, da generirate določeno število serijskih "
"številk, začenši s številko, vneseno v polje :guilabel:`Prvi Lot/SN`. "
"Serijske številke so prikazane v besedilnem polju na dnu pojavnega okna in "
"jih je mogoče po generiranju ročno spremeniti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:120
msgid ""
"To assign serial numbers without completing production, click "
"the :guilabel:`Prepare MO` button. Doing so splits the |MO| into individual |"
"MOs|, one for each unit in the original |MO|. Each |MO| is left open, and "
"can be closed individually."
msgstr ""
"Za dodelitev serijskih številk brez dokončanja proizvodnje kliknite "
"gumb :guilabel:`Pripravi MO`. S tem se |MO| razdeli na posamezne |MOs|, po "
"enega za vsako enoto v izvirnem |MO|. Vsak |MO| ostane odprt in ga je mogoče "
"zapreti posamezno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:124
msgid ""
"To assign serial numbers and complete production, click "
"the :guilabel:`Produce` button. Doing so splits the |MO| into individual |"
"MOs|, one for each unit in the original |MO|. All of the |MOs| are closed, "
"since production is complete."
msgstr ""
"Za dodelitev serijskih številk in dokončanje proizvodnje kliknite "
"gumb :guilabel:`Proizvedi`. S tem se |MO| razdeli na posamezne |MOs|, po "
"enega za vsako enoto v izvirnem |MO|. Vsi |MOs| so zaprti, saj je "
"proizvodnja dokončana."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:128
msgid ""
"The \"Batch Production\" pop-up window, from which serial numbers can be "
"assigned."
msgstr ""
"Pojavno okno \"Serijska proizvodnja\", v katerem je mogoče dodeliti serijske "
"številke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:131
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`Prepare MO` or :guilabel:`Produce`, "
"the :menuselection:`Manufacturing` app automatically shows the first of the "
"split |MOs| (ex. `WH/MO/00109-001`). To view and access the rest the split |"
"MOs|, click the :guilabel:`Backorders` smart button at the top of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Po kliku na :guilabel:`Pripravi MO` ali :guilabel:`Proizvedi` "
"aplikacija :menuselection:`Proizvodnja` samodejno prikaže prvega od "
"razdeljenih |MOs| (npr. `WH/MO/00109-001`). Za ogled in dostop do preostalih "
"razdeljenih |MOs| kliknite pametni gumb :guilabel:`Zaostanki` na vrhu "
"zaslona."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:5
msgid "Manufacturing backorders"
msgstr "Zaostanki proizvodnje"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:7
msgid ""
"In some cases, the full quantity of a manufacturing order cannot be produced "
"immediately. When this happens, the *Manufacturing* app can manufacture "
"partial quantities of the order and create a *backorder* for the remaining "
"amount. To manufacture the full quantity of a manufacturing order, "
"see :ref:`Create a manufacturing order <manufacturing/manufacturing-orders/"
"create-mo>`."
msgstr ""
"V nekaterih primerih celotne količine proizvodnega naloga ni mogoče "
"proizvesti takoj. Ko se to zgodi, lahko aplikacija *Proizvodnja* proizvede "
"delne količine naročila in ustvari *zaostalo naročilo* za preostali znesek. "
"Za proizvodnjo celotne količine proizvodnega naloga glejte :ref:`Ustvari "
"proizvodni nalog <manufacturing/manufacturing-orders/create-mo>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:12
msgid ""
"Creating a backorder splits the original manufacturing order into two "
"orders. The reference tag for each order is the tag used for the original "
"order, followed by a hyphen and then an additional number to indicate that "
"it is a backorder. Backorders can be created :ref:`in the Manufacturing app "
"<manufacturing/manufacturing-backorders/create-backorder-manufacturing-app>` "
"or :ref:`from the Shop Floor module <manufacturing/manufacturing-backorders/"
"create-backorder-shop-floor>`."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarjanje zaostalega naročila razdeli prvotni proizvodni nalog na dva "
"naloga. Referenčna oznaka za vsako naročilo je oznaka, uporabljena za "
"prvotno naročilo, ki ji sledita vezaj in dodatna številka, ki označuje, da "
"gre za zaostalo naročilo. Zaostala naročila lahko ustvarite :ref:`v "
"aplikaciji Proizvodnja <manufacturing/manufacturing-backorders/create-"
"backorder-manufacturing-app>` ali :ref:`v modulu Shop Floor <manufacturing/"
"manufacturing-backorders/create-backorder-shop-floor>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:19
msgid ""
"A company creates a manufacturing order with the reference tag *WH/MO/"
"00175*, for 10 units of *Product X*. After starting work on the "
"manufacturing order, the employee working the production line realizes there "
"are only enough components in stock to produce five units of the product."
msgstr ""
"Podjetje ustvari proizvodni nalog z referenčno oznako *WH/MO/00175* za 10 "
"enot *Izdelka X*. Po začetku dela na proizvodnem nalogu kader, ki dela na "
"proizvodnji, ugotovi, da je na zalogi dovolj komponent le za proizvodnjo "
"petih enot izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:23
msgid ""
"Instead of waiting for additional stock of the components, they manufacture "
"five units and create a backorder for the remaining five. This splits the "
"manufacturing order into two separate orders: *WH/MO/00175-001* and *WH/MO/"
"00175-002*."
msgstr ""
"Namesto da bi čakal na dodatno zalogo komponent, proizvede pet enot in "
"ustvari zaostanek za preostalih pet. To razdeli proizvodni nalog na dva "
"ločena naloga: *WH/MO/00175-001* in *WH/MO/00175-002*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:27
msgid ""
"Order *001* contains the five units that have been manufactured, and is "
"immediately marked as :guilabel:`Done`. Order *002* contains the five units "
"that still need to be manufactured and is marked as :guilabel:`In Progress`. "
"Once the remaining components are available, the employee returns to order "
"*002* and manufactures the remaining units before closing the order."
msgstr ""
"Naročilo *001* vsebuje pet enot, ki so bile proizvedene, in je takoj "
"označeno kot :guilabel:`Opravljeno`. Naročilo *002* vsebuje pet enot, ki jih "
"še vedno treba proizvesti, in je označeno kot :guilabel:`V teku`. Ko so "
"preostale komponente na voljo, se kader vrne k naročilu *002* in proizvede "
"preostale enote, preden zapre naročilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:35
msgid "Create a backorder in Manufacturing app"
msgstr "Ustvari zaostalo naročilo v aplikaciji Proizvodnja"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:37
msgid ""
"To create a backorder for part of a manufacturing order, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`. "
"Select a manufacturing order with a quantity of two or more or create one by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje zaostalega naročila za del proizvodnega naročila najprej "
"pojdite na :menuselection:`Proizvodnja --> Operacije --> Proizvodna "
"naročila`. Izberite proizvodno naročilo s količino dve ali več ali ustvarite "
"novo s klikom na :guilabel:`Ustvari`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:41
msgid ""
"If a new manufacturing order is created, select a product from "
"the :guilabel:`Product` drop-down menu and enter a quantity of two or more "
"in the :guilabel:`Quantity` field, then click :guilabel:`Confirm` to confirm "
"the order."
msgstr ""
"Če je ustvarjeno novo proizvodno naročilo, izberite izdelek iz spustnega "
"menija :guilabel:`Izdelek` in vnesite količino dve ali več v "
"polje :guilabel:`Količina`, nato kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`, da potrdite "
"naročilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:45
msgid ""
"After manufacturing the quantity that is being produced immediately, enter "
"that number in the :guilabel:`Quantity` field at the top of the "
"manufacturing order."
msgstr ""
"Po proizvodnji količine, ki se proizvaja takoj, vnesite to številko v "
"polje :guilabel:`Količina` na vrhu proizvodnega naročila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:48
msgid "The quantity field on a manufacturing order."
msgstr "Polje količine na proizvodnem naročilu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:51
msgid ""
"Next, click :guilabel:`Produce`. If the quantity of consumed materials does "
"not match the quantity of products produced, a :guilabel:`Consumption "
"Warning` pop-up window appears. Click :guilabel:`Confirm` to keep the "
"existing quantity of consumed materials, or click :guilabel:`Update "
"Quantities & Validate` to match the consumed quantities to the quantity of "
"products produced. A :guilabel:`You produced less than the initial demand` "
"pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""
"Nato kliknite :guilabel:`Proizvedi`. Če se količina porabljenih materialov "
"ne ujema s količino proizvedenih izdelkov, se prikaže pojavno okno "
":guilabel:`Opozorilo o porabi`. Kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`, da obdržite "
"obstoječo količino porabljenih materialov, ali kliknite :guilabel:`Posodobi "
"količine in potrdi`, da porabljene količine uskladite s količino "
"proizvedenih izdelkov. Prikaže se pojavno okno :guilabel:`Proizvedli ste "
"manj od začetnega povpraševanja`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:57
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Create Backorder` to split the manufacturing order into two "
"separate orders, with the reference tags *WH/MO/XXXXX-001* and *WH/MO/"
"XXXXX-002*."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Ustvari zaostalo naročilo`, da razdelite proizvodni "
"nalog na dve ločeni naročili z referenčnima oznakama *WH/MO/XXXXX-001* in "
"*WH/MO/XXXXX-002*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:60
msgid ""
"Create Backorder button on the \"You produced less than the initial demand\" "
"pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Gumb Ustvari zaostalo naročilo v pojavnem oknu \"Proizvedli ste manj od "
"začetnega povpraševanja\"."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:63
msgid ""
"Order *001* contains the items that have been manufactured, and is closed "
"immediately. Order *002* is the backorder that contains the items that have "
"yet to be manufactured, and remains open, to be completed at a later date."
msgstr ""
"Naročilo *001* vsebuje predmete, ki so bili proizvedeni, in je takoj zaprto. "
"Naročilo *002* je zaostalo naročilo, ki vsebuje predmete, ki še niso bili "
"proizvedeni, in ostane odprto, da se dokonča pozneje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:67
msgid ""
"Once the remaining units can be manufactured, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`, "
"and then select the backorder manufacturing order. If all of the remaining "
"units are manufactured immediately, click :guilabel:`Produce` to close the "
"order."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:71
msgid ""
"If only some of the remaining units are manufactured immediately, create "
"another backorder for the remainder by following the steps detailed in this "
"section."
msgstr ""
"Če je takoj proizvedenih le nekaj preostalih enot, ustvarite še eno zaostalo "
"naročilo za preostanek tako, da sledite korakom, opisanim v tem razdelku."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:77
msgid "Create a backorder in Shop Floor"
msgstr "Ustvarite zaostalo naročilo v delavnici"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:79
msgid ""
"Backorders for manufacturing orders can also be created from the *Shop "
"Floor* module."
msgstr ""
"Zaostala naročila za proizvodna naročila je mogoče ustvariti tudi v modulu "
"*Delavnica*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:82
msgid ""
"In order to use the *Shop Floor* module, the *Work Orders* setting must be "
"enabled. To do so, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, enable the :guilabel:`Work Orders` checkbox, "
"and then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Za uporabo modula *Delavnica* mora biti omogočena nastavitev *Delovni "
"nalogi*. To storite tako, da pojdete na :menuselection:`Proizvodnja --> "
"Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve`, omogočite potrditveno "
"polje :guilabel:`Delovni nalogi` in nato kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:86
msgid ""
"To create a backorder from the *Shop Floor* module, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`. "
"Select an |MO| for multiple units of a product, for which a backorder needs "
"to be created."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje zaostalega naročila v modulu *Delavnica* najprej pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Proizvodnja --> Operacije --> Proizvodna naročila`. "
"Izberite |MO| za več enot izdelka, za katerega je treba ustvariti zaostalo "
"naročilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:90
msgid ""
"On the |MO|, select the *Work Orders* tab, and then click the work order to "
"be processed. On the resulting :guilabel:`Work Orders` pop-up window, click "
"the :guilabel:`Open Shop Floor` button to open the *Shop Floor* module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:94
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality/quality_check_types/instructions_check.rst:80
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality/quality_check_types/pass_fail_check.rst:126
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality/quality_management/quality_checks.rst:155
msgid ""
"When accessed from a specific work order, the *Shop Floor* module opens to "
"the page for the work center where the order is configured to be processed, "
"and isolates the work order's card so that no other cards are shown."
msgstr ""
"Ko dostopate do njega prek določenega delovnega naloga, se modul *Delavnica* "
"odpre na strani za delovno sredino, kjer je nalog konfiguriran za obdelavo, "
"in izolira kartico delovnega naloga, tako da nobene druge kartice niso "
"prikazane."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:98
msgid ""
"Complete the steps on the work order's card, then click :guilabel:`Produce`. "
"If the quantity of consumed materials does not match the quantity of "
"products produced, a :guilabel:`Consumption Warning` pop-up window appears. "
"Click :guilabel:`Confirm` to keep the existing quantity of consumed "
"materials, or click :guilabel:`Update Quantities & Validate` to match the "
"consumed quantities to the quantity of products produced. A :guilabel:`You "
"produced less than the initial demand` pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:105
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Create Backorder` to split the manufacturing order into two "
"separate orders."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:107
msgid "The Produce button in the Shop Floor module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:110
msgid ""
"If the original |MO| has remaining work orders that must be completed before "
"it can be closed, cards for these work orders appear on the *Shop Floor* "
"pages for the work centers where they are configured to be carried out. They "
"can be processed as normal, and additional backorders can be created from "
"their work order cards using the instructions detailed in this section."
msgstr ""
"Če ima prvotni |MO| preostale delovne naloge, ki morajo biti dokončane, "
"preden ga lahko zaprete, se kartice za te delovne naloge prikažejo na "
"straneh *Delavnica* za delovna mesta, kjer so konfigurirane za izvajanje. "
"Obdelajo se lahko normalno in dodatni zaostali se lahko ustvarijo iz "
"njihovih kartic delovnih nalogov z navodili, podrobno opisanimi v tem "
"razdelku."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:115
msgid ""
"Once the current work order for the backorder |MO| is ready to be processed, "
"this can also be completed as normal, and an additional backorder can be "
"created from its work order card by following the instructions detailed in "
"this section."
msgstr ""
"Ko je trenutni delovni nalog za zaostali |MO| pripravljen za obdelavo, se "
"lahko tudi ta dokonča normalno, dodatni zaostali pa se lahko ustvari iz "
"njegove kartice delovnega naloga s sledenjem navodilom, podrobno opisanim v "
"tem razdelku."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:119
msgid ""
"After the final work order for the backorder |MO| has been completed, the |"
"MO| can be closed by clicking the :guilabel:`Close Production` button at the "
"bottom of the work order's card."
msgstr ""
"Ko je zadnji delovni nalog za zaostali |MO| dokončan, lahko |MO| zaprete s "
"klikom na gumb :guilabel:`Zapri proizvodnjo` na dnu kartice delovnega naloga."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:3
msgid "Scrap during manufacturing"
msgstr "Izmet med proizvodnjo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:7
msgid ""
"During the manufacturing process, scrapping components or finished products "
"may be necessary when items are damaged, defective, or no longer usable."
msgstr ""
"Med proizvodnjo je lahko treba zavreči komponente ali končne izdelke, ko so "
"predmeti poškodovani, okvarjeni ali jih ni več mogoče uporabiti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:10
msgid ""
"Tracking scrapped materials helps manufacturers monitor waste, identify "
"process issues, and account for production costs."
msgstr ""
"Sledenje zavrženim materialom pomaga proizvajalcem spremljati odpadke, "
"prepoznati težave v procesih in upoštevati stroške proizvodnje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:13
msgid ""
"In Odoo, scrapped items are removed from physical inventory and moved to a "
"virtual location called *Virtual Locations/Scrap*. This location is not a "
"physical space—it is a way to log and track losses without affecting real "
"stock levels."
msgstr ""
"V Odoo se zavrženi predmeti odstranijo iz fizične zaloge in prestavijo na "
"virtualno lokacijo z imenom *Virtualne lokacije/Izmet*. Ta lokacija ni "
"fizični prostor — je način za beleženje in sledenje izgub brez vpliva na "
"dejanske ravni zaloge."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:18
msgid ""
":doc:`Location types <../../inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"inventory_management>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Vrste lokacij <../../inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"inventory_management>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:21
msgid ""
"Scrap orders can be viewed by navigating to :menuselection:`Inventory --> "
"Operations --> Scrap`. Each scrap order shows the date and time the order "
"was created, along with the product and quantity that was scrapped."
msgstr ""
"Naloge za izmet si lahko ogledate tako, da se pomaknete "
"na :menuselection:`Zaloga --> Operacije --> Izmet`. Vsak nalog za izmet "
"prikazuje datum in čas, ko je bil nalog ustvarjen, skupaj z izdelkom in "
"količino, ki je bila zavržena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:25
msgid ""
"To view the total quantity of each item scrapped, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Locations`, then remove "
"the :guilabel:`Internal` filter from the :guilabel:`Search...` bar to "
"display all virtual locations. From the list, select the :guilabel:`Virtual "
"Locations/Scrap` location."
msgstr ""
"Za ogled skupne količine vsakega zavržena predmeta se pomaknite "
"na :menuselection:`Zaloga --> Konfiguracija --> Lokacije`, nato odstranite "
"filter :guilabel:`Notranje` iz vrstice :guilabel:`Iskanje...`, da prikažete "
"vse virtualne lokacije. S seznama izberite lokacijo :guilabel:`Virtualne "
"lokacije/Izmet`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:33
msgid "Navigate to the scrap window"
msgstr "Premik na okno za izmet"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:35
msgid ""
"Scrapping can be done in either the **Manufacturing** app or the **Shop "
"Floor** module, depending on the task."
msgstr ""
"Zavračanje se lahko izvede v aplikaciji **Proizvodnja** ali modulu "
"**Delavnica**, odvisno od opravila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:38
msgid "**Manufacturing** app allows:"
msgstr "Aplikacija **Proizvodnja** omogoča:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:40
msgid "Scrapping finished products (only if the |MO| is in the *Done* stage)."
msgstr "Zavračanje končnih izdelkov (samo če je |MO| v fazi *Dokončano*)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:41
msgid ""
"Scrapping components (while the |MO| is in the *Draft* or *Confirmed* stage)."
msgstr ""
"Zavračanje komponent (medtem ko je |MO| v fazi *Osnutek* ali *Potrjeno*)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:43
msgid "**Shop Floor** allows:"
msgstr "**Delavnica** omogoča:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:45
msgid "Scrapping only components."
msgstr "Odpisovanje samo komponent."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:48
msgid "Manufacturing app"
msgstr "Aplikacija Proizvodnja"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:50
msgid ""
"To scrap a product from the **Manufacturing** app, go "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders` "
"and select the desired |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Če želite odpisati izdelek iz aplikacije **Proizvodnja**, pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Proizvodnja --> Operacije --> Proizvodna naročila` in "
"izberite želeni |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:53
msgid ""
"On the |MO|, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon, then "
"choose :guilabel:`Scrap` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Na |MO| kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Dejanja`, nato v spustnem "
"meniju izberite :guilabel:`Odpis`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:56
msgid "MO with the cog's drop-down menu revealed, to show the Scrap option."
msgstr "PN z odkritim spustnim menijem zobnika, ki prikazuje možnost Odpis."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:62
msgid ""
"In **Shop Floor**, only components can be scrapped. Navigate to the desired |"
"MO| card, and then tap the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon and in "
"the :guilabel:`What do you want to do?` pop-up window, "
"select :guilabel:`Scrap`."
msgstr ""
"V **Delavnici** je mogoče odpisati samo komponente. Pojdite na želeno "
"kartico |MO|, nato tapnite ikono :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Dejanja` in v "
"pojavnem oknu :guilabel:`Kaj želite storiti?` izberite :guilabel:`Odpis`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:66
msgid "Scrap pop-up window in the Shop Floor app."
msgstr "Pojavno okno za odpis v aplikaciji Delavnica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:70
msgid "Scrap pop-up window"
msgstr "Pojavno okno za odpis"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:72
msgid ""
"After opening the :guilabel:`Scrap Products` pop-up window using one of the "
"methods :ref:`detailed above <manufacturing/management/scrap-window>`, "
"select the component or finished product being scrapped, from "
"the :guilabel:`Product` drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Ko odprete pojavno okno :guilabel:`Odpis izdelkov` z eno od "
"metod, :ref:`opisanih zgoraj <manufacturing/management/scrap-window>`, iz "
"spustnega menija :guilabel:`Izdelek` izberite komponento ali končni izdelek, "
"ki se odpisuje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:76
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Quantity` field, enter the quantity being scrapped."
msgstr "V polje :guilabel:`Količina` vnesite količino, ki se odpisuje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:78
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Source Location` field is set to the warehouse's "
"pre-production location, while the :guilabel:`Scrap Location` field is set "
"to the :guilabel:`Virtual Locations/Scrap` location. If either the source or "
"scrap location should be changed, select a different location from their "
"respective drop-down menus."
msgstr ""
"Privzeto je polje :guilabel:`Izvorna lokacija` nastavljeno na lokacijo pred "
"proizvodnjo v skladišču, medtem ko je polje :guilabel:`Lokacija odpisa` "
"nastavljeno na lokacijo :guilabel:`Navidezne lokacije/Odpis`. Če je treba "
"spremeniti izvorno lokacijo ali lokacijo odpisa, izberite drugo lokacijo iz "
"ustreznih spustnih menijev."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:83
msgid ""
"Enable the :guilabel:`Replenish Scrapped Quantities` checkbox if a picking "
"order should be created to replace the scrapped component upon confirmation "
"of the scrap order. This option should only be enabled for warehouses "
"with :doc:`two-step <../basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing>` or :doc:`three-"
"step <../basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing>` manufacturing enabled, since "
"components are not picked as part of the :doc:`one-step <../basic_setup/"
"one_step_manufacturing>` manufacturing process."
msgstr ""
"Omogočite potrditveno polje :guilabel:`Napolni odpisane količine`, če želite "
"ob potrditvi naloga za odpis ustvariti nalog za nabiranje, ki bo nadomestil "
"odpisano komponento. To možnost omogočite samo za skladišča z "
"omogočeno :doc:`dvostopenjsko <../basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing>` "
"ali :doc:`tristopenjsko <../basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing>` "
"proizvodnjo, saj komponente niso del procesa nabiranje, "
"pri :doc:`enostopenjski <../basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing>` proizvodnji."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:90
msgid "The Scrap pop-up window."
msgstr "Pojavno okno za odpis."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:93
msgid ""
"After filling out the :guilabel:`Scrap Products` pop-up window, click "
"the :guilabel:`Scrap Products` button. After one or more scrap orders have "
"been created, a :guilabel:`Scraps` smart button appears at the top of the "
"screen. Click it to view a list of all scrap orders for the |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Ko izpolnite pojavno okno :guilabel:`Odpis izdelkov`, kliknite "
"gumb :guilabel:`Odpis izdelkov`. Ko ustvarite enega ali več nalogov za "
"odpis, se na vrhu zaslona prikaže pametni gumb :guilabel:`Odpisi`. Kliknite "
"ga za ogled seznama vseh nalogov za odpis za |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:3
msgid "Split and merge manufacturing orders"
msgstr "Razdelitev in združevanje proizvodnih naročil"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:9
msgid ""
"In Odoo **Manufacturing**, it is possible to create manufacturing orders "
"(MOs) for a single unit of an item, or multiple units of the same item. A "
"partially produced manufacturing order may be split to account for both "
"completed units and remaining production requirements. This process ensures "
"that the current |MO| reflects only the quantity actually finished, while "
"supplementary |MOs| track the balance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:15
msgid ""
"An |MO| should be split if the remaining quantity cannot be completed "
"immediately due to internal or external constraints."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:18
msgid ""
"When a split is executed, the system updates the original |MO| to reflect "
"the specific quantity that has been produced and is ready for closing. Then, "
"new |MOs| are automatically generated for the difference between the "
"original planned quantity and the actual produced quantity. This ensures "
"that lead times, labor costs, and material consumption remain accurately "
"allocated to the specific time frame in which the work occurred."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:24
msgid ""
"Splits can be set up from the |MO| form or the *Manufacturing Orders* page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:27
msgid ""
"An |MO| can only contain one unit of a product, or multiple units of a "
"single product that all use the same bill of materials (BoM). As a result, "
"it is only possible to merge |MOs| for the same products with the same |BoM|."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:32
msgid "Split manufacturing orders"
msgstr "Razdelitev proizvodnih naročil"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:34
msgid "|MOs| can be split in two ways:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:36
msgid ":ref:`manufacturing/split_merge/mo-page-split`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:37
msgid ":ref:`manufacturing/split_merge/mo-actions-menu`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:42
msgid "From the Manufacturing Orders page"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:44
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> "
"Manufacturing Orders`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:46
msgid ""
"Select the checkbox next to the |MO| to be split. Click :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :menuselection:`Actions --> Split`. A *Split production* pop-up window "
"appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:49
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Max Batch Size` field, enter the number of units that each "
"batch should be split into, then click outside of the field. "
"The :guilabel:`# Splits` field updates with the total number of |MOs| that "
"will be created. A table appears below, with a line for each new |MO| that "
"will be created by the split. In the :guilabel:`Quantity To Produce` column, "
"enter the number of units that will be assigned to each new |MO|. Finally, "
"click :guilabel:`Split` to split the |MO|."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:56
msgid ""
"A work order for `5` units of the `Drawer` product are split with "
"a :guilabel:`Max Batch Size` of `2`. This creates 3 splits; two of the "
"splits contain `2` units each, and the final split contains a single unit."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:60
msgid "The Split production pop-up window for a manufacturing order."
msgstr "Pojavno okno Razdeli proizvodnjo za proizvodni nalog."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:63
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:98
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`Split`, the original |MO| is split into the number "
"of orders that was specified in the :guilabel:`# Split` field. The reference "
"numbers for the new |MOs| are the reference number for the original order "
"with `-###` tags added to the end."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:68
msgid ""
"|MO| `WH/MO/00012` is split into three separate orders. The reference "
"numbers for the new orders are:"
msgstr ""
"|MO| `WH/MO/00012` je razdeljen na tri ločena naročila. Referenčne številke "
"novih naročil so:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:71
msgid "`WH/MO/00012-001`"
msgstr "`WH/MO/00012-001`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:72
msgid "`WH/MO/00012-002`"
msgstr "`WH/MO/00012-002`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:73
msgid "`WH/MO/00012-003`"
msgstr "`WH/MO/00012-003`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:78
msgid "From the actions menu of an |MO|"
msgstr "Iz menija dejanj |MO|"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:80
msgid ""
"To split an |MO| into multiple orders, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Manufacturing "
"Orders`, then select a confirmed |MO|. At the top of the page, next to "
"the :guilabel:`New` button, the |MO|'s reference number appears with "
"a :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon next to it."
msgstr ""
"Če želite razdeliti |MO| na več naročil, začnite tako, da se pomaknete na "
":menuselection:`Proizvodnja --> Operacije --> Proizvodna naročila`, nato "
"izberite potrjeno |MO|. Na vrhu strani, poleg gumba :guilabel:`Novo`, se "
"prikaže referenčna številka |MO|'s zraven ikone :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`"
"(Dejanja)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:85
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon to reveal the drop-down "
"menu for the |MO|, then select :guilabel:`Split`."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Dejanja)`, da odprete spustni meni "
"za |MO|, nato izberite :guilabel:`Razdeli`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:88
msgid "The Actions menu on a manufacturing order."
msgstr "Meni Dejanja na proizvodnem naročilu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:91
msgid ""
"After selecting :guilabel:`Split`, a *Split production* pop-up window "
"appears. In the :guilabel:`Max Batch Size` field, enter the number of units "
"that each batch should be split into, then click outside of the field. "
"The :guilabel:`# Splits` field updates with the total number of |MOs| that "
"will be created. A table appears below, with a line for each new |MO| that "
"will be created by the split. In the :guilabel:`Quantity To Produce` column, "
"enter the number of units that will be assigned to each new |MO|. Finally, "
"click :guilabel:`Split` to split the |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Po izbiri :guilabel:`Razdeli` se prikaže pojavno okno *Razdeli proizvodnjo*. "
"V polje :guilabel:`Največja velikost serije` vnesite število enot, na katere "
"naj se serija razdeli, nato kliknite zunaj polja. Polje :guilabel:`# "
"Razdelitev` se posodobi s skupnim številom |MOs|, ki bodo ustvarjena. Spodaj "
"se prikaže tabela z vrstico za vsako novo |MO|, ki bo ustvarjeno z "
"razdelitvijo. V stolpcu :guilabel:`Količina za proizvodnjo` vnesite število "
"enot, ki bodo dodeljene vsakemu novemu |MO|. Na koncu kliknite "
":guilabel:`Razdeli`, da razdelite |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:102
msgid ""
"To complete the |MOs|, complete all work orders, then click "
"the :guilabel:`Produce All` button on the |MO| form."
msgstr ""
"Za dokončanje |MOs|, zaključite vsa delovna naročila, nato kliknite gumb "
":guilabel:`Proizvedi vse` na obrazcu |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:106
msgid "Merge manufacturing orders"
msgstr "Združevanje proizvodnih nalogov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:108
msgid ""
"To merge two or more |MOs| using the same |BoM| into a single order, begin "
"by navigating to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> "
"Manufacturing Orders`. Select the |MOs| that will be merged by selecting the "
"checkbox to the side of the name of each order."
msgstr ""
"Če želite združiti dve ali več |MOs|, ki uporabljajo isti |BoM|, v eno "
"naročilo, začnite tako, da se pomaknete na :menuselection:`Proizvodnja --> "
"Operacije --> Proizvodna naročila`. Izberite |MOs|, ki bodo združena, tako "
"da označite potrditveno polje ob imenu vsakega naročila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:112
msgid "Select at least two orders using the same BoM to merge."
msgstr ""
"Izberite vsaj dve naročili, ki uporabljata isto kosovnico (BoM) za združitev."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:115
msgid ""
"Once all |MOs| have been selected, click :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :menuselection:`Actions --> Merge`."
msgstr ""
"Ko so vsa |MOs| izbrana, kliknite :icon:`fa-cog` :menuselection:`Dejanja --> "
"Združi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:117
msgid ""
"The selected |MOs| are merged into a single order. The reference number for "
"the new |MO| is the next sequential number that has *not* already been "
"assigned to an order."
msgstr ""
"Izbrana |MOs| so združena v eno naročilo. Referenčna številka za novo |MO| "
"je naslednja zaporedna številka, ki *še ni* bila dodeljena nobenemu naročilu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:121
msgid ""
"The last reference number used for an |MO| was `WH/MO/00012`. Two |MOs|, `WH/"
"MO/00008` and `WH/MO/00009`, are merged into a single order. The reference "
"number for the |MO| created by the merger is `WH/MO/00013`."
msgstr ""
"Zadnja referenčna številka, uporabljena za |MO|, je bila `WH/MO/00012`. Dve "
"|MOs|, `WH/MO/00008` in `WH/MO/00009`, sta združeni v eno naročilo. "
"Referenčna številka za |MO|, ustvarjeno z združitvijo, je `WH/MO/00013`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:3
msgid "Unbuild orders"
msgstr "Nalogi za razgradnjo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:7
msgid ""
"In some cases, it is necessary to dismantle manufactured products into their "
"individual components. This may be required if too many units of a product "
"were built, or if the components of one product must be reclaimed to use in "
"the manufacturing of another."
msgstr ""
"V nekaterih primerih je treba proizvedene izdelke razstaviti na njihove "
"posamezne komponente. To je lahko potrebno, če je bilo izdelanih preveč enot "
"izdelka ali če je treba komponente enega izdelka pridobiti nazaj za uporabo "
"pri izdelavi drugega."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:11
msgid ""
"In Odoo *Manufacturing*, products can be dismantled, and their components "
"returned to inventory, using *unbuild orders*. By using unbuild orders to "
"accomplish this task, inventory counts for the finished product and its "
"components remain accurate, based on the quantity of products dismantled, "
"and the quantity of components reclaimed."
msgstr ""
"V Odoo *Proizvodnji* je mogoče izdelke razstaviti in njihove komponente "
"vrniti v zalogo z uporabo *nalogov za razgradnjo*. Z uporabo nalogov za "
"razgradnjo za izvedbo tega opravila števci zaloge za končni izdelek in "
"njegove komponente ostanejo točni, glede na količino razstavljenih izdelkov "
"in količino pridobljenih komponent."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:17
msgid "Create unbuild order"
msgstr "Ustvarjanje naloga za razgradnjo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:19
msgid ""
"A new unbuild order can be created by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Unbuild Orders`, and "
"clicking :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Nov nalog za razgradnjo lahko ustvarite tako, da se pomaknete "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Proizvodnja --> Operacije --> Nalogi za "
"razgradnjo` in kliknete :guilabel:`Novo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:22
msgid ""
"Begin filling out the new unbuild order by selecting a :guilabel:`Product` "
"to unbuild. After doing so, the :guilabel:`Bill of Material` field auto-"
"populates with the corresponding bill of materials (BoM). If a different |"
"BoM| should be used, click on the :guilabel:`Bill of Material` field, and "
"select it from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Začnite izpolnjevanje novega razgradbenega naročila z "
"izbiro :guilabel:`Izdelka`, ki ga želite razgraditi. Po tem se "
"polje :guilabel:`Kosičnica` samodejno izpolni z ustrezno kosičnico (BoM). Če "
"je treba uporabiti drugo |BoM|, kliknite na polje :guilabel:`Kosičnica` in "
"jo izberite iz spustnega menija."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:27
msgid ""
"Alternatively, a specific |BoM| can be selected in the :guilabel:`Bill of "
"Material` field before selecting a product, which causes the corresponding "
"product to auto-populate in the :guilabel:`Product` field."
msgstr ""
"Drugače lahko izberete določeno |BoM| v polju :guilabel:`Kosičnica`, preden "
"izberete izdelek, kar povzroči, da se ustrezen izdelek samodejno izpolni v "
"polju :guilabel:`Izdelek`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:31
msgid ""
"Next, specify the :guilabel:`Quantity` of the product that is being unbuilt."
msgstr "Nato določite :guilabel:`Količino` izdelka, ki se razgrajuje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:33
msgid ""
"If the product being unbuilt was originally manufactured in a specific "
"manufacturing order (MO), select it in the :guilabel:`Manufacturing Order` "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Če je bil izdelek, ki se razgrajuje, prvotno izdelan v določenem proizvodnem "
"naročilu (MO), ga izberite v polju :guilabel:`Proizvodno naročilo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:36
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Source Location` field, select the location where the "
"product being unbuilt is currently stored."
msgstr ""
"V polju :guilabel:`Izvorna lokacija` izberite lokacijo, kjer je izdelek, ki "
"se razgrajuje, trenutno shranjen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:39
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Destination Location` field, select the location where the "
"reclaimed components are stored after the unbuild order is completed."
msgstr ""
"V polju :guilabel:`Ciljna lokacija` izberite lokacijo, kjer so po končanem "
"razgradbenem naročilu shranjene pridobljene komponente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:42
msgid ""
"If the *Lots & Serial Numbers* feature is enabled in the settings of the "
"*Inventory* app, a :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` field appears on the "
"unbuild order, which can be used to specify the lot(s) or serial number(s) "
"of the product being unbuilt, if any are assigned."
msgstr ""
"Če je v nastavitvah aplikacije *Zaloga* omogočena funkcija *Serije in "
"serijske številke*, se na razgradbenem naročilu pojavi "
"polje :guilabel:`Serija/serijska številka`, ki ga lahko uporabite za "
"določitev serij ali serijskih številk izdelka, ki se razgrajuje, če so "
"dodeljene."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:46
msgid ""
"If the Odoo database has been configured with multiple companies, "
"a :guilabel:`Company` field appears on the unbuild order, which can be used "
"to specify the company that owns the product being unbuilt."
msgstr ""
"Če je baza podatkov Odoo konfigurirana z več podjetji, se na razgradbenem "
"naročilu pojavi polje :guilabel:`Podjetje`, ki ga lahko uporabite za "
"določitev podjetja, ki je lastnik izdelka, ki se razgrajuje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:50
msgid ""
"Finally, once the product has been unbuilt, click the :guilabel:`Unbuild` "
"button at the top of the order to confirm that it has been completed."
msgstr ""
"Nazadnje, ko je izdelek razgrajen, kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Razgradi` na "
"vrhu naročila, da potrdite, da je končan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:53
msgid "A filled-out unbuild order."
msgstr "Izpolnjeno razgradbeno naročilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:58
msgid ""
"While it is possible to create unbuild orders for products that have zero "
"(or fewer) units on-hand, this is not advised, since it can lead to "
"inventory inconsistencies."
msgstr ""
"Čeprav je mogoče ustvariti razgradbena naročila za izdelke, ki imajo nič "
"(ali manj) enot na zalogi, to ni priporočljivo, saj lahko privede do "
"neskladij v zalogi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:61
msgid ""
"If an unbuild order is created for a product with zero (or fewer) units on-"
"hand, a pop-up window appears, warning the user that there is an "
"insufficient quantity to unbuild."
msgstr ""
"Če je ustvarjeno razgradbeno naročilo za izdelek z nič (ali manj) enotami na "
"zalogi, se pojavi pojavno okno, ki uporabnika opozori, da je količina za "
"razgradnjo nezadostna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:64
msgid ""
"To ignore the warning, and proceed with the unbuild order, "
"click :guilabel:`Confirm` at the bottom of the pop-up window. To return to "
"the unconfirmed unbuild order, click :guilabel:`Discard`, instead."
msgstr ""
"Če želite prezreti opozorilo in nadaljevati z razgradbenim naročilom, "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi` na dnu pojavnega okna. Če se želite vrniti na "
"nepotrjeno razgradbeno naročilo, kliknite :guilabel:`Zavrzi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:68
msgid ""
"The insufficient quantity pop-up that appears after trying to confirm an "
"unbuild order\n"
"for a product with zero or fewer units on hand."
msgstr ""
"Pojavno okno o nezadostni količini, ki se pojavi po poskusu potrditve "
"razgradbenega naročila\n"
"za izdelek z nič ali manj enotami na zalogi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:73
msgid ""
"After completing an unbuild order, inventory counts automatically update, "
"based on the quantity of products unbuilt, and the quantity of components "
"reclaimed."
msgstr ""
"Po končanem razgradbenem naročilu se zaloge samodejno posodobijo na podlagi "
"količine razgrajenih izdelkov in količine pridobljenih komponent."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:77
msgid ""
"A `Coat Rack` product is comprised of one `Wooden Pole` component and six "
"`Wooden Dowel` components."
msgstr ""
"Izdelek `Coat Rack` je sestavljen iz ene komponente `Wooden Pole` in šestih "
"komponent `Wooden Dowel`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:80
msgid ""
"An unbuild order is created for one unit of the `Coat Rack`. Once the order "
"is completed, the on-hand quantity of `Coat Racks` decreases by one, while "
"the on-hand quantities of `Wooden Poles` and `Wooden Dowels` increase by one "
"and six, respectively."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarjeno je razgradbeno naročilo za eno enoto izdelka `Coat Rack`. Ko je "
"naročilo končano, se količina na zalogi izdelka `Coat Racks` zmanjša za eno, "
"medtem ko se količini na zalogi izdelkov `Wooden Poles` in `Wooden Dowels` "
"povečata za eno oziroma šest."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:85
msgid "Scrap unusable components"
msgstr "Odpis neuporabnih komponent"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:87
msgid ""
"In some cases, components may be unusable after the unbuilding process is "
"completed. To ensure that inventory counts accurately reflect the quantity "
"of usable components on-hand, any component that can no longer be used "
"should be removed from inventory using a :doc:`scrap order <../../inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory>`."
msgstr ""
"V nekaterih primerih so komponente po končanem postopku razgradnje "
"neuporabne. Da bi zagotovili, da stanje zalog natančno odraža količino "
"uporabnih komponent na zalogi, je treba vse komponente, ki jih ni več mogoče "
"uporabiti, odstraniti iz zaloge z uporabo :doc:`naloga za odpis <../../"
"inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:16
msgid ""
"In Odoo **Manufacturing**, the Master Production Schedule (MPS) is used to "
"plan long-term replenishment for products against a manually-adjustable "
"demand forecast. While Make-to-Order (MTO) strategies or reordering rules "
"are useful for immediately replenishing stock, products or components with "
"long lead times or variable seasonal demands may require longer-term "
"planning against an expected future demand to ensure continued availability "
"of stock."
msgstr ""
"V aplikaciji Odoo **Proizvodnja** se glavni proizvodni načrt (MPS) uporablja "
"za načrtovanje dolgoročne oskrbe izdelkov glede na ročno prilagodljivo "
"napoved povpraševanja. Medtem ko so strategije izdelave po naročilu (MTO) "
"ali pravila ponovnega naročanja uporabna za takojšnjo dopolnitev zaloge, "
"lahko izdelki ali komponente z dolgimi dobavnimi roki ali spremenljivim "
"sezonskim povpraševanjem zahtevajo dolgoročnejše načrtovanje glede na "
"pričakovano prihodnje povpraševanje, da se zagotovi stalna razpoložljivost "
"zalog."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:22
msgid ""
"With the |MPS|, users can plan replenishment for specific products over "
"future time periods, generating suggested replenishment quantities based on "
"forecasted demand and on user-specified stock targets."
msgstr ""
"Z |MPS| lahko uporabniki načrtujejo oskrbo za določene izdelke v prihodnjih "
"časovnih obdobjih ter ustvarjajo predlagane količine za oskrbo na podlagi "
"napovedanega povpraševanja in ciljev zalog, ki jih določi uporabnik."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:27
msgid ""
"Adding a product to the |MPS| does **not** automatically create a purchase "
"or manufacturing order for it. The |MPS| only suggests the amount of product "
"to be replenished, requiring the user to actually create the replenishing |"
"POs|/|MOs|."
msgstr ""
"Dodajanje izdelka v |MPS| zanj **ne** ustvari samodejno nabavnega ali "
"proizvodnega naročila. |MPS| le predlaga količino izdelka za oskrbo, "
"uporabnik pa mora nato dejansko ustvariti ustrezna |POs|/|MOs|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:31
msgid ""
"Because the |MPS| relies on manual replenishment, reordering rules should "
"**not** be applied to products added to the |MPS|. Doing so creates "
"inaccurate forecasts and unnecessary replenishment orders."
msgstr ""
"Ker |MPS| temelji na ročni oskrbi, se pravila ponovnega naročanja **ne** "
"smejo uporabljati za izdelke, dodane v |MPS|. V nasprotnem primeru pride do "
"netočnih napovedi in nepotrebnih naročil za oskrbo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:36
msgid ""
"A retail store sells artificial *Christmas trees* during the holiday season. "
"It is currently September and the store has fewer than ten Christmas tree |"
"MOs| confirmed for the month of December. The procurement manager knows that "
"the demand for Christmas trees peaks in December. As a result, they manually "
"enter a greater demand in the |MPS| to properly replenish ahead of this "
"future customer demand."
msgstr ""
"Trgovina na drobno med praznično sezono prodaja umetna *božična drevesa*. "
"Trenutno je september in trgovina ima za mesec december potrjenih manj kot "
"deset |MOs| za božična drevesa. Vodja oskrbe ve, da povpraševanje po "
"božičnih drevesih doseže vrhunec v decembru. Zato v |MPS| ročno vnese večje "
"povpraševanje, da ustrezno zagotovi oskrbo pred tem prihodnjim "
"povpraševanjem kupcev."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:47
msgid ""
"To use the |MPS|, the feature must first be enabled. Navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> Settings` and "
"select the :guilabel:`Master Production Schedule` checkbox in "
"the :guilabel:`Planning` section."
msgstr ""
"Za uporabo |MPS| je treba to funkcijo najprej omogočiti. Pojdite v "
":menuselection:`Aplikacija Proizvodnja --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve` in "
"izberite potrditveno polje :guilabel:`Glavni proizvodni načrt` v razdelku "
":guilabel:`Načrtovanje`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:51
msgid "After enabling the feature, two new columns appear below:"
msgstr "Po omogočitvi funkcije se spodaj prikažeta dva nova stolpca:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:53
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Time Range`: Select the period of time over which the "
"planning occurs, either on "
"a :guilabel:`Yearly`, :guilabel:`Monthly`, :guilabel:`Weekly`, "
"or :guilabel:`Daily` basis."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Privzeti časovni razpon`: izberite časovno obdobje načrtovanja: "
":guilabel:`Letno`, :guilabel:`Mesečno`, :guilabel:`Tedensko` ali "
":guilabel:`Dnevno`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:55
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Number of Periods`: Specify the number of periods to display for "
"each time range."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Število obdobij`: določite število obdobij, ki naj se prikažejo "
"za posamezen časovni razpon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:58
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Default Time Range` field is set to :guilabel:`Monthly`, "
"and the :guilabel:`Number of Periods` field is set to `12`, the |MPS| shows "
"one column for each of the next 12 months, starting with the current month."
msgstr ""
"Če je polje :guilabel:`Privzeti časovni razpon` nastavljeno na "
":guilabel:`Mesečno`, polje :guilabel:`Število obdobij` pa na `12`, |MPS| "
"prikazuje po en stolpec za vsakega od naslednjih 12 mesecev, začenši s "
"tekočim mesecem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:62
msgid "Finally, click :guilabel:`Save` to load the changes."
msgstr "Na koncu kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`, da uveljavite spremembe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:64
msgid "The MPS setting in the Manufacturing app's settings."
msgstr "Nastavitev MPS v nastavitvah aplikacije Proizvodnja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:70
msgid "|MPS| dashboard"
msgstr "Nadzorna plošča |MPS|"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:72
msgid ""
"To open the |MPS|, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> "
"Planning --> Master Production Schedule`. The |MPS| is arranged as a grid "
"with the time periods represented as columns and each product :ref:`added to "
"the MPS <manufacturing/mps/add-product>` as an individual grouping of rows."
msgstr ""
"Za odpiranje |MPS| pojdite v :menuselection:`Aplikacija Proizvodnja --> "
"Načrtovanje --> Glavni proizvodni načrt`. |MPS| je organiziran kot mreža, "
"kjer so časovna obdobja prikazana kot stolpci, vsak izdelek, :ref:`dodan v "
"MPS <manufacturing/mps/add-product>`, pa kot samostojna skupina vrstic."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:76
msgid "By default, the group of rows for each product includes the following:"
msgstr "Privzeto skupina vrstic za posamezen izdelek vključuje naslednje:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`[Product] by [Unit] - [Company]`: The header row with the name of "
"the product, its unit of measure, and its company (if applicable). By "
"default, cells in this row display the product's starting stock quantity at "
"the beginning of each time period. Clicking the :guilabel:`[Product]` link "
"opens the product's forecasted report."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`[Izdelek] po [enoti] - [podjetje]`: vrstica z glavo, ki vsebuje "
"ime izdelka, njegovo mersko enoto in podjetje (če je primerno). Privzeto "
"celice v tej vrstici prikazujejo začetno količino zaloge izdelka na začetku "
"vsakega časovnega obdobja. Klik na povezavo :guilabel:`[Izdelek]` odpre "
"poročilo o napovedani zalogi izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`- Forecasted Demand`: The user's estimated demand for the product "
"during each time period. Cells in this row can be entered manually."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`- Napovedano povpraševanje`: ocenjeno povpraševanje uporabnika po "
"izdelku v posameznem časovnem obdobju. Celice v tej vrstici je mogoče vnesti "
"ročno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:84
msgid ""
":guilabel:`- Indirect Demand Forecast`: The forecasted demand for the "
"component from existing |MOs|. This row **only** appears if the product is a "
"component of another product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`- Napoved posrednega povpraševanja`: napovedano povpraševanje po "
"komponenti iz obstoječih |MOs|. Ta vrstica se prikaže **le**, če je izdelek "
"komponenta drugega izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:86
msgid ""
":guilabel:`+ Replenishment`: The user-specified quantity of the product to "
"be replenished through |MOs| or |POs|. Values in these cells are "
"automatically suggested based on the *Safety Stock Targets* and "
"replenishment minimums/maximums specified in the product's :ref:`schedule "
"configurations <manufacturing/mps/add-product>`. However, users can also "
"manually adjust these values. Clicking the :guilabel:`Order` button "
"manually :ref:`replenishes <manufacturing/mps/replenish>` the product based "
"on the quantity suggested or entered."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`+ Oskrba`: količina izdelka za oskrbo prek |MOs| ali |POs|, ki jo "
"določi uporabnik. Vrednosti v teh celicah so samodejno predlagane na podlagi "
"*ciljev varnostne zaloge* ter najmanjše in največje količine za oskrbo, "
"določene v :ref:`konfiguracijah urnika <manufacturing/mps/add-product>` "
"izdelka. Vendar lahko uporabniki te vrednosti tudi ročno prilagodijo. S "
"klikom na gumb :guilabel:`Naroči` se izdelek ročno :ref:`oskrbi "
"<manufacturing/mps/replenish>` glede na predlagano ali vneseno količino."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:92
msgid ""
":guilabel:`= Forecasted Stock`: The forecasted quantity of the product stock "
"at the end of each time period, assuming that suggested replenishment "
"numbers are fulfilled."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`= Napovedana zaloga`: napovedana količina zaloge izdelka ob koncu "
"vsakega časovnega obdobja ob predpostavki, da so predlagane količine "
"dopolnitve izpolnjene."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:95
msgid ""
":ref:`Additional rows and filters <manufacturing/mps/additional-rows-"
"filters>` can be selected in their respective sections of "
"the :guilabel:`Search...` bar drop-down menu at the top."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Dodatne vrstice in filtre <manufacturing/mps/additional-rows-filters>` "
"lahko izberete v ustreznih razdelkih spustnega menija vrstice "
":guilabel:`Išči...` na vrhu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:99
msgid ""
"While the |MPS| can be used with only the default categories, it may be "
"useful to enable the :guilabel:`Actual Demand` category in "
"the :guilabel:`Search...` bar."
msgstr ""
"Čeprav se |MPS| lahko uporablja samo s privzetimi kategorijami, je morda "
"koristno omogočiti kategorijo :guilabel:`Dejansko povpraševanje` v vrstici "
":guilabel:`Išči...`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:102
msgid ""
"With the :guilabel:`Actual Demand` option enabled, the :guilabel:`- "
"Forecasted Demand` category changes to the :guilabel:`- Actual / Forecasted "
"Demand` category, displaying both the confirmed demand for the product based "
"on confirmed |SOs| and the forecasted demand."
msgstr ""
"Z omogočeno možnostjo :guilabel:`Dejansko povpraševanje` se kategorija "
":guilabel:`- Napovedano povpraševanje` spremeni v kategorijo :guilabel:`- "
"Dejansko / napovedano povpraševanje`, ki prikazuje tako potrjeno "
"povpraševanje po izdelku na podlagi potrjenih |SOs| kot tudi napovedano "
"povpraševanje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:106
msgid "The Master Production Schedule in the Manufacturing app."
msgstr "Glavni proizvodni načrt v aplikaciji Proizvodnja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:110
msgid "Relationship between rows"
msgstr "Razmerje med vrsticami"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:112
msgid ""
"Together, the starting stock, :guilabel:`- Forecasted Demand`, :guilabel:`- "
"Indirect Demand Forecast` (if applicable), :guilabel:`+ Replenishment`, "
"and :guilabel:`= Forecasted Stock` values define the following relation:"
msgstr ""
"Skupaj začetna zaloga ter vrednosti :guilabel:`- Napovedano povpraševanje`, "
":guilabel:`- Napoved posrednega povpraševanja` (če je primerno), "
":guilabel:`+ Dopolnitev` in :guilabel:`= Napovedana zaloga` določajo "
"naslednje razmerje:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:116
msgid ""
"\\begin{align}\n"
"\\text{Forecasted Stock} &= \\text{Starting Stock} \\\\\n"
"&- \\text{Forecasted Demand} \\\\\n"
"&- \\text{Indirect Demand Forecast} \\\\\n"
"&+ \\text{Replenishment}\n"
"\\end{align}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{align}\n"
"\\text{Napovedana zaloga} &= \\text{Začetna zaloga} \\\\\n"
"&- \\text{Napovedano povpraševanje} \\\\\n"
"&- \\text{Napoved posrednega povpraševanja} \\\\\n"
"&+ \\text{Dopolnitev}\n"
"\\end{align}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:125
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`- Forecasted Demand` and :guilabel:`+ Replenishment` cells "
"can be manually adjusted for any of the time periods. Doing so updates the "
"value displayed in the :guilabel:`= Forecasted Stock` cells according to the "
"equation. Correspondingly, the starting stock quantity of each subsequent "
"time period is updated with the previous period's :guilabel:`= Forecasted "
"Stock`."
msgstr ""
"Celici :guilabel:`- Napovedano povpraševanje` in :guilabel:`+ Dopolnitev` je "
"mogoče ročno prilagoditi za katerokoli časovno obdobje. S tem se vrednost, "
"prikazana v celicah :guilabel:`= Napovedana zaloga`, posodobi v skladu z "
"enačbo. Skladno s tem se količina začetne zaloge vsakega naslednjega "
"časovnega obdobja posodobi z vrednostjo :guilabel:`= Napovedana zaloga` "
"prejšnjega obdobja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:131
msgid ""
"Changing the value in the :guilabel:`+ Replenishment` cell highlights the "
"value and displays an :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`(reset)` button next to "
"the cell to reset it back to the default value calculated by the |MPS|."
msgstr ""
"Sprememba vrednosti v celici :guilabel:`+ Dopolnitev` označi vrednost in ob "
"celici prikaže gumb :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`(ponastavi)`, s katerim jo "
"ponastavite nazaj na privzeto vrednost, ki jo izračuna |MPS|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:138
msgid "Adding products to |MPS|"
msgstr "Dodajanje izdelkov v |MPS|"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:140
msgid ""
"To use |MPS| to manage the replenishment of a product, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Planning --> Master Production "
"Schedule`. At the top of the |MPS| page, click :guilabel:`Add a Product` to "
"open the *Add a Product* pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Za uporabo |MPS| za upravljanje dopolnjevanja izdelka pojdite na "
":menuselection:`Aplikacija Proizvodnja --> Načrtovanje --> Glavni proizvodni "
"razpored`. Na vrhu strani |MPS| kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj izdelek`, da "
"odprete pojavno okno *Dodaj izdelek*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:145
msgid ""
"Products **must** be properly configured to be replenished through the |MPS|."
msgstr ""
"Izdelki **morajo** biti pravilno konfigurirani za dopolnjevanje preko |MPS|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:147
msgid ""
"For manufactured products, the *Manufacture* route must be selected in the "
"*Routes* section of the *Inventory* tab on the product's form."
msgstr ""
"Za proizvedene izdelke mora biti v razdelku *Proge* na zavihku *Zaloga* na "
"obrazcu izdelka izbrana proga *Proizvedi*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:150
msgid ""
"For purchased products, the *Buy* route must be selected in the *Routes* "
"section of the *Inventory* tab on the product's form. Additionally, "
"a :ref:`vendor pricelist <purchase/manage_deals/vendor-pricelist>` must be "
"configured on the *Purchase* tab."
msgstr ""
"Za kupljene izdelke mora biti v razdelku *Proge* na zavihku *Zaloga* na "
"obrazcu izdelka izbrana proga *Kupi*. Poleg tega mora biti na zavihku "
"*Nabava* konfiguriran :ref:`cenilnik dobavitelja <purchase/manage_deals/"
"vendor-pricelist>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:155
msgid "Enter product details"
msgstr "Vnos podrobnosti o izdelku"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:157
msgid ""
"On the pop-up window, select the product to add in the :guilabel:`Product` "
"drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"V pojavnem oknu v spustnem meniju :guilabel:`Izdelek` izberite izdelek, ki "
"ga želite dodati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:159
msgid "Then, specify the following information about the product:"
msgstr "Nato določite naslednje podatke o izdelku:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:161
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Indirect Demand`: Select this optional checkbox if the product "
"can be hidden when the :guilabel:`To Forecast` filter is selected in "
"the :guilabel:`Search...` bar drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Posredno povpraševanje`: označite to izbirno polje, če se izdelek "
"lahko skrije, ko je filter :guilabel:`Za napoved` izbran v spustnem meniju "
"vrstice :guilabel:`Išči...`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:163
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bill of Materials`: Select the product's |BoM| if the product is "
"manufactured."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kosovnica`: izberite |BoM| izdelka, če je izdelek proizveden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:164
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Route`: Select the replenishment route for the product (e.g., "
"`Buy` for purchased products, `Manufacture` for manufactured products)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Proga`: izberite progo dopolnitve za izdelek (npr. `Kupi` za "
"kupljene izdelke, `Proizvedi` za proizvedene izdelke)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:166
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vendor`: Select the vendor for the product. This field **only** "
"appears if the :guilabel:`Buy` option was selected in the :guilabel:`Route` "
"field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dobavitelj`: izberite dobavitelja za izdelek. To polje se prikaže "
"**samo**, če je bila možnost :guilabel:`Kupi` izbrana v polju "
":guilabel:`Proga`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:170
msgid ""
"Selecting a BoM when adding a product also adds any components listed on the "
"BoM to the |MPS|. If it is not necessary to manage the replenishment of "
"components through the |MPS|, leave the :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` field "
"blank."
msgstr ""
"Izbira kosovnice ob dodajanju izdelka doda tudi vse komponente, navedene na "
"kosovnici, v |MPS|. Če upravljanje oskrbe komponent prek |MPS| ni potrebno, "
"pustite polje :guilabel:`Kosovnica` prazno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:174
msgid ""
"If the database is configured with multiple warehouses, "
"a :guilabel:`Production Warehouse` field appears on the :guilabel:`Add a "
"Product` pop-up window to specify which warehouse the product is replenished "
"to."
msgstr ""
"Če je zbirka podatkov konfigurirana z več skladišči, se polje "
":guilabel:`Proizvodno skladišče` prikaže v pojavnem oknu :guilabel:`Dodaj "
"izdelek`, da določite, v katero skladišče se izdelek oskrbuje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:179
msgid "Enter product replenishment options"
msgstr "Vnos možnosti oskrbe izdelka"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:181
msgid ""
"Next, specify the product's replenishment options to configure how the |MPS| "
"calculates suggested replenishment quantities for each product. Enter the "
"following information:"
msgstr ""
"Nato določite možnosti oskrbe izdelka, da konfigurirate, kako |MPS| "
"izračunava predlagane količine oskrbe za posamezen izdelek. Vnesite "
"naslednje podatke:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:184
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Safety Stock Target`: Specify the minimum quantity of the product "
"to be available across all time periods."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cilj varnostne zaloge`: Določite najmanjšo količino izdelka, ki "
"mora biti na voljo v vseh časovnih obdobjih."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:186
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Minimum to Replenish`: Specify the minimum quantity of the "
"product to replenish for each period."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Najmanj za oskrbo`: Določite najmanjšo količino izdelka za oskrbo "
"v posameznem obdobju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:189
msgid ""
"By default, the |MPS| suggests the replenishment quantity needed to reach "
"the :guilabel:`Safety Stock Target` while accounting for the starting stock "
"and forecasted demand. In other words, the suggested quantity in the "
"replenishment row is calculated by the following relation:"
msgstr ""
"Privzeto |MPS| predlaga količino za dopolnitev, potrebno za doseganje cilja "
":guilabel:`Ciljna varnostna zaloga` ob upoštevanju začetne zaloge in "
"predvidenega povpraševanja. Z drugimi besedami, predlagana količina v "
"vrstici za dopolnitev se izračuna po naslednji relaciji:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:193
msgid ""
"\\begin{align}\n"
"\\text{Replenishment} &= \\text{Safety Stock Target} \\\\\n"
"&- \\text{Starting Stock} \\\\\n"
"&+ \\text{Forecasted Demand} \\\\\n"
"&+ \\text{Indirect Demand Forecast}\n"
"\\end{align}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{align}\n"
"\\text{Replenishment} &= \\text{Safety Stock Target} \\\\\n"
"&- \\text{Starting Stock} \\\\\n"
"&+ \\text{Forecasted Demand} \\\\\n"
"&+ \\text{Indirect Demand Forecast}\n"
"\\end{align}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:202
msgid ""
"If a :guilabel:`Minimum to Replenish` value is set, the |MPS| always "
"suggests this minimum replenishment quantity, unless ``Safety Stock Target - "
"Starting Stock + Forecasted Demand ≤ 0``."
msgstr ""
"Če je nastavljena vrednost :guilabel:`Najmanjša količina za dopolnitev`, "
"|MPS| vedno predlaga to najmanjšo količino za dopolnitev, razen če je "
"``Safety Stock Target - Starting Stock + Forecasted Demand ≤ 0``."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:206
msgid ""
"In general, the |MPS| suggests a quantity of `0` if ``Safety Stock Target - "
"Starting Stock + Forecasted Demand ≤ 0``."
msgstr ""
"Na splošno |MPS| predlaga količino `0`, če je ``Safety Stock Target - "
"Starting Stock + Forecasted Demand ≤ 0``."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:210
msgid "Specify replenishment trigger"
msgstr "Določitev sprožilca oskrbe"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:212
msgid ""
"Finally, in the :guilabel:`Replenishment Trigger` field, specify how the "
"product should be replenished:"
msgstr ""
"Na koncu v polju :guilabel:`Sprožilec oskrbe` določite, kako naj se izdelek "
"oskrbuje:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:215
msgid ":guilabel:`Manual`: Manually replenish the product from the |MPS|."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Ročno`: Ročno oskrbite izdelek iz |MPS|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:216
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Automatic`: Automatically schedule a replenishment order for the "
"product."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Samodejno`: Samodejno načrtujte naročilo za oskrbo izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:217
msgid ":guilabel:`Never`: Never replenish the product from the |MPS|."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Nikoli`: Nikoli ne oskrbujte izdelka iz |MPS|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:219
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Save` to add the product to the |MPS|. The product now "
"appears on the |MPS| page, along with any components (if applicable)."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`, da dodate izdelek v |MPS|. Izdelek se zdaj "
"prikaže na strani |MPS| skupaj z morebitnimi komponentami (če je primerno)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:222
msgid "The Add a Product pop-up window in the MPS."
msgstr "Pojavno okno Dodaj izdelek v MPS."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:226
msgid "Edit a product"
msgstr "Uredi izdelek"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:228
msgid ""
"To edit the planning schedule for a product on the |MPS|, click "
"the :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(Forecasted)` button next to the product's "
"header row."
msgstr ""
"Za urejanje urnika načrtovanja za izdelek na |MPS| kliknite gumb :icon:`fa-"
"pencil` :guilabel:`(Napovedano)` poleg vrstice z glavo izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:231
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Edit Production Schedule` pop-up window, enter the desired "
"modifications. Then, click :guilabel:`Save` to save the changes."
msgstr ""
"V pojavnem oknu :guilabel:`Uredi razpored proizvodnje` vnesite želene "
"spremembe. Nato kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`, da shranite spremembe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:235
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Product` and :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` fields cannot be "
"edited."
msgstr "Polj :guilabel:`Izdelek` in :guilabel:`Kosovnica` ni mogoče urejati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:238
msgid "Remove a product"
msgstr "Odstrani izdelek"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:240
msgid ""
"To remove a product from the |MPS|, select the checkbox next to its name. "
"Then, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` button at the top of the "
"screen, and select :guilabel:`Delete` from the drop-down menu. On "
"the :guilabel:`Confirmation` pop-up window, click :guilabel:`Ok`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite odstraniti izdelek iz |MPS|, označite potrditveno polje ob "
"njegovem imenu. Nato na vrhu zaslona kliknite gumb :icon:`fa-cog` "
":guilabel:`Dejanja` in v spustnem meniju izberite :guilabel:`Izbriši`. V "
"pojavnem oknu :guilabel:`Potrditev` kliknite :guilabel:`V redu`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:247
msgid "Suggest forecasted demand"
msgstr "Predlagaj napovedano povpraševanje"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:249
msgid ""
"Instead of an arbitrary value, the *Forecasted Demand* for each product and "
"its time periods can be automatically suggested based on historical demand. "
"To do so, click the :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(Suggest Forecasted "
"Demand)` icon next to the :guilabel:`- Forecasted Demand` row header. This "
"opens the *Suggest Forecasted Demand* pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Namesto poljubne vrednosti se lahko *napovedano povpraševanje* za vsak "
"izdelek in njegova časovna obdobja samodejno predlaga na podlagi preteklega "
"povpraševanja. Če želite to narediti, kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-pencil` "
":guilabel:`(Predlagaj napovedano povpraševanje)` poleg glave vrstice "
":guilabel:`- Napovedano povpraševanje`. To odpre pojavno okno *Predlagaj "
"napovedano povpraševanje*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:254
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Period` field, select a time period. To suggest forecasted "
"demand quantities for all periods, leave the field blank."
msgstr ""
"V polju :guilabel:`Obdobje` izberite časovno obdobje. Če želite predlagati "
"količine napovedanega povpraševanja za vsa obdobja, pustite polje prazno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:257
msgid ""
"Next to the :guilabel:`Based on` field, select one of the following options "
"from the drop-down menu to specify the source of the new estimate:"
msgstr ""
"Poleg polja :guilabel:`Na podlagi` v spustnem meniju izberite eno od "
"naslednjih možnosti, da določite vir nove ocene:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:260
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Actual Demand`: Suggest based on previously confirmed or "
"completed outgoing moves for the matching period one year ago."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dejansko povpraševanje`: predlaga na podlagi predhodno potrjenih "
"ali zaključenih izhodnih premikov za ustrezno obdobje pred enim letom."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:262
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Previous Year`: Suggest based on completed outgoing moves "
"**only** for matching period one year ago."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Prejšnje leto`: predlaga na podlagi **samo** zaključenih izhodnih "
"premikov za ustrezno obdobje pred enim letom."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:264
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Last 30 Days`: Suggest based on the product's average demand over "
"the last 30 days, prorated to the length of one time period."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Zadnjih 30 dni`: predlaga na podlagi povprečnega povpraševanja po "
"izdelku v zadnjih 30 dneh, preračunanega na dolžino enega časovnega obdobja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:266
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Last 3 Months`: Suggest based on the product's average demand "
"over the last three months, prorated to the length of one time period."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Zadnji 3 meseci`: predlaga na podlagi povprečnega povpraševanja "
"po izdelku v zadnjih treh mesecih, preračunanega na dolžino enega časovnega "
"obdobja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:268
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Last 12 Months`: Suggest based on the product's average demand "
"over the last 12 months, prorated to the length of one time period."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Zadnjih 12 mesecev`: predlaga na podlagi povprečnega "
"povpraševanja po izdelku v zadnjih 12 mesecih, preračunanega na dolžino "
"enega časovnega obdobja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:271
msgid ""
"In the second field, enter the scaling factor to account for "
"a :guilabel:`(#) %` increase or decrease in projected demand (e.g., `110%` "
"projects a demand growth of 10 percent)."
msgstr ""
"V drugo polje vnesite faktor prilagoditve za upoštevanje :guilabel:`(#) %` "
"povečanja ali zmanjšanja načrtovanega povpraševanja (npr. z `110%` "
"načrtujete 10-odstotno rast povpraševanja)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:274
msgid ""
"Finally, click :guilabel:`Apply` to apply the suggested demand for the "
"specified time periods, or click :guilabel:`Discard` to cancel."
msgstr ""
"Na koncu kliknite :guilabel:`Uveljavi`, da uveljavite predlagano "
"povpraševanje za navedena časovna obdobja, ali kliknite :guilabel:`Zavrzi` "
"za preklic."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:280
msgid "Replenishing products with |MPS|"
msgstr "Dopolnjevanje zalog izdelkov z |MPS|"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:282
msgid "Products in the |MPS| can be replenished in one of three ways:"
msgstr "Izdelke v |MPS| je mogoče dopolniti na enega od treh načinov:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:284
msgid ""
"To replenish every product for the current time period, click "
"the :guilabel:`Order` button at the top."
msgstr ""
"Če želite dopolniti vse izdelke za trenutno časovno obdobje, kliknite gumb "
":guilabel:`Naroči` na vrhu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:286
msgid ""
"To replenish a specific product, click the :guilabel:`Order` button next to "
"the :guilabel:`+ Replenishment` row of the product."
msgstr ""
"Če želite dopolniti določen izdelek, kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Naroči` poleg "
"vrstice :guilabel:`+ Dopolnitev` pri tem izdelku."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:288
msgid ""
"To select and replenish multiple products, select the checkbox next to one "
"or more products' header rows. Then, click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Actions` button at the top and select :guilabel:`Order` from "
"the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Če želite izbrati in dopolniti več izdelkov, označite potrditveno polje ob "
"vrstici z glavo enega ali več izdelkov. Nato na vrhu kliknite gumb :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Dejanja` in v spustnem meniju izberite :guilabel:`Naroči`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:292
msgid ""
"The type of replenishment order generated is determined by the route "
"selected on the *Add a Product* pop-up window when :ref:`adding a product "
"<manufacturing/mps/add-product>` to the |MPS|."
msgstr ""
"Vrsta ustvarjenega naročila za oskrbo je odvisna od proge, izbrane v "
"pojavnem oknu *Dodaj izdelek* pri :ref:`dodajanju izdelka <manufacturing/mps/"
"add-product>` v |MPS|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:295
msgid ""
"If the *Buy* route is selected, an |RfQ| is generated to purchase the "
"product. Generated |RfQs| can be located by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Purchase app --> Orders --> Requests for Quotation`."
msgstr ""
"Če je izbrana proga *Kupi*, se za nakup izdelka ustvari |RfQ|. Ustvarjene "
"|RfQs| najdete tako, da odprete :menuselection:`aplikacijo Nabava --> "
"Naročila --> Zahtevki za ponudbo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:298
msgid ""
"If the *Manufacture* route is selected, an |MO| is generated to manufacture "
"the product. Generated |MOs| can be located by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Manufacturing "
"Orders`."
msgstr ""
"Če je izbrana proga *Proizvedi*, se za proizvodnjo izdelka ustvari |MO|. "
"Ustvarjene |MOs| najdete tako, da odprete :menuselection:`aplikacijo "
"Proizvodnja --> Operacije --> Proizvodni nalogi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:305
msgid "Replenishment status indicators"
msgstr "Kazalniki stanja oskrbe"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:307
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`+ Replenishment` cells in the |MPS| are displayed using the "
"following highlights, depending on whether the replenished quantities match "
"the suggested quantities:"
msgstr ""
"Celice :guilabel:`+ Oskrba` v |MPS| so prikazane z naslednjimi barvnimi "
"poudarki glede na to, ali se oskrbovane količine ujemajo s predlaganimi "
"količinami:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:310
msgid ":guilabel:`Green`: The quantity is ready to be replenished."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Zelena`: količina je pripravljena za oskrbo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:311
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Gray`: A replenishment order has already been generated, and its "
"ordered quantity matches the suggested quantity for the time period."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Siva`: naročilo za oskrbo je že bilo ustvarjeno in njegova "
"naročena količina se ujema s predlagano količino za to časovno obdobje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:313
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Yellow`: A replenishment order has already been generated, but "
"its ordered quantity is below the suggested quantity for the time period."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Rumena`: naročilo za oskrbo je že bilo ustvarjeno, vendar je "
"njegova naročena količina manjša od predlagane količine za to časovno "
"obdobje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:315
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Red`: A replenishment order has already been generated, but its "
"ordered quantity exceeds the suggested quantity for the time period."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Rdeča`: naročilo za oskrbo je že bilo ustvarjeno, vendar njegova "
"naročena količina presega predlagano količino za to časovno obdobje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:321
msgid "Additional rows and filters"
msgstr "Dodatne vrstice in filtri"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:323
msgid ""
"With the :guilabel:`Search...` bar drop-down menu, users may further "
"customize the |MPS| by configuring additional rows for products or by "
"filtering existing records based on specific criteria."
msgstr ""
"V spustnem meniju iskalne vrstice :guilabel:`Išči...` lahko uporabniki "
"dodatno prilagodijo |MPS| tako, da konfigurirajo dodatne vrstice za izdelke "
"ali filtrirajo obstoječe zapise na podlagi določenih meril."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:328
msgid "Rows"
msgstr "Vrstice"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:330
msgid ""
"The following rows can be added to the |MPS| in addition to the default rows "
"shown on the :ref:`dashboard <manufacturing/mps/dashboard>`."
msgstr ""
"V |MPS| je poleg privzetih vrstic, prikazanih na :ref:`nadzorni plošči "
"<manufacturing/mps/dashboard>`, mogoče dodati naslednje vrstice."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:333
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Actual Demand`: Changes the :guilabel:`- Forecasted Demand` row "
"to :guilabel:`- Actual / Forecasted Demand`, comparing the product's "
"confirmed demand and its forecasted demand."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dejansko povpraševanje`: spremeni vrstico :guilabel:`- Napovedano "
"povpraševanje` v :guilabel:`- Dejansko / napovedano povpraševanje` ter "
"primerja potrjeno in napovedano povpraševanje po izdelku."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:335
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Actual Demand Y-1`: Displays the :guilabel:`Actual Demand` one "
"year before the current time period."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dejansko povpraševanje L-1`: prikaže :guilabel:`Dejansko "
"povpraševanje` eno leto pred trenutnim časovnim obdobjem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:337
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Actual Demand Y-2`: Displays the :guilabel:`Actual Demand` two "
"years before the current time period."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dejansko povpraševanje L-2`: prikaže :guilabel:`Dejansko "
"povpraševanje` dve leti pred trenutnim časovnim obdobjem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:339
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Indirect Actual Demand`: Changes the :guilabel:`- Indirect Demand "
"Forecast` row to :guilabel:`- Actual / Indirect Demand Forecast`, comparing "
"the component's confirmed demand and its forecasted demand."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Posredno dejansko povpraševanje`: spremeni vrstico :guilabel:`- "
"Napoved posrednega povpraševanja` v :guilabel:`- Dejansko / napoved "
"posrednega povpraševanja` ter primerja potrjeno povpraševanje po komponenti "
"z njenim napovedanim povpraševanjem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:342
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Actual Replenishment`: Changes the :guilabel:`+ Replenishment` "
"row to :guilabel:`+ Actual / Replenishment`, comparing the product's "
"replenished quantity and its suggested quantity."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dejanska oskrba`: spremeni vrstico :guilabel:`+ Oskrba` v "
":guilabel:`+ Dejansko / oskrba` ter primerja oskrbovano količino izdelka z "
"njegovo predlagano količino."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:344
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Available to Promise`: Changes the :guilabel:`= Forecasted Stock` "
"row to :guilabel:`= ATP / Forecasted Stock`, comparing the product's "
"available stock (``Starting Stock - Actual Demand + Replenishment``) and its "
"forecasted stock. If the product is a component, the available stock is "
"calculated by ``Starting Stock - Actual Demand - Indirect Actual Demand + "
"Replenishment``."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Razpoložljivo za obljubo`: spremeni vrstico :guilabel:`= "
"Napovedana zaloga` v :guilabel:`= ATP / Napovedana zaloga` ter primerja "
"razpoložljivo zalogo izdelka (``Starting Stock - Actual Demand + "
"Replenishment``) z njeno napovedano zalogo. Če je izdelek komponenta, se "
"razpoložljiva zaloga izračuna kot ``Starting Stock - Actual Demand - "
"Indirect Actual Demand + Replenishment``."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:352
msgid ""
"Users can filter records from the |MPS| based on the following criteria:"
msgstr "Uporabniki lahko zapise iz |MPS| filtrirajo glede na naslednja merila:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:354
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Forecast`: Filter by products that are manually or "
"automatically replenished."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Za napoved`: filtriranje po izdelkih, ki se oskrbujejo ročno ali "
"samodejno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:355
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Replenish`: Filter by products that are ready to be "
"replenished (i.e., with at least one :guilabel:`+ Replenishment` cell "
"highlighted in green)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Za oskrbo`: filtriranje po izdelkih, ki so pripravljeni za oskrbo "
"(tj. z vsaj eno celico :guilabel:`+ Oskrba`, obarvano zeleno)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:357
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Indirect Demand`: Filter by products configured with the "
"*Indirect Demand* option."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Posredno povpraševanje`: filtriranje po izdelkih, konfiguriranih "
"z možnostjo *Posredno povpraševanje*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:358
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Replenishment Too Low`: Filter by products with a replenished "
"quantity below the suggested replenishment quantity (i.e., with at least "
"one :guilabel:`+ Replenishment` cell highlighted in yellow)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Prenizka popolnitev`: filtrirajte po izdelkih s popolnjeno "
"količino pod predlagano količino popolnitve (tj. z vsaj eno celico "
":guilabel:`+ Popolnitev`, označeno z rumeno)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:361
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Replenishment Too High`: Filter by products with a replenished "
"quantity above the suggested replenishment quantity (i.e., with at least "
"one :guilabel:`+ Replenishment` cell highlighted in red)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Previsoka popolnitev`: filtrirajte po izdelkih s popolnjeno "
"količino nad predlagano količino popolnitve (tj. z vsaj eno celico "
":guilabel:`+ Popolnitev`, označeno z rdečo)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:364
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Forecast Too Low`: Filter by products with an actual demand "
"greater than the forecasted demand (e.g., :guilabel:`Actual Demand` is "
"greater than :guilabel:`Forecasted Demand`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Prenizka napoved`: filtrira po izdelkih z dejanskim "
"povpraševanjem, ki je večje od napovedanega povpraševanja (npr. "
":guilabel:`Dejansko povpraševanje` je večje od :guilabel:`Napovedano "
"povpraševanje`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:366
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manually Replenished`: Filter by products with the *Replenishment "
"Trigger* set to *Manual*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Ročno popolnjeno`: filtrirajte po izdelkih, pri katerih je "
"*Sprožilec popolnitve* nastavljen na *Ročno*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:368
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Automatically Replenished`: Filter by products with the "
"*Replenishment Trigger* set to *Automatic*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Samodejno popolnjeno`: filtrirajte po izdelkih, pri katerih je "
"*Sprožilec popolnitve* nastavljen na *Samodejno*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:370
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Not Replenished from MPS`: Filter by products with the "
"*Replenishment Trigger* set to *Never*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Ni popolnjeno iz MPS`: filtrirajte po izdelkih, pri katerih je "
"*Sprožilec popolnitve* nastavljen na *Nikoli*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:3
msgid "Work center time off"
msgstr "Odsotnost delovnega centra"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:7
msgid ""
"In Odoo, *work centers* are used to carry out manufacturing operations at "
"specific locations. However, if a work center cannot be used for some "
"reason, work orders begin to pile up at the work center until it is "
"operational again."
msgstr ""
"V Odoo se *delovni centri* uporabljajo za izvajanje proizvodnih operacij na "
"določenih lokacijah. Če pa delovni center iz kakršnega koli razloga ni na "
"voljo, se delovna naročila začnejo kopičiti pri delovnem centru, dokler ta "
"ponovno ne postane operativen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:11
msgid ""
"As a result, it is necessary to make the work center unavailable in Odoo so "
"new work orders are routed to alternative work centers that are operational. "
"Using Odoo's **Time Off** app, it is possible to designate a work center as "
"being unavailable for a set period of time. Doing so ensures manufacturing "
"operations can continue until the impacted work center is available again."
msgstr ""
"Zato je treba delovni center v Odoo označiti kot nedostopnega, da se nova "
"delovna naročila preusmerijo na alternativne delovne centre, ki so "
"operativni. Z uporabo aplikacije **Odsotnost** v Odoo je mogoče delovni "
"center označiti kot nedostopnega za določeno obdobje. To zagotavlja, da se "
"proizvodne operacije lahko nadaljujejo, dokler prizadeti delovni center "
"ponovno ne postane dostopen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:19
msgid ""
"Before a work center can be designated as unavailable, the Odoo platform "
"must be properly configured. First, it is necessary to "
"enable :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`. This allows the *Time Off* "
"smart button to appear on each work center's *Working Hours* page."
msgstr ""
"Preden lahko delovni center označite kot nedostopnega, mora biti platforma "
"Odoo pravilno konfigurirana. Najprej je treba omogočiti :ref:`razvijalski "
"način <developer-mode>`. To omogoči, da se pametni gumb *Odsotnost* pojavi "
"na strani *Delovni čas* vsakega delovnega centra."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:23
msgid ""
"Next, install the **Time Off** app. This is the app used for managing time "
"off for all resources within Odoo, including employees and work centers."
msgstr ""
"Nato namestite aplikacijo **Odsotnost**. To je aplikacija, ki se uporablja "
"za upravljanje odsotnosti za vse vire v Odoo, vključno z zaposlenimi in "
"delovnimi centri."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:26
msgid ""
"To do so, navigate to the :menuselection:`Apps` app, then search `Time Off` "
"in the search bar. The card for the :guilabel:`Time Off` app should be the "
"only one that appears on the page. Click the :guilabel:`Install` button on "
"the card to install the app."
msgstr ""
"To storite tako, da se pomaknete v aplikacijo :menuselection:`Aplikacije`, "
"nato v iskalno vrstico vnesite `Odsotnost`. Na strani bi morala biti "
"prikazana samo kartica za aplikacijo :guilabel:`Odsotnost`. Kliknite "
"gumb :guilabel:`Namesti` na kartici, da namestite aplikacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:30
msgid ""
"The last step is to properly configure work centers. For this workflow, it "
"is necessary to have at least two work centers: one that is made "
"unavailable, and a second that receives the work orders that the other "
"cannot accept. If no second work center is configured, Odoo cannot route "
"work orders away from the unavailable work center, and they pile up in its "
"queue."
msgstr ""
"Zadnji korak je pravilna konfiguracija delovnih centrov. Za ta potek dela "
"sta potrebna vsaj dva delovna centra: eden, ki postane nedostopen, in drugi, "
"ki prejme delovna naročila, ki jih prvi ne more sprejeti. Če ni konfiguriran "
"noben drugi delovni center, Odoo ne more preusmeriti delovnih naročil stran "
"od nedostopnega delovnega centra in ta se kopičijo v njegovi vrsti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:35
msgid ""
"To create a work center, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> "
"Configuration --> Work Centers --> New`."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje delovnega centra se pomaknite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Proizvodnja --> Konfiguracija --> Delovni centri --> Novo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:39
msgid ""
"For a full guide to work center creation, refer to the documentation "
"on :doc:`work centers <../advanced_configuration/using_work_centers>`."
msgstr ""
"Za popoln vodnik po ustvarjanju delovnih centrov glejte dokumentacijo "
"o :doc:`delovnih centrih <../advanced_configuration/using_work_centers>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:42
msgid ""
"Make sure both work centers have the same equipment listed under "
"the :guilabel:`Equipment` tab. This ensures operations carried out at one "
"work center can also be performed at the other."
msgstr ""
"Prepričajte se, da imata oba delovna centra na seznamu pod "
"zavihkom :guilabel:`Oprema` navedeno enako opremo. To zagotavlja, da se "
"operacije, ki se izvajajo v enem delovnem centru, lahko izvajajo tudi v "
"drugem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:45
msgid ""
"On the work center that is made unavailable, select the second work center "
"from the :guilabel:`Alternative Workcenters` drop-down menu. Now, Odoo knows "
"to send work orders to the second work center when the first is unavailable "
"for any reason."
msgstr ""
"Na delovnem centru, ki postane nedostopen, izberite drugi delovni center iz "
"spustnega menija :guilabel:`Alternativni delovni centri`. Zdaj Odoo ve, da "
"mora delovna naročila poslati drugemu delovnemu centru, ko prvi iz kakršnega "
"koli razloga ni na voljo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:49
msgid "A work center form configured with an alternative work center."
msgstr ""
"Obrazec delovnega centra, konfiguriran z alternativnim delovnim centrom."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:54
msgid "Add time off for a work center"
msgstr "Dodajanje odsotnosti za delovni center"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:56
msgid ""
"With configuration completed, time off can now be assigned to a work center. "
"Begin by navigating to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --"
"> Work Centers`, and selecting the affected work center. Click the :icon:`oi-"
"arrow-right` :guilabel:`(Internal link)` button on the right side of "
"the :guilabel:`Working Hours` drop-down menu, to open the working hours page "
"for the work center."
msgstr ""
"Ko je konfiguracija zaključena, lahko zdaj dodelite odsotnost delovnemu "
"centru. Začnite tako, da se pomaknete na :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Proizvodnja --> Konfiguracija --> Delovni centri` in izberete prizadeti "
"delovni center. Kliknite gumb :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(Notranja "
"povezava)` na desni strani spustnega menija :guilabel:`Delovni čas`, da "
"odprete stran delovnega časa za delovni center."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:61
msgid "The Working Hours \"External link\" button on the work center form."
msgstr "Gumb \"Zunanja povezava\" za delovni čas na obrazcu delovnega centra."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:65
msgid ""
"The working hours page displays the standard working hours for the work "
"center. With developer mode activated, a :icon:`fa-plane` :guilabel:`Time "
"Off` smart button appears at the top of the page. Click it to open "
"the :guilabel:`Resource Time Off` page."
msgstr ""
"Stran delovnega časa prikazuje standardne delovne ure za delovno mesto. Ko "
"je aktiviran razvijalski način, se na vrhu strani prikaže pametni "
"gumb :icon:`fa-plane` :guilabel:`Odsotnost`. Kliknite ga, da odprete "
"stran :guilabel:`Odsotnost vira`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:69
msgid ""
"On this page, click :guilabel:`New` to configure a new time-off entry. On "
"the time-off form, note the :guilabel:`Reason` for the work center closure "
"(e.g. broken equipment, maintenance, etc.), select the affected work center "
"as the :guilabel:`Resource`, and choose a :guilabel:`Start Date` "
"and :guilabel:`End Date` to specify the period during which the work center "
"is unavailable."
msgstr ""
"Na tej strani kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`, da konfigurirate nov vnos "
"odsotnosti. Na obrazcu odsotnosti zabeležite :guilabel:`Razlog` za zaprtje "
"delovnega mesta (npr. pokvarjena oprema, vzdrževanje itd.), izberite "
"prizadeto delovno mesto kot :guilabel:`Vir` in izberite :guilabel:`Začetni "
"datum` ter :guilabel:`Končni datum`, da določite obdobje, v katerem delovno "
"mesto ni na voljo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:74
msgid "The \"Resource Time Off\" form."
msgstr "Obrazec \"Odsotnost vira\"."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:79
msgid "Alternative work center planning"
msgstr "Načrtovanje alternativnega delovnega mesta"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:81
msgid ""
"Once a work center is within its specified time-off period, work orders sent "
"to it can be automatically routed to an alternative work center using the "
"*Plan* button."
msgstr ""
"Ko je delovno mesto v določenem obdobju odsotnosti, lahko delovna naročila, "
"poslana nanj, samodejno preusmerimo na alternativno delovno mesto z gumbom "
"*Načrtuj*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:84
msgid ""
"Begin by creating a new manufacturing order (MO), by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders "
"--> New`. On the |MO| form, specify a :guilabel:`Product` that uses the "
"unavailable work center for one of its operations. Click :guilabel:`Confirm` "
"to confirm the |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Začnite z ustvarjanjem novega proizvodnega naloga (PN) tako, da se pomaknete "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Proizvodnja --> Operacije --> Proizvodni "
"nalogi --> Novo`. Na obrazcu |MO| določite :guilabel:`Izdelek`, ki za eno od "
"svojih operacij uporablja nedostopno delovno mesto. "
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`, da potrdite |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:89
msgid ""
"On the confirmed |MO|, select the :guilabel:`Work Orders` tab. By default, "
"the unavailable work center is specified in the :guilabel:`Work Center` "
"column. There is also a :guilabel:`Plan` button at the top left of the page."
msgstr ""
"Na potrjenem |MO| izberite zavihek :guilabel:`Delovni nalogi`. Privzeto je "
"nedostopno delovno mesto navedeno v stolpcu :guilabel:`Delovno mesto`. Na "
"vrhu leve strani je tudi gumb :guilabel:`Načrtuj`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:93
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Plan`, and the work center listed in the :guilabel:`Work "
"Center` column of the :guilabel:`Work Orders` tab is automatically changed "
"to the alternative work center."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Načrtuj` in delovno mesto, navedeno v "
"stolpcu :guilabel:`Delovno mesto` zavihka :guilabel:`Delovna naročila`, se "
"samodejno spremeni v alternativno delovno mesto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:96
msgid ""
"Before clicking \"Plan\", the work order is scheduled at \"Main Assembly "
"Line\"."
msgstr ""
"Pred klikom na \"Načrtuj\" je delovno naročilo načrtovano pri \"Glavna "
"montažna linija\"."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:100
msgid ""
"Before clicking :guilabel:`Plan`, the work order is scheduled "
"at :guilabel:`Main Assembly Line`."
msgstr ""
"Pred klikom na :guilabel:`Načrtuj` je delovno naročilo načrtovano "
"pri :guilabel:`Glavna montažna linija`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:102
msgid ""
"After clicking \"Plan\", the work order is rescheduled at \"Alternative "
"Assembly Line\"."
msgstr ""
"Po kliku na \"Načrtuj\" je delovno naročilo ponovno načrtovano pri "
"\"Alternativna montažna linija\"."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:106
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`Plan`, the work order is rescheduled "
"at :guilabel:`Alternative Assembly Line`."
msgstr ""
"Po kliku na :guilabel:`Načrtuj` je delovno naročilo ponovno načrtovano "
"pri :guilabel:`Alternativna montažna linija`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:109
msgid ""
"Once the time-off period for the unavailable work center ends, Odoo "
"recognizes the work center is available again. At this point, clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Plan` button does not route work orders to an alternative "
"work center unless the first one is at capacity."
msgstr ""
"Ko se obdobje odsotnosti za nedostopno delovno mesto konča, Odoo prepozna, "
"da je delovno mesto ponovno na voljo. V tem trenutku klik na "
"gumb :guilabel:`Načrtuj` ne preusmeri delovnih naročil na alternativno "
"delovno mesto, razen če je prvo na polni zmogljivosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm.rst:8
msgid "Product lifecycle management"
msgstr "Upravljanje življenjskega cikla izdelka"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm.rst:10
msgid ""
"Odoo's *Product Lifecycle Management*, or *PLM* offers a systematic approach "
"for testing, collaboration, and iteration of products across concept "
"development, design, manufacturing, marketing, and post-launch support "
"stages."
msgstr ""
"Odoo *Product Lifecycle Management* ali *PLM* ponuja sistematičen pristop k "
"testiranju, sodelovanju in iteraciji izdelkov v fazah razvoja koncepta, "
"oblikovanja, proizvodnje, trženja in podpore po lansiranju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm.rst:14
msgid ""
"With approvals, key stakeholders can review changes before implementation."
msgstr ""
"S potrditvami lahko ključni deležniki pregledajo spremembe pred "
"implementacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm.rst:17
msgid "Install PLM"
msgstr "Namestitev PLM"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm.rst:19
msgid ""
"Despite being used to iterate on **Manufacturing** bills of materials, "
"**PLM** is *not* installed by default when installing the **Manufacturing** "
"app. It must be installed separately to take advantage of its benefits."
msgstr ""
"Kljub temu da se uporablja za iteracijo na kosovnicah **Proizvodnja**, "
"**PLM** *ni* privzeto nameščen ob namestitvi aplikacije **Proizvodnja**. "
"Namestiti ga je treba ločeno, da se izkoristijo njegove prednosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm.rst:23
msgid ""
"To install **PLM**, open the **Apps** app. Search for `PLM`, then "
"click :guilabel:`Install` on the :guilabel:`Product Lifecycle Management "
"(PLM)` card."
msgstr ""
"Za namestitev **PLM** odprite aplikacijo **Aplikacije**. Poiščite `PLM`, "
"nato kliknite :guilabel:`Namesti` na kartici :guilabel:`Product Lifecycle "
"Management (PLM)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm.rst:27
msgid ""
"Adding or removing apps can affect other apps and modify subscription costs. "
"See :doc:`../general/apps_modules` to learn more."
msgstr ""
"Dodajanje ali odstranjevanje aplikacij lahko vpliva na druge aplikacije in "
"spremeni stroške naročnine. Za več informacij glejte :doc:`../general/"
"apps_modules`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes.rst:3
msgid "Change management"
msgstr "Upravljanje sprememb"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:10
msgid "ECO types and stages"
msgstr "Vrste in faze ECO"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:12
msgid ""
"Engineering change orders (ECOs) are categorized by the type of change they "
"represent and their statuses are tracked via stages. Both |ECO| types and "
"stages are defined by the user and can be customized to the specific needs "
"of a business or industry."
msgstr ""
"Inženirska naročila za spremembe (ECO) so razvrščena glede na vrsto "
"spremembe, ki jo predstavljajo, in njihovi statusi so sledeni prek faz. "
"Vrste in faze |ECO| določi uporabnik in jih je mogoče prilagoditi "
"specifičnim potrebam podjetja ali industrije."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:17
msgid "ECO types"
msgstr "Vrste ECO"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:19
msgid ""
"Each |ECO| type separates |ECOs| into different projects in "
"the :guilabel:`PLM Overview`, ensuring collaborators and stakeholders only "
"view and assist with relevant |BOM| improvements."
msgstr ""
"Vsak |ECO| tip loči |ECOs| v različne projekte v :guilabel:`PLM pregledu`, "
"kar zagotavlja, da sodelavci in zainteresirane strani vidijo in pomagajo le "
"pri ustreznih izboljšavah |BOM|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:23
msgid ""
"An electronic chip manufacturer uses five |ECO| types: `New Product "
"Introduction`, `BOM Updates`, `Component Change`, `Product Improvement`, and "
"`Firmware Update`. In their configuration, engineers can spend time "
"exclusively on |ECOs| in the `Component Change` and `Firmware Update` types, "
"while designers see |ECOs| in the `New Product Introduction` type, allowing "
"each discipline to focus only on those changes that require their domain "
"expertise."
msgstr ""
"Proizvajalec elektronskih čipov uporablja pet |ECO| tipov: `New Product "
"Introduction`, `BOM Updates`, `Component Change`, `Product Improvement` in "
"`Firmware Update`. V njihovi konfiguraciji lahko inženirji porabijo čas "
"izključno za |ECOs| v tipih `Component Change` in `Firmware Update`, medtem "
"ko oblikovalci vidijo |ECOs| v tipu `New Product Introduction`, kar omogoča "
"vsaki disciplini, da se osredotoči samo na tiste spremembe, ki zahtevajo "
"njihovo področno strokovno znanje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:29
msgid "Example of several custom ECO types."
msgstr "Primer več tipov ECO po meri."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:32
msgid ""
"Two default |ECO| types are available: :guilabel:`Product Revision` "
"and :guilabel:`New Product Introduction`."
msgstr ""
"Na voljo sta dve privzeti vrsti |ECO|: :guilabel:`Product Revision` in "
":guilabel:`New Product Introduction`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:38
msgid "Create an ECO type"
msgstr "Ustvari tip ECO"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:40
msgid ""
"To access and manage ECO types, navigate to :menuselection:`PLM app --> "
"Configuration --> ECO Types`."
msgstr ""
"Za dostop do tipov ECO in upravljanje z njimi pojdite na :menuselection:`PLM "
"aplikacija --> Konfiguracija --> ECO tipi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:43
msgid ""
"Create a new ECO type by clicking :guilabel:`New`. On the new :guilabel:`ECO "
"Types` form, fill in the following information:"
msgstr ""
"Ustvarite nov tip ECO s klikom na :guilabel:`Novo`. Na novem "
"obrazcu :guilabel:`ECO tipi` izpolnite naslednje informacije:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:46
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Name`: The name of the |ECO| type, which will organize all of the "
"|ECOs| of this *type* in a project."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Ime`: ime |ECO| tipa, ki bo organiziral vse |ECOs| tega *tipa* v "
"projektu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:48
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Email Alias`: If this optional field is filled, emails submitted "
"to this email address automatically generate |ECOs| in the first stage of "
"this |ECO| type."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Email Alias`: Če je to izbirno polje izpolnjeno, e-poštna "
"sporočila, poslana na ta naslov, samodejno ustvarijo |ECOs| v prvi stopnji "
"te vrste |ECO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:52
msgid ""
"The `Formulation change` |ECO| type is used to organize and track related |"
"ECOs| in a single project. Configuring the :guilabel:`Email Alias` field "
"generates |ECOs| in the `Formulation change` project sent to the email "
"address, `pawlish-change@pawlished-glam.odoo.com`."
msgstr ""
"|ECO| tip `Formulation change` se uporablja za organizacijo in sledenje "
"povezanih |ECOs| v enem projektu. Konfiguracija polja :guilabel:`E-poštni "
"vzdevek` ustvari |ECOs| v projektu `Formulation change`, poslane na e-poštni "
"naslov `pawlish-change@pawlished-glam.odoo.com`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:56
msgid "Example of an ECO type."
msgstr "Primer tipa ECO."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:60
msgid "Edit ECO types"
msgstr "Uredi tipe ECO"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:62
msgid ""
"Modify existing |ECO| type names and email aliases by navigating to "
"the :menuselection:`PLM app --> Configuration --> ECO Types` page. There, "
"click on the desired |ECO| type from the list."
msgstr ""
"Spremenite obstoječa imena |ECO| tipov in e-poštne vzdevke tako, da pojdete "
"na stran :menuselection:`PLM aplikacija --> Konfiguracija --> ECO tipi`. Tam "
"kliknite na želeni |ECO| tip s seznama."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:65
msgid ""
"On the form for each |ECO| type, edit the :guilabel:`Name` "
"or :guilabel:`Email Alias` fields."
msgstr ""
"Na obrazcu za vsak |ECO| tip uredite polji :guilabel:`Ime` ali :guilabel:`E-"
"poštni vzdevek`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:70
msgid "Stages"
msgstr "Stopnje"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:72
msgid ""
"Within the *Engineering Change Orders* Kanban view for a specific |ECO| "
"type, *stages* are milestones used to identify the progress of the |ECO| "
"before the changes are ready to be applied. The default |ECO| types use the "
"`New`, `In Progress`, `Validated`, and `Effective` stages. New |ECO| types "
"do not contain any stages by default. In all cases, stages are fully "
"customizable to the specific life cycle of an |ECO| type."
msgstr ""
"Znotraj Kanban pogleda *Engineering Change Orders* za določeno vrsto |ECO| "
"so *faze* mejniki, ki se uporabljajo za spremljanje napredka |ECO|, preden "
"so spremembe pripravljene za uporabo. Privzete vrste |ECO| uporabljajo faze "
"`New`, `In Progress`, `Validated` in `Effective`. Nove vrste |ECO| privzeto "
"ne vsebujejo nobene faze. V vseh primerih so faze popolnoma prilagodljive "
"specifičnemu življenjskemu ciklu vrste |ECO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:78
msgid "Default stages for an ECO type."
msgstr "Privzete faze za tip ECO."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:82
msgid ""
"The `Effective` stage is folded by default to avoid listing every single |"
"ECO| that has gone into effect. See :ref:`Closing stage <plm/eco/closing-"
"stage>` for more on this configuration."
msgstr ""
"Faza `Effective` je privzeto zložena, da se izognemo seznamu vsakega "
"posameznega |ECO|, ki je začel veljati. Za več o tej konfiguraciji "
"glejte :ref:`Zaključna faza <plm/eco/closing-stage>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:85
msgid ""
":ref:`Verification stages <plm/eco/verification-stage>` require a designated "
"user to approve, ensuring that changes do not proceed until the |ECO| "
"changes have been reviewed by the appropriate stake holders. :ref:`Closing "
"stages<plm/eco/closing-stage>` that can apply changes put |BOM| and "
"operations changes into immediate effect, changing all pending and "
"future :abbr:`MO (Manufacturing orders)` to the latest |BOM| version."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Preveritvene faze <plm/eco/verification-stage>` zahtevajo določenega "
"uporabnika za odobritev, kar zagotavlja, da spremembe ne napredujejo, dokler "
"spremembe |ECO| ne pregledate ustrezne zainteresirane "
"strani. :ref:`Zaključne faze<plm/eco/closing-stage>`, ki lahko uporabijo "
"spremembe, spremembe |BOM| in operacij takoj uveljavijo, s čimer spremenijo "
"vse čakajoče in prihodnje :abbr:`proizvodne naloge` v najnovejšo različico |"
"BOM|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:92
msgid ""
"The most common practice is to have at least one *verification* stage, which "
"is a stage with a required approver, and one *closing* stage, which stores |"
"ECOs| that have been either cancelled or approved for use as the next "
"production |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"Najpogostejša praksa je imeti vsaj eno *preveritveno* fazo, ki je faza z "
"zahtevano odobritvijo, in eno *zaključno* fazo, ki shranjuje |ECOs|, ki so "
"bili bodisi preklicani bodisi odobreni za uporabo kot naslednji proizvodni |"
"BOM|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:97
msgid ":doc:`Approvals<../management/approvals>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Odobritve<../management/approvals>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:102
msgid "Verification stages"
msgstr "Preveritvene faze"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:104
msgid ""
"To configure a verification stage, hover over the intended stage, and select "
"the :icon:`fa-gear` :guilabel:`(Actions)`. Then, click :guilabel:`Edit` to "
"open a pop-up window and select the :guilabel:`Allow to apply changes` "
"checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Za konfiguracijo stopnje preverjanja premaknite kazalec miške nad želeno "
"stopnjo in izberite :icon:`fa-gear` :guilabel:`(Dejanja)`. Nato kliknite "
":guilabel:`Uredi`, da odprete pojavno okno, in potrdite potrditveno polje "
":guilabel:`Dovoli uveljavitev sprememb` checkbox."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:108
msgid ""
"Next, add an approver in the :guilabel:`Approvals` section by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Add a line`, and specifying the :guilabel:`Role` of the "
"reviewer, the :guilabel:`User`, and an :ref:`Approval Type <plm/approvals/"
"approval-type>` of :guilabel:`Is required to approve`."
msgstr ""
"Nato v razdelku :guilabel:`Odobritve` dodajte odobritelja s klikom na "
":guilabel:`Dodaj vrstico` in določitvijo :guilabel:`Vloga` pregledovalca, "
":guilabel:`Uporabnik` ter :ref:`Vrsta odobritve <plm/approvals/approval-type>"
"` z nastavitvijo :guilabel:`Zahtevano za odobritev`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:112
msgid ""
"The approver listed is automatically notified when |ECOs| are dropped in the "
"stage specified in the pop-up window. Once finished, click :guilabel:`Save & "
"Close`."
msgstr ""
"Navedeni odobritelj je samodejno obveščen, ko so |ECOs| spuščeni v fazo, "
"določeno v pojavnem oknu. Ko končate, kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani in zapri`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:116
msgid ":doc:`../management/approvals`"
msgstr ":doc:`../management/approvals`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:121
msgid "Closing stages"
msgstr "Faze zapiranja"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:123
msgid ""
"Click an |ECO| type from :menuselection:`PLM app --> Overview` to open the "
"Kanban view of |ECOs| of this type."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite vrsto |ECO| iz :menuselection:`PLM aplikacija --> Pregled`, da "
"odprete pogled Kanban za |ECOs| te vrste."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:126
msgid ""
"To configure a closing stage that applies |BOM|, edit the stage and select "
"the :guilabel:`Folded in kanban view`, :guilabel:`Allow to apply changes`, "
"and :guilabel:`Final Stage` checkboxes. When ECO cards are placed in a stage "
"that will *Allow to apply changes*, then any |BOM| and operations changes "
"validated in the |ECOs| will immediately be put into effect. To create a "
"cancelled stage, create or edit a stage and select the :guilabel:`Folded in "
"kanban view` and :guilabel:`Final Stage` checkboxes. |ECOs| in this stage "
"are removed from the pipeline, but will not make changes."
msgstr ""
"Za konfiguracijo zaključne stopnje, ki uporablja |BOM|, uredite stopnjo in "
"označite potrditvena polja :guilabel:`Zloženo v pogledu kanban`, "
":guilabel:`Dovoli uveljavitev sprememb` in :guilabel:`Zaključna stopnja`. Ko "
"so kartice ECO postavljene v stopnjo, ki *Dovoli uveljavitev sprememb*, bodo "
"vse |BOM| in spremembe operacij, potrjene v |ECOs|, takoj začele veljati. Če "
"želite ustvariti preklicano stopnjo, ustvarite ali uredite stopnjo in "
"označite potrditveni polji :guilabel:`Zloženo v pogledu kanban` in "
":guilabel:`Zaključna stopnja`. |ECOs| v tej stopnji so odstranjeni iz "
"procesa, vendar ne bodo povzročili sprememb."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:135
msgid ""
"The closing stage, `Effective` is configured by checking "
"the :guilabel:`Folded in kanban view`, :guilabel:`Allow to apply changes`, "
"and :guilabel:`Final Stage` options"
msgstr ""
"Faza zapiranja `Učinkovito` je konfigurirana z označevanjem "
"možnosti :guilabel:`Zloženo v pogledu Kanban`, :guilabel:`Dovoli uporabo "
"sprememb` in :guilabel:`Končna faza`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:138
msgid "Configuration of the closing stage."
msgstr "Konfiguracija faze zapiranja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:3
msgid "Engineering change orders"
msgstr "Nalogi sprememb"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:10
msgid ""
"Use *engineering change orders* (ECOs) to track, implement, and revert "
"change versions made to products and :doc:`bills of materials <../../"
"manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"Uporabite *inženirska sprememba naročila* (ECO) za sledenje, izvajanje in "
"razveljavitev različic sprememb, narejenih na izdelkih in :doc:`kosovnicah "
"<../../manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:13
msgid "Engineering change orders can be created in three ways:"
msgstr "Inženirska sprememba naročila se lahko ustvari na tri načine:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:15
msgid ""
"Directly in the :ref:`ECO type <plm/engineering_change_orders/create-eco>`."
msgstr ""
"Neposredno v :ref:`Vrsta ECO <plm/engineering_change_orders/create-eco>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:16
msgid ""
"Automatically during an :ref:`update instructions request in Shop Floor <plm/"
"engineering_change_orders/shop-floor>`"
msgstr ""
"Samodejno med :ref:`zahtevo za posodobitev navodil v delavnici <plm/"
"engineering_change_orders/shop-floor>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:18
msgid ""
"Automatically from feedback submitted to the :ref:`ECO type's email alias "
"<plm/eco_type/create-type>`."
msgstr ""
"Samodejno iz povratnih informacij, poslanih na :ref:`e-poštni vzdevek vrste "
"ECO <plm/eco_type/create-type>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:22
msgid "Create ECO"
msgstr "Ustvari ECO"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:24
msgid "Engineers and Shop Floor operators can suggest changes in two ways."
msgstr ""
"Inženirji in operaterji v proizvodnji lahko predlagajo spremembe na dva "
"načina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:29
msgid "Create ECO in PLM"
msgstr "Ustvarite ECO v PLM"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:31
msgid ""
"To create a new |ECO|, begin by navigating to the **PLM** app. Click "
"the :guilabel:`# Engineering Changes` button on the |ECO| type that should "
"be used to track the progress of the change. On the :guilabel:`Engineering "
"Change Orders` page, click the :guilabel:`New` button in the top-left corner."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje novega |ECO|, začnite z navigacijo v aplikacijo **PLM**. "
"Kliknite gumb :guilabel:`# Inženirske spremembe` na vrsti |ECO|, ki naj se "
"uporablja za sledenje napredku spremembe. Na strani :guilabel:`Naročila za "
"inženirske spremembe` kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Novo` v zgornjem levem kotu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:36
msgid ""
":doc:`ECO types <eco_type>` categorize and organize change orders. Doing so "
"can ensure that employees only view the |ECOs| related to their "
"responsibilities, whether it involves new product introductions, targeted "
"product line updates, or regulatory compliance fulfillment."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Vrste ECO <eco_type>` kategorizirajo in organizirajo naloge sprememb. "
"To lahko zagotovi, da zaposleni vidijo samo |ECOs|, povezane z njihovimi "
"odgovornostmi, ne glede na to, ali gre za uvajanje novih izdelkov, ciljne "
"posodobitve izdelčnih linij ali izpolnjevanje regulativne skladnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:40
msgid "On the |ECO| form, fill in the following fields accordingly:"
msgstr "Na obrazcu |ECO| izpolnite naslednja polja:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:42
msgid ":guilabel:`Description`: Enter a brief summary of the improvement."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Opis`: Vnesite kratek povzetek izboljšave."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:43
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ECO Type`: Specify the |ECO| type project for organizing the |"
"ECOs|. This field only displays when there are multiple |ECO|  types."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vrsta ECO`: Določite |ECO| projekt vrste za organizacijo |ECOs|. "
"To polje je prikazano le, če obstaja več |ECO|  tipov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:45
msgid ":guilabel:`Product`: Indicate the product being improved."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Izdelek`: Navedite izdelek, ki se izboljšuje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:46
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bill of Materials` (optional): Specify the changed |BOM|. This "
"field auto-populates if the product in the :guilabel:`Product` field has an "
"existing |BOM|. If multiple |BOMs| exist, select the intended |BOM| from the "
"drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kosovnica` (izbirno): Določite spremenjeno |BOM|. To polje se "
"samodejno izpolni, če ima izdelek v polju :guilabel:`Izdelek` obstoječo "
"|BOM|. Če obstaja več |BOMs|, v spustnem meniju izberite želeno |BOM|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:49
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: In multi-company databases, specify if the change "
"applies to products in a specific company, or leave blank if the change "
"applies to all companies."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Podjetje`: V bazah podatkov z več podjetji navedite, če se "
"sprememba nanaša na izdelke v določenem podjetju, ali pustite prazno, če se "
"sprememba nanaša na vsa podjetja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:53
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Company` field is only available when multiple companies are "
"enabled. See :doc:`../../../general/companies/multi_company`."
msgstr ""
"Polje :guilabel:`Podjetje` je na voljo samo, ko je omogočeno več podjetij. "
"Glejte :doc:`../../../general/companies/multi_company`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:56
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Responsible` (optional): Assign a user to be in charge of this |"
"ECO|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Odgovorna oseba` (izbirno): Dodelite uporabnika, ki bo zadolžen "
"za to |ECO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:57
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Effective Date`: Specify when the |ECO| becomes live. If nothing "
"is entered in this field, the |ECO| will go into effect :guilabel:`As soon "
"as possible`, or as soon as an authorized user :ref:`applies the changes "
"<plm/engineering_change_orders/apply-changes>`. Otherwise, specify a date "
"and time."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Datum začetka veljavnosti`: Navedite, kdaj |ECO| postane aktiven. "
"Če v to polje ni nič vneseno, bo |ECO| začel veljati :guilabel:`Čim prej` "
"oziroma takoj, ko pooblaščeni uporabnik :ref:`uporabi spremembe <plm/"
"engineering_change_orders/apply-changes>`. V nasprotnem primeru določite "
"datum in uro."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags` (optional): Assign tags to |ECOs| for prioritization and "
"organization. Create a new tag by typing the name in the field and "
"selecting :guilabel:`Create` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Oznake` (izbirno): Dodelite oznake |ECOs| za prednostno "
"razvrščanje in organizacijo. Novo oznako ustvarite tako, da vnesete ime v "
"polje in iz spustnega menija izberete :guilabel:`Ustvari`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:64
msgid ""
"After completing the |ECO| form, click the :guilabel:`Start Revision` button "
"to begin implementing the changes."
msgstr ""
"Po izpolnitvi obrazca |ECO| kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Začni revizijo` za "
"začetek izvajanja sprememb."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:67
msgid "When clicking :guilabel:`Start Revision`, three actions occur:"
msgstr "Ob kliku na :guilabel:`Začni revizijo` se zgodijo tri dejanja:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:69
msgid ""
"The :icon:`fa-file-text-o` :guilabel:`Documents` smart button appears, "
"storing the relevant files of the |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"Prikaže se pametni gumb :icon:`fa-file-text-o` :guilabel:`Dokumenti`, ki "
"hrani ustrezne datoteke |BOM|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:71
msgid ""
"A copy of the production |BOM| is stored in the :icon:`fa-"
"flask` :guilabel:`Revision` smart button of the |ECO|."
msgstr ""
"Kopija proizvodne |BOM| je shranjena v pametnem gumbu :icon:`fa-flask` "
":guilabel:`Revizija` za |ECO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:73
msgid ""
"The stages of the |ECO| :guilabel:`Type` are displayed at the top of the |"
"ECO|."
msgstr "Faze |ECO| :guilabel:`Vrsta` so prikazane na vrhu |ECO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:76
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Revision` smart button is available **only** when a |BOM| is "
"selected and the :guilabel:`Start Revision` button is clicked."
msgstr ""
"Pametni gumb :guilabel:`Revizija` je na voljo **samo**, ko je izbrana |BOM| "
"in kliknjen gumb :guilabel:`Začni revizijo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:79
msgid "Started ECO with smart buttons and stages."
msgstr "Začeti ECO s pametnimi gumbi in fazami."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:85
msgid "Create ECO in Shop Floor"
msgstr "Ustvarite ECO v delavnici"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:87
msgid ""
"|ECOs| can also be created from the *Shop Floor* module during the "
"manufacturing process."
msgstr ""
"|ECOs| lahko ustvarite tudi iz modula *Delavnica* med proizvodnim procesom."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:89
msgid ""
"Open the :menuselection:`Shop Floor` module. Open a work order from the "
"*Overview* or a work center view."
msgstr ""
"Odprite modul :menuselection:`Delavnica`. Odprite delovni nalog iz "
"*Pregleda* ali pogleda delovnega centra."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:92
msgid ""
"In the work order card, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical "
"ellipsis)` button in the bottom corner. The *Options* pop-up window opens."
msgstr ""
"Na kartici delovnega naloga kliknite gumb :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`"
"(navpična elipsa)` v spodnjem kotu. Odpre se pojavno okno *Možnosti*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:95
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-edit` :guilabel:`Update Instructions` button. Then, "
"select :guilabel:`Add/Modify Step`. Then, select one of the options from "
"this menu:"
msgstr ""
"Kliknite gumb :icon:`fa-edit` :guilabel:`Posodobi navodila`. Nato izberite "
":guilabel:`Dodaj/Spremeni korak`. Nato izberite eno od možnosti iz tega "
"menija:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:98
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Update Instructions`: Select a step to update its instructions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Posodobi navodila`: Izberite korak za posodobitev njegovih "
"navodil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:99
msgid ":guilabel:`Delete a Step`: Select a step to delete."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Izbriši korak`: Izberite korak za izbris."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:100
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add a Step`: To add a step, select the step that should come "
"before it."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dodaj korak`: Za dodajanje koraka izberite korak, ki mu mora "
"slediti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:102
msgid ""
"Complete the form for the suggestion, then click :guilabel:`Propose Change`. "
"An |ECO| is created for the suggested change."
msgstr ""
"Izpolnite obrazec za predlog, nato kliknite :guilabel:`Predlagaj spremembo`. "
"Ustvari se |ECO| za predlagano spremembo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:106
msgid ""
"An operator suggested adding a quality check step to the `Assembly` "
"operation for :abbr:`MO (Manufacturing Order)` `WH/MO/00001` (`Table`) to "
"verify the leg angles post-installation."
msgstr ""
"Operater je predlagal dodajanje koraka preverjanja kakovosti k operaciji "
"`Sestavljanje` za :abbr:`MO (delovni nalog)` `WH/MO/00001` (`Miza`) za "
"preverjanje kotov nog po namestitvi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:109
msgid ""
":ref:`Review proposed changes <plm/engineering_change_orders/view-eco>` in "
"the **PLM** app."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Preglej predlagane spremembe <plm/engineering_change_orders/view-eco>` "
"v aplikaciji **PLM**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:112
msgid "Change components"
msgstr "Spremeni komponente"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:114
msgid ""
"To modify the components in a |BOM|, click the :icon:`fa-"
"flask` :guilabel:`Revision` smart button on an |ECO| to access the new "
"version of the |BOM|. Odoo distinguishes the non-production version of the |"
"BOM| from the current version by flagging the test |BOM| with a "
"large :guilabel:`Archived` tag."
msgstr ""
"Za spremembo komponent v |BOM|, kliknite pametni gumb :icon:`fa-flask` "
":guilabel:`Revizija` na |ECO|, da dostopate do nove verzije |BOM|. Odoo loči "
"produkcijsko verzijo |BOM| od trenutne verzije tako, da testni |BOM| označi "
"z veliko oznako :guilabel:`Arhivirano`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:119
msgid ""
"After clicking the :guilabel:`Start Revision` button for an |ECO| for the "
"`Table` product, make changes to the product's |BOM| by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Revision` smart button. Doing so opens the archived |BOM|, "
"marked with a large red :guilabel:`Archived` flag."
msgstr ""
"Po kliku na gumb :guilabel:`Začni revizijo` za |ECO| za izdelek `Miza`, "
"spremenite izdelek |BOM| s klikom na pametni gumb :guilabel:`Revizija`. S "
"tem se odpre arhivirani |BOM|, označen z veliko rdečo zastavico "
":guilabel:`Arhivirano`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:123
msgid "Show the archived bill of materials."
msgstr "Prikaži arhivirano kosovnico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:126
msgid ""
"On the new |BOM|, in the *Components* tab, modify the components list by "
"changing the :guilabel:`Quantity` of existing components, adding new "
"components using the :guilabel:`Add a line` link, and removing components "
"with the :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(Delete row)` icon."
msgstr ""
"Na novi |BOM|, na zavihku *Komponente*, spremenite seznam komponent s "
"spreminjanjem :guilabel:`Količine` obstoječih komponent, dodajanjem novih "
"komponent s povezavo :guilabel:`Dodaj vrstico` in odstranjevanjem komponent "
"z ikono :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(Izbriši vrstico)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:133
msgid ""
"In version two of the |BOM| for a table, the table top component is changed "
"to a `Fancy Table Top`, the `Bolt` components are removed, and 10 `Wood "
"Plug` components are added."
msgstr ""
"V drugi verziji |BOM| za mizo se komponenta mizne plošče spremeni v `Okrasna "
"mizna plošča`, komponente `Vijak` se odstranijo in doda se 10 komponent "
"`Leseni čep`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:136
msgid "A revised BOM for a table."
msgstr "Revidirana kosovnica za mizo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:140
msgid "Change operations"
msgstr "Spremeni operacije"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:142
msgid ""
"To modify the operations in a |BOM|, click the :icon:`fa-"
"flask` :guilabel:`Revision` smart button on an |ECO| to access the archived, "
"new version of the |BOM|. Odoo distinguishes the non-production version of "
"the |BOM| from the current version by flagging the test |BOM| with a "
"large :guilabel:`Archived` tag."
msgstr ""
"Za spremembo operacij v |BOM|, kliknite pametni gumb :icon:`fa-flask` "
":guilabel:`Revizija` na |ECO|, da dostopate do arhivirane, nove verzije "
"|BOM|. Odoo loči produkcijsko verzijo |BOM| od trenutne verzije tako, da "
"testni |BOM| označi z veliko oznako :guilabel:`Arhivirano`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:147
msgid ""
"In the new |BOM| version, open the *Operations* tab to view and edit |BOM| "
"operations. To make changes, select each operation, which opens an *Open: "
"Operations* pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"V novi verziji |BOM| odprite zavihek *Operacije* za ogled in urejanje |BOM| "
"operacij. Za spremembe izberite vsako operacijo, kar odpre pojavno okno "
"*Odprto: Operacije*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:151
msgid ""
"The *Operations* tab is **not** available by default. To enable it, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> Settings`, and "
"select the :guilabel:`Work Orders` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Zavihek *Operacije* privzeto **ni** na voljo. Za omogočanje pojdite na "
":menuselection:`Aplikacija Proizvodnja --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve` in "
"izberite potrditveno polje :guilabel:`Delovni nalogi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:155
msgid ""
"Modify any of the fields in the *Open: Operations* pop-up window. Create new "
"operations by clicking the :guilabel:`Add a line` button. Remove operations "
"by clicking the :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(Delete row)` icon."
msgstr ""
"Spremenite katero koli polje v pojavnem oknu *Odprto: Operacije*. Ustvarite "
"nove operacije s klikom na gumb :guilabel:`Dodaj vrstico`. Odstranite "
"operacije s klikom na ikono :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(Izbriši vrstico)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:159
msgid "When changes are complete, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "Ko so spremembe končane, kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:162
msgid "Compare changes and costs"
msgstr "Primerjajte spremembe in stroške"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:164
msgid ""
"Changes and tests are encapsulated in the revised |BOM|, and do **not** "
"affect the |BOM| currently used in production until the :ref:`changes are "
"applied <plm/engineering_change_orders/apply-changes>`."
msgstr ""
"Spremembe in testi so zajeti v revidirani |BOM| in **ne** vplivajo na |BOM|, "
"ki se trenutno uporablja v proizvodnji, dokler :ref:`spremembe niso "
"uveljavljene <plm/engineering_change_orders/apply-changes>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:168
msgid ""
"To compare a revised |BOM| to the previous version, navigate to the |ECO| "
"for that |BOM| in either of these ways:"
msgstr ""
"Če želite primerjati revidiran |BOM| s prejšnjo različico, se po enem od "
"naslednjih načinov pomaknite na |ECO| za ta |BOM|:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:171
msgid ""
"From the revised |BOM|, click the |ECO| name (for example, `ECO0005: "
"Improve...`) in the breadcrumbs located in the top-left corner. Then, click "
"the :icon:`fa-exchange` :guilabel:`Review` smart button. This smart button "
"only appears after changes are made to the |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"Iz revidirane |BOM| kliknite ime |ECO| (na primer `ECO0005: Izboljšaj...`) v "
"drobtinicah v zgornjem levem kotu. Nato kliknite pametni gumb :icon:`fa-"
"exchange` :guilabel:`Pregled`. Ta pametni gumb se prikaže šele, ko so "
"opravljene spremembe na |BOM|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:175
msgid ""
"From the :guilabel:`PLM Overview`, click the :guilabel:`# Engineering "
"Changes` button on the :guilabel:`Product Revision` Kanban card. Click the "
"Kanban card for the appropriate |ECO| to open it, then click the :icon:`fa-"
"exchange` :guilabel:`Review` smart button at the top of the |ECO| form."
msgstr ""
"V :guilabel:`Pregled PLM` kliknite gumb :guilabel:`# Inženirske spremembe` "
"na kartici Kanban :guilabel:`Revizija izdelka`. Kliknite kartico Kanban za "
"ustrezno |ECO|, da jo odprete, nato pa kliknite pametni gumb :icon:`fa-"
"exchange` :guilabel:`Pregled` na vrhu obrazca |ECO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:180
msgid ""
"Clicking the :icon:`fa-exchange` :guilabel:`Review` smart button on the |"
"ECO| form opens the *ECO Changes Summary* report. On this page, all changes "
"are displayed. The changes are color-coded:"
msgstr ""
"Klik na pametni gumb :icon:`fa-exchange` :guilabel:`Pregled` na obrazcu "
"|ECO| odpre poročilo *Povzetek sprememb ECO*. Na tej strani so prikazane vse "
"spremembe. Spremembe so barvno kodirane:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:183
msgid ""
"**Green** text indicates the component or operation was added to the |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"**Zeleno** besedilo označuje, da je bila komponenta ali operacija dodana v "
"|BOM|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:184
msgid ""
"**Red** text indicates the component or operation was removed from the |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"**Rdeče** besedilo označuje, da je bila komponenta ali operacija odstranjena "
"iz |BOM|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:185
msgid "**Blue** text indicates that the component or operation was modified."
msgstr ""
"**Modro** besedilo označuje, da je bila komponenta ali operacija spremenjena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:187
msgid ""
"The change type (:guilabel:`Add`, :guilabel:`Remove`, or :guilabel:`Update`) "
"appears next to the change."
msgstr ""
"Vrsta spremembe (:guilabel:`Dodaj`, :guilabel:`Odstrani` ali "
":guilabel:`Posodobi`) se prikaže poleg spremembe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:190
msgid ""
"This report also lists the costs associated with changes to the |BOM|. Costs "
"are pulled from the :guilabel:`Cost` field on the product form and "
"the :guilabel:`Costing Information` on the work center form. Costs are "
"listed in the :guilabel:`BoM Cost` field for each change."
msgstr ""
"To poročilo navaja tudi stroške, povezane s spremembami v |BOM|. Stroški se "
"črpajo iz polja :guilabel:`Strošek` na obrazcu izdelka in iz "
":guilabel:`Podatki o stroških` na obrazcu delovne postaje. Stroški so za "
"vsako spremembo navedeni v polju :guilabel:`Strošek BOM`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:194
msgid "The list of component changes appears first in the report:"
msgstr "Seznam sprememb komponent se najprej prikaže v poročilu:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:196
msgid ":guilabel:`Components`: Lists the name of the component."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Komponente`: Navaja ime komponente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:197
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description`: Displays a description of the product if one is "
"included on the product form."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Opis`: Prikaže opis izdelka, če je ta vključen na obrazcu izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:199
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Quantity`: Displays the quantity and unit of measure being "
"changed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Količina`: Prikaže količino in mersko enoto, ki se spreminja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:201
msgid ""
"The list of :guilabel:`Operations` changes appears after the component "
"changes. The name of the operation is listed for every operation change. If "
"instructions are updated as part of the change, its name and type is "
"included on its own line. The :guilabel:`Duration` change is also listed."
msgstr ""
"Seznam sprememb :guilabel:`Operacij` se prikaže za spremembami komponent. "
"Ime operacije je navedeno za vsako spremembo operacije. Če so navodila "
"posodobljena kot del spremembe, sta njeno ime in vrsta vključena v svoji "
"vrstici. Prav tako je navedena sprememba :guilabel:`Trajanja`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:205
msgid ""
"Finally, the total cost change appears at the bottom of the report. If total "
"cost change is less than the previous |BOM|, the cost change appears in "
"**green**. If the total cost change is more than the previous |BOM|, the "
"cost change appears in **red**."
msgstr ""
"Na koncu se na dnu poročila prikaže skupna sprememba stroškov. Če je skupna "
"sprememba stroškov manjša od prejšnje |BOM|, se sprememba stroškov prikaže "
"**zeleno**. Če je skupna sprememba stroškov večja od prejšnje |BOM|, se "
"sprememba stroškov prikaže **rdeče**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:210
msgid ""
"View the summary of the differences between the current and revised table |"
"BOMs| in the *ECO Changes Summary* report of the |ECO|."
msgstr ""
"Oglejte si povzetek razlik med trenutno in revidirano tabelo |BOMs| v "
"poročilu *Povzetek sprememb ECO* za |ECO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:213
msgid "View summary of component changes in the ECO Changes Summary report."
msgstr ""
"Oglejte si povzetek sprememb komponent v poročilu Povzetek sprememb ECO."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:216
msgid ""
"To compare |BOMs| based on the quantity of their components, click "
"the :icon:`fa-columns` :guilabel:`Compare BoMs` smart button on the |ECO| "
"form. The *BoM Lines* page opens, displaying a pivot table shows the "
"differences between the |BOMs|."
msgstr ""
"Za primerjavo |BOMs| glede na količino njihovih komponent kliknite pametni "
"gumb :icon:`fa-columns` :guilabel:`Primerjaj kosovnice` na obrazcu |ECO|. "
"Odpre se stran *Vrstice kosovnice* in prikaže se vrtilna tabela, ki "
"prikazuje razlike med |BOMs|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:220
msgid "View the differences between bills of materials in a pivot table."
msgstr "Oglejte si razlike med kosovnicami v vrtilni tabeli."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:226
msgid "Apply changes"
msgstr "Uporabi spremembe"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:228
msgid ""
"After verifying the changes, move the |ECO| to a :ref:`verification stage "
"<plm/eco_type/stage-config>`, which are stages that require approval before "
"the revised changes can be applied to the production |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"Po preverjanju sprememb premaknite |ECO| v :ref:`fazo preverjanja <plm/"
"eco_type/stage-config>`, to so faze, ki zahtevajo odobritev, preden se lahko "
"revidirane spremembe uporabijo za proizvodni |BOM|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:232
msgid "Approvers can :guilabel:`Approve` or :guilabel:`Reject` the changes."
msgstr ""
"Odobritelji lahko :guilabel:`Odobrijo` ali :guilabel:`Zavrnejo` spremembe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:234
msgid ""
"When the |ECO| is in a :ref:`closing stage <plm/eco/closing-stage>`, after "
"the approvers approve the changes, the :guilabel:`Apply Changes` button is "
"available."
msgstr ""
"Ko je |ECO| v :ref:`zaključni stopnji <plm/eco/closing-stage>`, je po tem, "
"ko odobritelji potrdijo spremembe, na voljo gumb :guilabel:`Uveljavi "
"spremembe`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:238
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Apply Changes` button may be in a different stage than the "
"approval stage."
msgstr ""
"Gumb :guilabel:`Uporabi spremembe` je lahko v drugi fazi kot faza odobritve."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:240
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Apply Changes` to automatically move the |ECO| to an "
"effective stage. The *Update Versions* pop-up window opens."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Uveljavi spremembe`, da samodejno premaknete |ECO| v "
"učinkovito stopnjo. Odpre se pojavno okno *Posodobi različice*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:243
msgid ""
"In this window, specify whether to increment the versions of the selected "
"checkboxes. The product version (found in the *Inventory* tab of the product "
"form) and the |BOM| version can be updated. Click :guilabel:`Apply` to "
"increment the selected checkboxes. Click :guilabel:`Discard` to avoid "
"updating the version and applying changes."
msgstr ""
"V tem oknu določite, ali želite povečati različice izbranih potrditvenih "
"polj. Različico izdelka (najdete jo na zavihku *Inventar* v obrazcu izdelka) "
"in različico |BOM| je mogoče posodobiti. Kliknite :guilabel:`Uporabi`, da "
"povečate izbrana potrditvena polja. Kliknite :guilabel:`Zavrzi`, da se "
"izognete posodabljanju različice in uveljavljanju sprememb."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:249
msgid ""
"To avoid incrementing any version, deselect all checkboxes, then "
"click :guilabel:`Apply`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite preprečiti povečanje katere koli različice, počistite vsa "
"potrditvena polja in nato kliknite :guilabel:`Uporabi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:251
msgid "Update the versions for the bill of materials, then click Apply."
msgstr "Posodobite različice za kosovnico in nato kliknite Uporabi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:254
msgid ""
"The changes are applied, which archives the original production |BOM|, and "
"the revised |BOM| becomes the new production |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"Spremembe se uveljavijo, kar arhivira izvirno proizvodno |BOM|, revidirana "
"|BOM| pa postane nova proizvodna |BOM|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:258
msgid "Verify changes"
msgstr "Preveri spremembe"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:260
msgid ""
"To ensure the changes are live, from the |ECO| where the :guilabel:`Apply "
"Changes` button was pressed, return to the revised |BOM| by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Revision` smart button."
msgstr ""
"Če želite preveriti, ali so spremembe aktivne, se iz |ECO|, kjer je bil "
"pritisnjen gumb :guilabel:`Uporabi spremembe`, vrnite na revidirani |BOM| s "
"klikom na pametni gumb :guilabel:`Revizija`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:263
msgid ""
"On the revised |BOM|, the large red :guilabel:`Archived` flag is removed. If "
"the |BOM| version was incremented as a result of this |ECO|, it will be "
"incremented in the *Miscellaneous* tab."
msgstr ""
"Na revidirani |BOM| se odstrani velika rdeča zastavica "
":guilabel:`Arhivirano`. Če je bila različica |BOM| povečana kot rezultat "
"tega |ECO|, bo povečana na zavihku *Razno*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:267
msgid ""
"After applying the changes of the |ECO| for the :ref:`table <plm/"
"engineering_change_orders/example>`, view the version of the current table |"
"BOM| in the *Miscellaneous* tab. Here, the :guilabel:`Version` number has "
"been updated to `2`."
msgstr ""
"Po uporabi sprememb |ECO| za :ref:`tabelo <plm/engineering_change_orders/"
"example>`, si oglejte različico trenutne tabele |BOM| na zavihku *Razno*. "
"Tukaj je bila številka :guilabel:`Različica` posodobljena na `2`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:271
msgid "View current BOM version in the Miscellaneous tab."
msgstr "Oglejte si trenutno različico kosovnice v zavihku Razno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:277
msgid "View changes"
msgstr "Ogled sprememb"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:279
msgid ""
"To review proposed changes, navigate to the :menuselection:`PLM app --> "
"Overview`. In the |ECO| type card, the :guilabel:`# Engineering Changes` "
"button represents the number of operational changes created."
msgstr ""
"Za pregled predlaganih sprememb se pomaknite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"PLM --> Pregled`. Na kartici vrste |ECO| gumb :guilabel:`# Inženirske "
"spremembe` predstavlja število ustvarjenih operativnih sprememb."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:283
msgid ""
"Click on the :guilabel:`# Engineering Changes` button to open the Kanban "
"view of the |ECO| type. To view the suggestion, select an |ECO| that has "
"been started (the :guilabel:`Start Revision` button has been clicked)."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite gumb :guilabel:`# Inženirske spremembe`, da odprete pogled Kanban "
"za vrsto |ECO|. Za ogled predloga izberite |ECO|, ki se je začel (gumb "
":guilabel:`Začni revizijo` je bil kliknjen)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:287
msgid "On the |ECO|, view a summary of the proposed changes in two ways:"
msgstr "Na |ECO| si oglejte povzetek predlaganih sprememb na dva načina:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:289
msgid "From the :icon:`fa-flask` :guilabel:`Revision` smart button"
msgstr ""
"Iz pametnega gumba :icon:`fa-flask` :guilabel:`Revizija` pametnega gumba"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:290
msgid "From the :icon:`fa-exchange` :guilabel:`Review` smart button"
msgstr ""
"Iz pametnega gumba :icon:`fa-exchange` :guilabel:`Pregled` pametnega gumba"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:293
msgid ""
"An operator suggested verifying the angle of the table legs after they had "
"been installed by adding a step while performing the `Assembly` operation "
"for the :abbr:`MO (Manufacturing Order)` `WH/MO/00001` for the product, "
"`Table`."
msgstr ""
"Operater je predlagal preverjanje kota nog mize po tem, ko so bile "
"nameščene, z dodajanjem koraka med izvajanjem operacije `Sestavljanje` za "
":abbr:`PN (Proizvodni nalog)` `WH/MO/00001` za izdelek, `Miza`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:297
msgid ""
"Then, this created |ECO| can be viewed by navigating to the `Product "
"Revision` ECO type found in :menuselection:`PLM app --> Overview`."
msgstr ""
"Nato si lahko to ustvarjeno |ECO| ogledate s krmarjenjem do vrste ECO "
"`Product Revision`, ki jo najdete v :menuselection:`PLM aplikacija --> "
"Pregled`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:300
msgid "Find the new ECO in the \"BOM Changes\" ECO type, in the New stage."
msgstr "Poiščite novi ECO v tipu ECO \"Spremembe kosovnice\" v fazi \"Novo\"."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:303
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Responsible` field is assigned to the operator who made the "
"suggestion, allowing the employee revising the |BOM| to seek further "
"clarification from the person who proposed the changes."
msgstr ""
"Polje :guilabel:`Odgovoren` je dodeljeno operaterju, ki je podal predlog, "
"kar zaposlenemu, ki revidira |BOM|, omogoča, da zaprosi za dodatna pojasnila "
"od osebe, ki je predlagala spremembe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:307
msgid ""
"On the revised |BOM|, switch to the *Operations* tab and select the "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"Na revidiranem |BOM| preklopite na zavihek *Operacije* in izberite operacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:310
msgid ""
"Continuing the previous example, after the responsible engineer opens the "
"*Operations* tab, a list of *Instructions* to perform the operation "
"displays. The newest instruction is titled `New Step Suggestion:`, followed "
"by the user-entered title. Click the line item to view the suggested changes."
msgstr ""
"Če nadaljujemo s prejšnjim primerom, se po tem, ko odgovorni inženir odpre "
"zavihek *Operacije*, prikaže seznam *Navodil* za izvedbo operacije. "
"Najnovejše navodilo ima naslov `New Step Suggestion:`, ki mu sledi naslov, "
"ki ga je vnesel uporabnik. Kliknite na postavko, da si ogledate predlagane "
"spremembe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:315
msgid "Open the operation from the list to view its instructions."
msgstr "Odprite operacijo s seznama, da si ogledate njena navodila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:3
msgid "Version control"
msgstr "Nadzor različic"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:10
msgid ""
"Use Odoo's *Product Lifecycle Management (PLM)* to manage previous versions "
"of bills of materials (BoMs). Store former assembly instructions, component "
"details, and past product design files while keeping the past details out of "
"the production |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"Uporabite Odoo *Upravljanje življenjskega cikla izdelka (PLM)* za "
"upravljanje prejšnjih različic kosovnic (BoM). Shranjujte nekdanja navodila "
"za sestavljanje, podrobnosti komponent in pretekle datoteke oblikovanja "
"izdelkov, medtem ko pretekle podrobnosti ostanejo izven proizvodnje |BOM|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:14
msgid ""
"Easily revert to previous |BOM| versions, when needed. Additionally, use "
"*PLM* to trace which |BOM| version was active on specific dates for recalls "
"or customer complaints."
msgstr ""
"Po potrebi se preprosto vrnite na prejšnje različice |BOM|. Poleg tega "
"uporabite *PLM* za sledenje, katera različica |BOM| je bila aktivna na "
"določene datume za umike ali pritožbe strank."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:17
msgid ""
"Every |BOM| version is stored in an *engineering change order* (ECO) for "
"organized testing and improvements without disrupting normal manufacturing "
"operations."
msgstr ""
"Vsaka različica |BOM| je shranjena v *inženirskem spremembenem nalogu* (ECO) "
"za organizirano testiranje in izboljšave brez motenja normalnih proizvodnih "
"operacij."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:21
msgid ":doc:`engineering_change_orders`"
msgstr ":doc:`engineering_change_orders`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:24
msgid "Current BoM version"
msgstr "Trenutna različica BoM"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:26
msgid ""
"To see the current version of the |BOM| used in production, go "
"to :menuselection:`PLM app --> Master Data --> Bill of Materials`, and "
"select the desired |BOM| from the list. Then, switch to "
"the :guilabel:`Miscellaneous` tab, where the currently "
"live :guilabel:`Version` of the |BOM| is displayed."
msgstr ""
"Za ogled trenutne različice |BOM|, uporabljene v proizvodnji, pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`aplikacija PLM --> Matični podatki --> Kosovnice` in "
"izberite želeno |BOM| s seznama. Nato preklopite na "
"zavihek :guilabel:`Razno`, kjer je prikazana trenutno "
"aktivna :guilabel:`Različica` |BOM|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:32
msgid ""
"|BOMs| can also be accessed from :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> "
"Products --> Bill of Materials`."
msgstr ""
"Do |BOMs| lahko dostopate tudi iz :menuselection:`aplikacija Proizvodnja --> "
"Izdelki --> Kosovnice`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:35
msgid "Show the current version BOM in the Misc tab."
msgstr "Prikažite trenutno različico BOM na zavihku Razno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:40
msgid "Version history"
msgstr "Zgodovina različic"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:42
msgid ""
"To manage all former, current, and future versions of a |BOM|, begin by "
"navigating to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Products --> Bills of "
"Materials` and click the desired |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"Za upravljanje vseh prejšnjih, trenutnih in prihodnjih različic |BOM| se "
"najprej pomaknite na :menuselection:`Proizvodnja --> Izdelki --> Kosovnice` "
"in kliknite želeno |BOM|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:45
msgid ""
"From the |BOM| page, click the :guilabel:`ECO` smart button, and switch to "
"list view by selecting the :guilabel:`≣ (four horizontal lines)` icon on the "
"top right corner."
msgstr ""
"Na strani |BOM| kliknite pametni gumb :guilabel:`ECO` in preklopite na "
"seznamski pogled tako, da izberete ikono :guilabel:`≡ (štiri vodoravne "
"črte)` v zgornjem desnem kotu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:49
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`ECO` smart button is visible on the |BOM| **only** if the "
"*PLM* app is installed."
msgstr ""
"Pametni gumb :guilabel:`ECO` je viden na |BOM| **samo**, če je nameščena "
"aplikacija *PLM*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:51
msgid "Show ECO smart button on a BoM."
msgstr "Prikaži pametni gumb ECO na kosovnici."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:55
msgid ""
"In the list of |ECOs| for the product, navigate to the search bar at the "
"top, and click the :guilabel:`▼ (down arrow)` icon on the right to access a "
"drop-down menu of :guilabel:`Filters`."
msgstr ""
"Na seznamu |ECOs| za izdelek se pomaknite na iskalno vrstico na vrhu in "
"kliknite ikono :guilabel:`▼ (puščica navzdol)` na desni, da odprete spustni "
"meni :guilabel:`Filtri`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:58
msgid ""
"Next, filter by :guilabel:`Done` |ECOs| to view: the revision history of the "
"|BOM|, the :guilabel:`Responsible` user who applied the change, and "
"the :guilabel:`Effective Date` of the |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"Nato filtrirajte po :guilabel:`Dokončano` |ECOs|, da si ogledate: zgodovino "
"revizij |BOM|, uporabnika :guilabel:`Odgovoren`, ki je izvedel spremembo, "
"in :guilabel:`Datum veljavnosti` |BOM|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:62
msgid ""
"Click each |ECO| to view the past components, operations, and design files "
"associated with the |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite vsak |ECO|, da si ogledate pretekle komponente, operacije in "
"oblikovalske datoteke, povezane z |BOM|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:65
msgid "Display ECO revision history for a BoM for a product."
msgstr "Prikaz zgodovine revizij ECO za kosovnico izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:70
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Effective Date` field is empty, the :guilabel:`Effective` "
"date of the |ECO| is automatically set to :guilabel:`As soon as possible` "
"and no dates are recorded in the revision history of the |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"Če je polje :guilabel:`Datum veljavnosti` prazno, je "
"datum :guilabel:`Veljavnost` |ECO| samodejno nastavljen na :guilabel:`Čim "
"prej` in v zgodovini revizij |BOM| niso zabeleženi nobeni datumi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:74
msgid "List of BOM effective dates."
msgstr "Seznam datumov veljavnosti kosovnic."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:79
msgid ""
"A workaround for checking when the |BOM| went live is by navigating to the "
"chatter, and hovering over the time the |ECO| was moved to the :ref:`closing "
"stage <plm/eco_type/stage-config>`."
msgstr ""
"Obvoz za preverjanje, kdaj je bil |BOM| objavljen, je navigacija do klepeta "
"(chatter) in pomik miške nad čas, ko je bil |ECO| premaknjen v "
":ref:`zaključno fazo <plm/eco_type/stage-config>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:83
msgid "Design files"
msgstr "Oblikovalske datoteke"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:85
msgid ""
"Attach computer-aided design (CAD) files, PDFs, images, or other design "
"material to the |BOM| itself."
msgstr ""
"Pripnite datoteke računalniško podprtega načrtovanja (CAD), PDF-je, slike "
"ali drug oblikovalski material na samo |BOM|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:88
msgid ""
"To do so, navigate to :menuselection:`PLM app --> Master Data --> Bill of "
"Materials`, and select the desired |BOM|. On the |BOM|, navigate to the "
"*chatter*, and click the :guilabel:`📎 (paperclip)` icon."
msgstr ""
"To storite tako, da se pomaknete na :menuselection:`PLM --> Glavni podatki --"
"> Kosovnice` in izberete želeno |BOM|. Na |BOM| se pomaknite na *klepet* in "
"kliknite ikono :guilabel:`📎 (sponka)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:92
msgid ""
"The files associated with the |BOM| are displayed in the :guilabel:`Files` "
"section. To add more design files, select the :guilabel:`Attach files` "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Datoteke, povezane z |BOM|, so prikazane v razdelku :guilabel:`Datoteke`. Za "
"dodajanje več oblikovalskih datotek izberite gumb :guilabel:`Pripni "
"datoteke`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:95
msgid "Show paperclip icon in the chatter to attach files to a BoM."
msgstr "Prikaži ikono sponke v klepetu za pripenjanje datotek na kosovnico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:100
msgid "Manage design files in an ECO"
msgstr "Upravljanje oblikovalskih datotek v ECO"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:102
msgid ""
"Add, modify, and remove files in an |ECO|. Once the |ECO| is approved and "
"applied, the new files are automatically linked to the production |BOM|. "
"Archived files are removed from the |BOM|, but are still accessible in the |"
"ECO|."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte, spremenite in odstranite datoteke v |ECO|. Ko je |ECO| odobreno in "
"uporabljeno, so nove datoteke samodejno povezane s proizvodno |BOM|. "
"Arhivirane datoteke so odstranjene iz |BOM|, vendar so še vedno dostopne v |"
"ECO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:106
msgid ""
"To manage the design files in the |ECO|, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`PLM app --> Changes` and choose the desired |ECO|. Next, "
"open the :guilabel:`Attachments` page by clicking the :guilabel:`Documents` "
"smart button."
msgstr ""
"Za upravljanje oblikovalskih datotek v |ECO| se najprej pomaknite "
"na :menuselection:`PLM --> Spremembe` in izberite želeni |ECO|. Nato odprite "
"stran :guilabel:`Priloge` s klikom na pametni gumb :guilabel:`Dokumenti`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:110
msgid ""
"Hover over each attachment to reveal the :guilabel:`︙ (three vertical "
"dots)` icon. From there, choose whether "
"to :guilabel:`Edit`, :guilabel:`Remove`, or :guilabel:`Download` the file. "
"Any changes made to these files are contained within the |ECO|, and will "
"only apply to the production |BOM| once the :ref:`changes are applied <plm/"
"engineering_change_orders/apply-changes>`."
msgstr ""
"Premaknite kazalec nad vsako prilogo, da se prikaže ikona :guilabel:`︙ (tri "
"navpične pike)`. Od tam izberite, ali želite datoteko :guilabel:`Uredi`, "
":guilabel:`Odstrani` ali :guilabel:`Prenesi`. Vse spremembe teh datotek so "
"vsebovane v |ECO| in bodo v produkciji |BOM| veljale šele, ko bodo "
":ref:`spremembe uveljavljene <plm/engineering_change_orders/apply-changes>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:116
msgid ""
"In the `Create 60% keyboard` |ECO|, the design files are from the original "
"`100% keyboard` |BOM|. To replace the keyboard PDF, begin by selecting "
"the :guilabel:`Documents` smart button."
msgstr ""
"V |ECO| `Ustvari 60% tipkovnico` so datoteke zasnove iz izvirnega |BOM| "
"`100% tipkovnica`. Za zamenjavo PDF-ja tipkovnice začnite z izbiro pametnega "
"gumba :guilabel:`Dokumenti`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:119
msgid "Show *Documents* smart button from an active ECO."
msgstr "Prikaz pametnega gumba *Dokumenti* iz aktivnega ECO."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:123
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Attachments` page, hover over the `100% keyboard "
"manual.pdf` design file, and click the :guilabel:`︙ (three vertical dots)` "
"icon. Then, click the :guilabel:`Remove` option to archive the file."
msgstr ""
"Na strani :guilabel:`Priloge` premaknite kazalec nad datoteko zasnove `100% "
"keyboard manual.pdf` in kliknite ikono :guilabel:`︙ (tri navpične pike)`. "
"Nato kliknite možnost :guilabel:`Odstrani`, da arhivirate datoteko."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:127
msgid ""
"Next, on the same :guilabel:`Attachments` page, click the :guilabel:`Upload` "
"button to upload the new design file, named `60% keyboard manual`."
msgstr ""
"Nato na isti strani :guilabel:`Priloge` kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Naloži`, da "
"naložite novo datoteko zasnove z imenom `60% keyboard manual`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:130
msgid ""
"View of *Attachments* page from the *Documents* smart button. Displays one "
"archived and\n"
"one newly added attachment."
msgstr ""
"Pogled strani *Priloge* iz pametnega gumba *Dokumenti*. Prikazuje eno "
"arhivirano in eno novo dodano prilogo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:136
msgid ""
"Archived files are **not** permanently deleted — they can still be accessed "
"in the previous |ECO|, or as an archived file in the latest |ECO|, where the "
"archival occurred."
msgstr ""
"Arhivirane datoteke **niso** trajno izbrisane — do njih lahko še vedno "
"dostopate v prejšnjem |ECO| ali kot arhivirana datoteka v najnovejšem |ECO|, "
"kjer je prišlo do arhiviranja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:140
msgid "Apply rebase"
msgstr "Uveljavi preosnovitev"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:142
msgid ""
"Odoo simplifies merge conflict resolution for concurrent |ECOs| on the same "
"product."
msgstr ""
"Odoo poenostavi reševanje konfliktov pri združevanju za sočasne |ECOs| "
"istega izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:144
msgid ""
"Conflicts can occur when the production |BOM| is updated while other |ECOs| "
"are modifying the previous version. Differences between the new and previous "
"production |BOMs| are displayed in the :guilabel:`Previous Eco Bom Changes` "
"tab, visible only in this scenario."
msgstr ""
"Konflikti se lahko pojavijo, ko je proizvodni |BOM| posodobljen, medtem ko "
"drugi |ECOs| spreminjajo prejšnjo različico. Razlike med novim in prejšnjim "
"proizvodnim |BOMs| so prikazane v zavihku :guilabel:`Prejšnje spremembe Eco "
"Bom`, ki je viden le v tem scenariju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:148
msgid ""
"To resolve conflicts and retain |ECO| changes, click the :guilabel:`Apply "
"Rebase` button."
msgstr ""
"Za reševanje konfliktov in ohranitev sprememb |ECO| kliknite "
"gumb :guilabel:`Uveljavi preosnovitev`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:151
msgid ""
"Two |ECOs|, `ECO0011` and `ECO0012`, are created when the current |BOM| "
"version is `5`. In `ECO0011`, a new component, `Space stabilizer`, is added, "
"and the changes are applied. This means the current |BOM| version has become "
"`6`."
msgstr ""
"Dva |ECOs|, `ECO0011` in `ECO0012`, sta ustvarjena, ko je trenutna različica "
"|BOM| `5`. V `ECO0011` je dodana nova komponenta `Space stabilizer` in "
"spremembe so uveljavljene. To pomeni, da je trenutna različica |BOM| postala "
"`6`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:155
msgid "Apply changes to an ECO to update the production BOM."
msgstr "Uveljavite spremembe v ECO za posodobitev proizvodnega BOM."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:159
msgid ""
"This means `ECO0012` is modifying an outdated |BOM|. As shown in "
"the :guilabel:`Previous Eco Bom Changes` tab, the |BOM| is missing the "
"`Space stabilizer`."
msgstr ""
"To pomeni, da `ECO0012` spreminja zastarel |BOM|. Kot je prikazano v "
"zavihku :guilabel:`Prejšnje spremembe Eco Bom`, v |BOM| manjka `Space "
"stabilizer`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:162
msgid ""
"To ensure the changes applied by `ECO0011` are kept when the changes occur "
"in `ECO0012`, click the :guilabel:`Apply Rebase` button to apply the "
"previous |ECO| changes, without affecting the changes already made to "
"`ECO0012`."
msgstr ""
"Za zagotovitev, da so spremembe, uveljavljene z `ECO0011`, ohranjene, ko "
"pride do sprememb v `ECO0012`, kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Uveljavi "
"preosnovitev`, da uveljavite prejšnje spremembe |ECO|, ne da bi to vplivalo "
"na spremembe, že narejene v `ECO0012`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:166
msgid ""
"Click the *Apply Rebase* button to update the BOM to match the production "
"BOM."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite gumb *Uveljavi preosnovitev*, da posodobite BOM tako, da se ujema s "
"proizvodnim BOM."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management.rst:3
msgid "Project management"
msgstr "Upravljanje projekta"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:3
msgid "Approvals"
msgstr "Odobritve"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:10
msgid ""
"Notify stakeholders and managers automatically by assigning approvers to "
"stages of :doc:`engineering change orders <../manage_changes/"
"engineering_change_orders>` (ECOs) under review. Changes can only be applied "
"after the assigned approver accepts them. Approvals ensure reviews by team "
"members, which prevents mistakes and premature actions."
msgstr ""
"Samodejno obvestite deležnike in upravitelje tako, da dodelite odobritelje "
"fazam :doc:`inženirskih sprememb <../manage_changes/"
"engineering_change_orders>` (ECO), ki so v pregledu. Spremembe se lahko "
"uveljavijo šele, ko jih dodeljeni odobritelj sprejme. Odobritve zagotavljajo "
"preglede s strani članov ekipe, kar preprečuje napake in prezgodnja dejanja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:16
msgid ":ref:`Stage configuration <plm/eco_type/stage-config>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Konfiguracija faze <plm/eco_type/stage-config>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:19
msgid "Add approvers"
msgstr "Dodajte odobrovalce"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:21
msgid ""
"To add an approver, first go to the :menuselection:`PLM app`, and click on "
"the project card of an |ECO| type to open the Gantt view of the |ECOs|."
msgstr ""
"Za dodajanje odobrovalca najprej pojdite v :menuselection:`aplikacijo PLM` "
"in kliknite kartico projekta tipa |ECO|, da odprete pogled Gantt |ECOs|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:24
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Engineering Change Orders` page, hover over the intended "
"stage, and select the :icon:`fa-gear` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Edit` to open a pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Na strani :guilabel:`Engineering Change Orders` se premaknite z miško na "
"želeno stopnjo in izberite ikono :icon:`fa-gear` :guilabel:`(Actions)`. Nato "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Edit`, da odprete pojavno okno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:28
msgid ""
"Approvers can be added to any stage, but they are most essential in the "
"*verification* stage, before the final *closing* stage which applies the |"
"ECO| and updates the :abbr:`BoM (Bill of Materials)`. This allows "
"stakeholders to control how and when changes are made."
msgstr ""
"Odobritelje je mogoče dodati kateri koli stopnji, vendar so najbolj pomembni "
"v stopnji *preverjanja*, pred končno stopnjo *zapiranja*, ki uporabi |ECO| "
"in posodobi :abbr:`BoM (Bill of Materials)`. To omogoča deležnikom nadzor "
"nad tem, kako in kdaj se spremembe izvajajo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:32
msgid ""
"See the documentation about :ref:`stage types <plm/eco_type/stage-config>` "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"Za več informacij si oglejte dokumentacijo o :ref:`vrstah stopenj <plm/eco/"
"stage-config>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:34
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Edit` stage pop-up window, click the :guilabel:`Add a "
"line` button, located under :guilabel:`Approvals`. Then, type in the "
"position or title of the approver under :guilabel:`Role` (e.g. `Engineering "
"Manager`, `Quality Team`, etc.), and select the relevant :guilabel:`User` "
"from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"V pojavnem oknu :guilabel:`Edit` za stopnjo kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Add a "
"line`, ki se nahaja pod :guilabel:`Approvals`. Nato vnesite položaj ali "
"naziv odobritelja pod :guilabel:`Role` (npr. `Engineering Manager`, `Quality "
"Team` itd.) in iz spustnega menija izberite ustreznega :guilabel:`User`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:42
msgid "Approval types"
msgstr "Vrste odobritev"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:44
msgid ""
"Next, set the :guilabel:`Approval Type` to :guilabel:`Is required to "
"approve`, :guilabel:`Approves, but the approval is optional`, "
"or :guilabel:`Comments only`."
msgstr ""
"Nato nastavite :guilabel:`Approval Type` na :guilabel:`Is required to "
"approve`, :guilabel:`Approves, but the approval is optional` "
"ali :guilabel:`Comments only`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:48
msgid ""
"Assign the `CTO`, \"Mitchell Admin,\" as a required approver for |ECOs| in "
"the `Validated` stage in the `New Product Introduction` |ECO| type."
msgstr ""
"Dodelite `CTO`, \"Mitchell Admin,\" kot zahtevanega odobritelja za |ECOs| v "
"stopnji `Validated` za vrsto |ECO| `New Product Introduction`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:51
msgid ""
"Approvals from the quality and marketing teams are **not** required to apply "
"changes to the |ECO| because their :guilabel:`Approval Type` is set "
"to :guilabel:`Approves, but the approval is optional` "
"and :guilabel:`Comments only`, respectively."
msgstr ""
"Odobritve ekip za kakovost in trženje **niso** potrebne za uporabo sprememb "
"v |ECO|, ker je njihova :guilabel:`Approval Type` nastavljena "
"na :guilabel:`Approves, but the approval is optional` "
"oziroma :guilabel:`Comments only`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:55
msgid ""
"Set an approver that \"Is required to approve\" ECOs in the \"Validated\" "
"stage."
msgstr ""
"Nastavite odobritelja, ki \"Is required to approve\" ECO v stopnji "
"\"Validated\"."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:59
msgid "Manage approvals"
msgstr "Upravljanje odobritev"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:61
msgid ""
"Approvers can track their to-do approvals by navigating to "
"the :menuselection:`PLM app`, and selecting the card for an |ECO| type, "
"which shows the count of open tasks assigned to them."
msgstr ""
"Odobritelji lahko spremljajo svoje odobritve, ki so na čakanju, tako da se "
"pomaknejo na :menuselection:`PLM app` in izberejo kartico za vrsto |ECO|, ki "
"prikazuje število odprtih nalog, dodeljenih njim."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:64
msgid ""
"Display count of validations to-do and buttons to open filtered list of ECOs."
msgstr ""
"Prikaz števila preverjanj za opraviti in gumbov za odpiranje filtriranega "
"seznama ECO."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:67
msgid "Here's what each button on an |ECO| project card does:"
msgstr "Tukaj je razlaga, kaj počne vsak gumb na projektni kartici |ECO|:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:69
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`# Engineering Changes` button displays a count of in-progress "
"|ECOs| of this ECO type. Clicking the button opens the Gantt view of "
"the :guilabel:`Engineering Change Orders` page."
msgstr ""
"Gumb :guilabel:`# Engineering Changes` prikazuje število tekočih |ECOs| te "
"vrste ECO. Klik na gumb odpre Ganttov pogled strani :guilabel:`Engineering "
"Change Orders`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:71
msgid ""
":guilabel:`My Validations` displays a count of |ECOs| the approver must "
"accept or reject. Clicking on this button displays |ECOs| pending approval "
"or rejected (marked with the red :guilabel:`Blocked` state)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`My Validations` prikazuje število |ECOs|, ki jih mora odobritelj "
"sprejeti ali zavrniti. Klik na ta gumb prikaže |ECOs|, ki čakajo na "
"odobritev ali so zavrnjeni (označeni z rdečim stanjem :guilabel:`Blocked`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:74
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`All Validations` button shows the count of |ECOs| awaiting "
"approval or rejected by any approver. Clicking it reveals these pending |"
"ECOs|."
msgstr ""
"Gumb :guilabel:`All Validations` prikazuje število |ECOs|, ki čakajo na "
"odobritev ali so jih zavrnili kateri koli odobritelji. Klik nanj razkrije te "
"čakajoče |ECOs|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:76
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Apply` displays a count of |ECOs| to which the user needs to "
"apply changes. Clicking on the button displays all the |ECOs| to approve, "
"and apply changes to, in the verification stage."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`To Apply` prikazuje število |ECOs|, za katere mora uporabnik "
"uporabiti spremembe. Klik na gumb prikaže vse |ECOs|, ki jih je treba "
"odobriti in uporabiti spremembe zanje v stopnji preverjanja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:80
msgid ""
"|ECOs| marked with the green :guilabel:`Done` stage have already been "
"approved, and the user needs to click on the |ECO| to enter the form view, "
"and click the :guilabel:`Apply Changes` button."
msgstr ""
"|ECOs|, označeni z zeleno stopnjo :guilabel:`Done`, so že odobreni in "
"uporabnik mora klikniti na |ECO|, da vstopi v obrazec, in klikniti "
"gumb :guilabel:`Apply Changes`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:84
msgid ""
"|ECO| approvals can be accessed, managed, and follow-up actions scheduled "
"through *Activities*. See the :doc:`Activities documentation <../../../"
"essentials/activities>` to learn more about integrating management workflows."
msgstr ""
"Odobritve |ECO| je mogoče dostopati, upravljati in načrtovati nadaljnje "
"ukrepe preko *Aktivnosti*. Za več informacij o integraciji delovnih procesov "
"upravljanja si oglejte :doc:`dokumentacijo o aktivnostih <../../../"
"essentials/activities>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:89
msgid "Approve ECOs"
msgstr "Odobritev ECO"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:91
msgid ""
"Navigate to an |ECO| in a verification stage, while logged in as the "
"assigned approver, to see the :guilabel:`Approve`, :guilabel:`Reject`, "
"and :guilabel:`Apply Changes` buttons."
msgstr ""
"Pomaknite se na |ECO| v fazi preverjanja, ko ste prijavljeni kot dodeljeni "
"odobritelj, da vidite gumbe :guilabel:`Odobri`, :guilabel:`Zavrni` "
"in :guilabel:`Uveljavi spremembe`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:94
msgid ""
"To approve the |ECO|, and apply the changes onto the production :abbr:`BoM "
"(Bill of Materials)`, click :guilabel:`Approve`, and then :guilabel:`Apply "
"Changes`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite odobriti |ECO| in uveljaviti spremembe na proizvodni :abbr:`BoM "
"(kosovnica)`, kliknite :guilabel:`Odobri` in nato :guilabel:`Uveljavi "
"spremembe`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:97
msgid ""
"Note that the :guilabel:`Apply Changes` button will **not** work unless "
"the :guilabel:`Approve` button was clicked first. Additionally, the chatter "
"logs the history of the clicked buttons."
msgstr ""
"Upoštevajte, da gumb :guilabel:`Uveljavi spremembe` **ne** bo deloval, če "
"gumb :guilabel:`Odobri` ni bil najprej kliknjen. Poleg tega pogovor beleži "
"zgodovino kliknjenih gumbov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:101
msgid ""
"If no approver has the :guilabel:`Is required to approve` approval type, "
"the :guilabel:`Apply Changes` button **will work** without requiring "
"the :guilabel:`Approve` button to be clicked first."
msgstr ""
"Če noben odobritelj nima vrste odobritve :guilabel:`Zahtevano za odobritev`, "
"bo gumb :guilabel:`Uveljavi spremembe` **deloval** brez zahteve, da je "
"gumb :guilabel:`Odobri` najprej kliknjen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase.rst:8
msgid "Purchase"
msgstr "Nabava"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase.rst:10
msgid ""
"**Odoo Purchase** helps keep track of purchase agreements, quotations, and "
"purchase orders. Learn how to monitor purchase tender, automate "
"replenishment, and follow up on your orders."
msgstr ""
"**Odoo Purchase** pomaga slediti nakupnim dogovorom, ponudbam in nakupnim "
"naročilom. Naučite se spremljati nakupne razpise, avtomatizirati "
"dopolnjevanje in spremljati svoja naročila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase.rst:14
msgid "`Odoo Tutorials: Purchase <https://www.odoo.com/slides/purchase-23>`_"
msgstr "`Odoo Tutorials: Purchase <https://www.odoo.com/slides/purchase-23>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced.rst:5
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Napredno"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Explains the Purchase Analysis report, which provides statistics about "
"products purchased through the Purchase app, and describes the measures, or "
"datasets, that can be displayed to examine key metrics about purchase orders."
msgstr ""
"Pojasnjuje poročilo Analiza nabave, ki ponuja statistične podatke o "
"izdelkih, kupljenih prek aplikacije Nabava, ter opisuje mere oziroma nize "
"podatkov, ki jih je mogoče prikazati za pregled ključnih kazalnikov o "
"nabavnih nalogih."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:8
msgid "Purchase Analysis report"
msgstr "Poročilo Analiza nabave"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:13
msgid ""
"The *Purchase Analysis* report provides statistics about products purchased "
"using Odoo's **Purchase** app. This data is useful for gaining a deeper "
"understanding of key metrics related to purchase orders (POs), including the "
"quantity of products ordered and received, the amount of time it takes to "
"receive purchased products, and more."
msgstr ""
"Poročilo *Analiza nabave* zagotavlja statistiko o izdelkih, kupljenih z "
"aplikacijo **Purchase** Odoo. Ti podatki so uporabni za globljo razumevanje "
"ključnih metrik, povezanih z nakupnimi naročili (NN), vključno s količino "
"naročenih in prejetih izdelkov, časom, potrebnim za prejem kupljenih "
"izdelkov, in več."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:18
msgid ""
"To open the Purchase Analysis report, navigate to :menuselection:`Purchase "
"app --> Reporting --> Purchase`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite odpreti poročilo Analiza nabave, pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Purchase app --> Reporting --> Purchase`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:22
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` report is one of many reports available "
"across the Odoo app suite. This documentation only covers the measures "
"specific to the :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` report, along with a few use "
"case examples."
msgstr ""
"Poročilo :guilabel:`Analiza nabave` je eno od številnih poročil, ki so na "
"voljo v paketu aplikacij Odoo. Ta dokumentacija zajema samo mere, specifične "
"za poročilo :guilabel:`Analiza nabave`, skupaj z nekaj primeri uporabe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:32
msgid ""
"*Measures* refer to the various datasets that can be displayed on "
"the :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` report, with each dataset representing a "
"key statistic about |POs| or products. To choose a measure, click "
"the :guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` button, and select one of the "
"options from the drop-down menu:"
msgstr ""
"*Mere* se nanašajo na različne nabore podatkov, ki so lahko prikazani na "
"poročilu :guilabel:`Analiza nabave`, pri čemer vsak nabor podatkov "
"predstavlja ključno statistiko o |POs| ali izdelkih. Če želite izbrati mero, "
"kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Mere` :icon:`fa-caret-down` in v spustnem meniju "
"izberite eno od možnosti:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`# of Lines`: The number of |PO| order lines, across all |POs|."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Št. vrstic`: Število vrstic |PO| naročil v vseh |POs|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:38
msgid ":guilabel:`Average Cost`: The average cost of |POs|."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Povprečni strošek`: Povprečni strošek |POs|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Days to Confirm`: The number of days it takes to confirm a |PO|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dni do potrditve`: Število dni, potrebnih za potrditev |PO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:40
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Days to Receive`: The number of days it takes to receive the "
"products in a |PO|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dni do prejema`: Število dni, potrebnih za prejem izdelkov v |PO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:41
msgid ":guilabel:`Gross Weight`: The total weight of purchased products."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Bruto teža`: Skupna teža kupljenih izdelkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:42
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Qty Billed`: The quantity of a product (or products) for which "
"the vendor has already been billed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kol. zaračunana`: Količina izdelka (ali izdelkov), za katero je "
"bil dobavitelj že zaračunan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Qty Ordered`: The quantity of a product (or products) ordered."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Kol. naročena`: Količina naročenega izdelka (ali izdelkov)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:45
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Qty Received`: The quantity of an ordered product (or products) "
"received."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kol. prejeta`: Količina prejetega naročenega izdelka (ali "
"izdelkov)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:46
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Qty to be Billed`: The quantity of an ordered product (or "
"products) for which the vendor has yet to be billed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kol. za zaračunati`: Količina naročenega izdelka (ali izdelkov), "
"za katero dobavitelj še ni bil zaračunan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:48
msgid ":guilabel:`Total`: The total amount spent, including tax."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Skupaj`: Skupni porabljeni znesek, vključno z davkom."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:49
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Untaxed Total`: The total amount spent, excluding tax. This "
"measure is selected by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Skupaj brez davka`: Skupni porabljeni znesek, brez davka. Ta mera "
"je privzeto izbrana."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:51
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Volume`: The total volume of ordered products, for products which "
"are measured by volume."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Volumen`: Skupni volumen naročenih izdelkov, za izdelke, ki se "
"merijo po volumnu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:53
msgid ":guilabel:`Count`: The total count of |POs|."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Število`: Skupno število |POs|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:64
msgid "Use case: determine days to receive products from each vendor"
msgstr ""
"Primer uporabe: določanje dni za prejem izdelkov od posameznih dobaviteljev"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:66
msgid ""
"One possible use case for the :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` report is "
"determining how long each vendor takes to deliver purchased items. This "
"allows companies to make better informed decisions about which vendors they "
"want to purchase from."
msgstr ""
"Eden od možnih primerov uporabe poročila :guilabel:`Analiza nabav` je "
"ugotavljanje, koliko časa potrebuje vsak dobavitelj za dostavo kupljenih "
"artiklov. To podjetjem omogoča sprejemanje bolje premišljenih odločitev o "
"tem, pri katerih dobaviteljih želijo kupovati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:71
msgid ""
"A local bike shop, *Bike Haus*, sells high-quality unicycles, bicycles, "
"tricycles, and all the accessories needed to ride and maintain them. They "
"purchase their inventory from a few different vendors, and then sell those "
"products on to customers through their storefront."
msgstr ""
"Lokalna trgovina s kolesi, *Bike Haus*, prodaja visokokakovostne enokolesa, "
"kolesa, trikolesa in vso dodatno opremo, potrebno za vožnjo in vzdrževanje. "
"Svoje zaloge kupujejo pri različnih dobaviteljih in nato te izdelke "
"prodajajo strankam v svoji trgovini."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:75
msgid ""
"Recently, Bike Haus has decided to have their purchasing manager, David, "
"look into how long it has taken each of their vendors to deliver the items "
"they've purchased during the current year."
msgstr ""
"Pred kratkim so se pri podjetju Bike Haus odločili, da bo njihov vodja "
"nabave David preučil, koliko časa je vsak od njihovih dobaviteljev "
"potreboval za dostavo artiklov, kupljenih v tekočem letu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:78
msgid ""
"David starts by navigating to :menuselection:`Purchase app --> Reporting --> "
"Purchase`, and selecting the :icon:`fa-bar-chart` (bar chart) graph type at "
"the top of the report."
msgstr ""
"David začne tako, da odpre :menuselection:`Aplikacija Nabava --> Poročanje --"
"> Nabava` in izbere vrsto grafa :icon:`fa-bar-chart` (stolpčni diagram) na "
"vrhu poročila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:81
msgid ""
"Next, he clicks the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(toggle)` button on the "
"right of the search bar to open its drop-down menu. In "
"the :guilabel:`Confirmation Date` filter section, he makes sure that "
"**only** the year filter is enabled. Then, he selects the :guilabel:`Vendor` "
"option in the :guilabel:`Group By` section, before clicking away from the "
"drop-down menu to close it."
msgstr ""
"Nato klikne gumb :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(preklop)` na desni strani "
"iskalne vrstice, da odpre njen spustni meni. V razdelku s filtrom "
":guilabel:`Datum potrditve` poskrbi, da je omogočen **samo** letni filter. "
"Nato v razdelku :guilabel:`Združi po` izbere možnost :guilabel:`Dobavitelj` "
"ter klikne zunaj spustnega menija, da ga zapre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:86
msgid ""
"Finally, David clicks on the :guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` drop-"
"down menu, and selects the :guilabel:`Days to Receive` option."
msgstr ""
"Končno David klikne na spustni meni :guilabel:`Mere` :icon:`fa-caret-down` "
"in izbere možnost :guilabel:`Dnevi do prejema`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:89
msgid ""
"With all of these options enabled, the :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` report "
"shows a bar chart, with one bar for each vendor, representing the average "
"number of days it takes to receive products purchased from the vendor."
msgstr ""
"Ko so vse te možnosti omogočene, poročilo :guilabel:`Analiza nabav` "
"prikazuje stolpčni diagram z enim stolpcem za vsakega dobavitelja, ki "
"predstavlja povprečno število dni, potrebnih za prejem izdelkov, kupljenih "
"pri dobavitelju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:93
msgid ""
"Using this data, David can see that it takes Bike Friends over 4.5 days, on "
"average, to deliver purchased products. This is more than four times the "
"amount of time it takes any other vendor."
msgstr ""
"S temi podatki lahko David vidi, da Bike Friends v povprečju potrebuje več "
"kot 4,5 dneva za dostavo kupljenih izdelkov. To je več kot štirikrat toliko "
"časa, kot ga potrebuje kateri koli drug dobavitelj."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:96
msgid ""
"Based on these findings, David makes the decision to reduce the quantity of "
"products purchased from Bike Friends."
msgstr ""
"Na podlagi teh ugotovitev David sprejme odločitev, da zmanjša količino "
"izdelkov, kupljenih pri Bike Friends."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:99
msgid ""
"The Purchase report, showing the average days to receive products from "
"vendors."
msgstr ""
"Poročilo o nabavi, ki prikazuje povprečne dneve za prejem izdelkov od "
"dobaviteljev."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:103
msgid "Use case: examine vendor POs for a specific time frame"
msgstr ""
"Primer uporabe: pregled dobaviteljevih nabavnih nalogov za določen časovni "
"okvir"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:105
msgid ""
"Another use for the :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` report is to examine key "
"statistics about |POs| for a specific vendor. By doing so, it is easy to "
"understand how many products have been purchased from a specific vendor in a "
"given time frame."
msgstr ""
"Druga možnost uporabe poročila :guilabel:`Analiza nabave` je pregled "
"ključnih statističnih podatkov o |POs| za določenega dobavitelja. Tako je "
"mogoče zlahka ugotoviti, koliko izdelkov je bilo kupljenih od določenega "
"dobavitelja v določenem časovnem obdobju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:110
msgid ""
"Following the :ref:`previous example <purchase/purchase-analysis-example>`, "
"it has been one month since Bike Haus decided to reduce the quantity of "
"products purchased from Bike Friends, one of their retailers. Bike Haus' "
"purchasing manager, David, wants to understand the impact this decision has "
"had on the amount of money they have spent on Bike Friends products."
msgstr ""
"Po :ref:`prejšnjem primeru <purchase/purchase-analysis-example>` je minilo "
"en mesec, odkar je Bike Haus odločil zmanjšati količino izdelkov, kupljenih "
"pri Bike Friends, enem od njihovih distributerjev. Vodja nabav v Bike Haus, "
"David, želi razumeti vpliv te odločitve na znesek denarja, ki so ga porabili "
"za izdelke Bike Friends."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:115
msgid ""
"David starts by navigating to :menuselection:`Purchase app --> Reporting --> "
"Purchase`. Then, he selects the :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(pivot "
"table)` option at the top of the screen."
msgstr ""
"David začne tako, da odpre :menuselection:`Aplikacija Nabava --> Poročanje --"
"> Nabava`. Nato izbere možnost :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(vrtilna "
"tabela)` na vrhu zaslona."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:118
msgid ""
"In the search bar, he types `Bike Friends`, and clicks :guilabel:`Enter`, so "
"the report only shows data for purchases from Bike Friends."
msgstr ""
"V iskalno polje vpiše `Bike Friends` in klikne :guilabel:`Enter`, tako da "
"poročilo prikazuje samo podatke za nabave pri Bike Friends."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:121
msgid ""
"Then, David clicks the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(toggle)` button on "
"the right of the search bar to open its drop-down menu. In "
"the :guilabel:`Confirmation Date` field, he selects *Year* and *Month*."
msgstr ""
"Nato David klikne gumb :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(preklop)` na desni "
"strani iskalne vrstice, da odpre njen spustni meni. V polju :guilabel:`Datum "
"potrditve` izbere *Leto* in *Mesec*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:125
msgid ""
"Next, David clicks on the :guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` drop-"
"down menu and leaves the :guilabel:`Total` and :guilabel:`Untaxed Total` "
"datasets enabled."
msgstr ""
"Nato David klikne spustni meni :guilabel:`Mere` :icon:`fa-caret-down` ter "
"pusti nabora podatkov :guilabel:`Skupaj` in :guilabel:`Znesek brez davka` "
"omogočena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:128
msgid ""
"Finally, David clicks the unexpanded :icon:`fa-plus-"
"square` :guilabel:`Total` button above the rows on the pivot table, and "
"selects the :guilabel:`Product` option."
msgstr ""
"Na koncu David nad vrsticami vrtilne tabele klikne nerazprti gumb :icon:`fa-"
"plus-square` :guilabel:`Skupaj` in izbere možnost :guilabel:`Izdelek`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:131
msgid ""
"With all of these options configured, the :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` "
"report shows a pivot table with purchase data for the current month."
msgstr ""
"Ob vseh teh konfiguriranih možnostih poročilo :guilabel:`Analiza nabave` "
"prikazuje vrtilno tabelo s podatki o nabavi za trenutni mesec."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:134
msgid ""
"The pivot table features a column for each product that meets the criteria. "
"These columns are further broken down into three smaller columns: the count "
"for each product sold, the untaxed total spent on the product, and the taxed "
"total spent on the product. There are also three columns at the end of the "
"table that show the grand totals for all products."
msgstr ""
"Vrtilna tabela vsebuje stolpec za vsak izdelek, ki ustreza merilom. Ti "
"stolpci so nadalje razdeljeni na tri manjše stolpce: število prodanih kosov "
"posameznega izdelka, neobdavčeni skupni znesek, porabljen za izdelek, ter "
"obdavčeni skupni znesek, porabljen za izdelek. Na koncu tabele so tudi trije "
"stolpci, ki prikazujejo skupne vsote za vse izdelke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:3
msgid "EDI purchase-to-sales order import"
msgstr "Uvoz prodajnega naloga iz nabavnega naloga prek EDI"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:9
msgid ""
"Electronic data interchange (EDI) enables companies using different software "
"systems to exchange information in a standardized, structured format."
msgstr ""
"Elektronska izmenjava podatkov (EDI) omogoča podjetjem, ki uporabljajo "
"različne programske sisteme, izmenjavo informacij v standardizirani, "
"strukturirani obliki."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:12
msgid ""
"In Odoo, a *purchase order* (PO) can be exported as an XML file and imported "
"as a *sales order* (SO) into another Odoo database, removing the need for "
"manual entry of products, quantities, prices, and other key information."
msgstr ""
"V Odoo je mogoče *nabavni nalog* (PO) izvoziti kot datoteko XML in uvoziti "
"kot *prodajni nalog* (SO) v drugo bazo podatkov Odoo, s čimer odpade potreba "
"po ročnem vnosu izdelkov, količin, cen in drugih ključnih informacij."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:16
msgid ""
"The workflow in this document describes how buyers and sellers exchange data "
"directly between their Odoo databases. As an alternative, sellers can "
"receive a PDF version of the request for quotation (RFQ) by email "
"and :ref:`upload it directly in their Sales dashboard <purchase/advanced/rfq-"
"upload>`. **This method is simpler** but does not use the XML-based exchange "
"described in the document."
msgstr ""
"Potek dela v tem dokumentu opisuje, kako kupci in prodajalci izmenjujejo "
"podatke neposredno med svojimi bazami podatkov Odoo. Kot alternativo lahko "
"prodajalci prejmejo različico povpraševanja za ponudbo (RFQ) v obliki PDF po "
"e-pošti in :ref:`jo naložijo neposredno na svojo nadzorno plošo prodaje "
"<purchase/advanced/rfq-upload>`. **Ta metoda je enostavnejša**, vendar ne "
"uporablja izmenjave na osnovi XML, opisane v dokumentu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:23
msgid ""
"Exported XMLs follow the `UBL schema <https://docs.peppol.eu/poacc/upgrade-3/"
"syntax/Order/tree/>`_. When exchanging data between two Odoo databases, this "
"schema remains compatible."
msgstr ""
"Izvoženi XML-ji sledijo `shemi UBL <https://docs.peppol.eu/poacc/upgrade-3/"
"syntax/Order/tree/>`_. Pri izmenjavi podatkov med dvema bazama podatkov Odoo "
"ta shema ostane združljiva."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:27
msgid ""
"However, implementing custom developments for software that does not support "
"the UBL schema may introduce additional complexity."
msgstr ""
"Vendar lahko implementacija razvoja po meri za programsko opremo, ki ne "
"podpira sheme UBL, povzroči dodatno kompleksnost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:31
msgid "Roles and configuration"
msgstr "Vloge in konfiguracija"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:33
msgid ""
"To facilitate the |EDI| workflow, two companies are involved: the buyer (the "
"company placing the order) and the seller (the company fulfilling the "
"order). Each company has specific roles and configurations."
msgstr ""
"Za olajšanje poteka dela |EDI| sta vključeni dve podjetji: kupec (podjetje, "
"ki odda naročilo) in prodajalec (podjetje, ki izpolni naročilo). Vsako "
"podjetje ima določene vloge in konfiguracije."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:38
msgid "Buyer database"
msgstr "Baza podatkov kupca"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:40
msgid ""
"The buyer database is responsible for creating and confirming purchase "
"orders. Prerequisites include:"
msgstr ""
"Baza podatkov kupca je odgovorna za ustvarjanje in potrjevanje nabavnih "
"nalogov. Predpogoji vključujejo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:43
msgid "(required) :ref:`installing <general/install>` the **Purchase** app"
msgstr ""
"(zahtevano) :ref:`namestitev <general/install>` aplikacije **Purchase**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:44
msgid ""
"(optional) adding vendors (the sellers in this workflow) as :doc:`portal "
"users <../../../general/users/user_portals>`."
msgstr ""
"(neobvezno) dodajanje prodajalcev (prodajalci v tem delovnem postopku) "
"kot :doc:`uporabniki portala <../../../general/users/user_portals>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:48
msgid "Seller database"
msgstr "Baza podatkov prodajalca"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:50
msgid ""
"The seller database is responsible for receiving and processing sales "
"orders. The only prerequisite is :ref:`installing <general/install>` the "
"**Sales** app."
msgstr ""
"Baza podatkov prodajalca je odgovorna za prejemanje in obdelavo prodajnih "
"nalogov. Edini predpogoj je :ref:`namestitev <general/install>` aplikacije "
"**Sales**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:57
msgid "Buyer's process"
msgstr "Postopek kupca"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:59
msgid ""
"To begin, the buyer (in their database) navigates to "
"the :menuselection:`Purchase` app to create a :abbr:`RFQ (request for "
"quotation)`."
msgstr ""
"Za začetek kupec (v svoji bazi podatkov) odpre "
"aplikacijo :menuselection:`Nabava`, da ustvari :abbr:`PP (povpraševanje po "
"ponudbi)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:62
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Vendor` to the portal user representing the seller, "
"and :guilabel:`Confirm` the :abbr:`RFQ (request for quotation)`. Doing so "
"converts it into a :doc:`purchase order <../manage_deals/rfq>`."
msgstr ""
"Nastavite :guilabel:`Dobavitelj` na uporabnika portala, ki predstavlja "
"prodajalca, in :guilabel:`Potrdite` :abbr:`PP (povpraševanje po ponudbi)`. S "
"tem se spremeni v :doc:`nabavni nalog <../manage_deals/rfq>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:67
msgid ""
"|PO| from the buyer's database. The :guilabel:`Vendor` is the seller's "
"portal user account, Joel."
msgstr ""
"|PO| iz baze podatkov kupca. :guilabel:`Dobavitelj` je uporabniški račun "
"portala prodajalca, Joel."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:69
msgid "Example PO. The Vendor is the seller's portal user account, Joel."
msgstr ""
"Primer nabavnega naloga. Dobavitelj je uporabniški račun portala prodajalca, "
"Joel."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:73
msgid "Seller's process"
msgstr "Postopek prodajalca"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:75
msgid ""
"Once the |PO| is confirmed, it appears on the seller's portal dashboard. The "
"seller downloads the XML file and uploads it to their database."
msgstr ""
"Ko je |PO| potrjen, se prikaže na nadzorni plošči portala prodajalca. "
"Prodajalec prenese datoteko XML in jo naloži v svojo bazo podatkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:79
msgid "Download file"
msgstr "Prenesi datoteko"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:81
msgid ""
"As the seller, log in to the buyer's database as the portal user. On the "
"dashboard, scroll down and click the :guilabel:`Our Orders` button. Doing so "
"reveals a list of purchase orders the buyer's database has addressed to the "
"portal user."
msgstr ""
"Kot prodajalec se prijavite v bazo podatkov kupca kot uporabnik portala. Na "
"nadzorni plošči se pomaknite navzdol in kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Naši "
"nalogi`. S tem se prikaže seznam nabavnih nalogov, ki jih je baza podatkov "
"kupca naslovila na uporabnika portala."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:85
msgid ""
"Select the desired purchase order, and the click :guilabel:`Connect with "
"your software!` button."
msgstr ""
"Izberite želeni nabavni nalog in nato kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Povežite se s "
"svojo programsko opremo!`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:87
msgid ""
"In the pop-up window, copy the provided URL, and paste it into a new browser "
"tab to download the XML file."
msgstr ""
"V pojavnem oknu kopirajte priloženi URL in ga prilepite v novo zavihek "
"brskalnika, da prenesete datoteko XML."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:91
msgid ""
"Joel's portal view of the PO. The first image displays "
"the :guilabel:`Connect with your software!` button, and the second image "
"displays a pop-up window with the :guilabel:`Copy` button."
msgstr ""
"Joelov pogled na nabavni nalog na portalu. Prva slika prikazuje "
"gumb :guilabel:`Povežite se s svojo programsko opremo!`, druga slika pa "
"prikazuje pojavno okno z gumbom :guilabel:`Kopiraj`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:95
msgid "Portal view of the PO, with \"Connect your software!\" button."
msgstr ""
"Pogled na nabavni nalog na portalu z gumbom \"Povežite svojo programsko "
"opremo!\"."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:98
msgid "Pop-up to copy link."
msgstr "Pojavno okno za kopiranje povezave."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:102
msgid ":download:`XML file <edi/P00017.xml>` for PO00017"
msgstr ":download:`Datoteka XML <edi/P00017.xml>` za PO00017"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:107
msgid "Upload file"
msgstr "Naloži datoteko"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:109
msgid ""
"Next, the seller logs in to their own Odoo database and "
"opens :menuselection:`Sales` app. Click :guilabel:`Upload` and select the "
"downloaded XML file. Alternatively, users can drag and drop the file into "
"the :guilabel:`Quotations` dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Nato se prodajalec prijavi v svojo bazo podatkov Odoo in odpre "
"aplikacijo :menuselection:`Prodaja`. Kliknite :guilabel:`Naloži` in izberite "
"preneseno datoteko XML. Uporabniki lahko tudi povlečejo in spustijo datoteko "
"na nadzorno ploščo :guilabel:`Ponudbe`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:113
msgid ""
"Doing so automatically generates a sales order with the customer populated "
"as the buyer and all product lines, quantities, and prices pre-filled. This "
"process ensures efficient and accurate data exchange between the two "
"databases."
msgstr ""
"S tem se samodejno ustvari prodajni nalog s kupcem, ki je vnesen kot kupec, "
"in vsemi vrsticami izdelkov, količinami in cenami, ki so vnaprej izpolnjene. "
"Ta postopek zagotavlja učinkovito in natančno izmenjavo podatkov med obema "
"bazama podatkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:117
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:120
msgid "Uploaded SO in the seller's database."
msgstr "Naloženi prodajni nalog v bazi podatkov prodajalca."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:3
msgid "Procurement expenses report"
msgstr "Poročilo o stroških oskrbe"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:12
msgid ""
"With the *Purchase* application, users can monitor procurement expenses over "
"time. This report helps companies track and analyze spending, identify cost-"
"saving opportunities, and ensure efficient budget management."
msgstr ""
"Z aplikacijo *Nabava* lahko uporabniki spremljajo stroške oskrbe skozi čas. "
"To poročilo podjetjem pomaga slediti in analizirati porabo, prepoznati "
"priložnosti za zmanjšanje stroškov ter zagotoviti učinkovito upravljanje "
"proračuna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:17
msgid "Create procurement expenses report"
msgstr "Ustvarite poročilo o stroških oskrbe"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:19
msgid ""
"To create a |per|, first navigate to :menuselection:`Purchase app --> "
"Reporting --> Purchase` to open the :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje |per| najprej pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija za nakup "
"--> Poročanje --> Nakup`, da odprete nadzorno plošČo :guilabel:`Analiza "
"nakupov`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:22
msgid ""
"By default, the dashboard displays a line chart overview of "
"the :guilabel:`Untaxed Total` of :guilabel:`Purchase Orders` (POs) with "
"a :guilabel:`Confirmation Date` for the current month, or of Requests for "
"Quotation (RFQs) with a status of *Draft*, *Sent*, or *Cancelled*."
msgstr ""
"Privzeto nadzorna plošČa prikazuje črtni grafikon "
"pregleda :guilabel:`Neobdavčenega zneska` :guilabel:`Naročilnic` (NO) "
"z :guilabel:`Datumom potrditve` za trenutni mesec ali zahtev za ponudbo (ZP) "
"s statusom *Osnutek*, *Poslano* ali *Preklicano*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:27
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/vendor_costs_report.rst:32
msgid "Add filters and groups"
msgstr "Dodajanje filtrov in skupin"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:29
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/vendor_costs_report.rst:34
msgid ""
"On the top-right, click the :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(pivot)` icon "
"to switch to pivot view."
msgstr ""
"Zgoraj desno kliknite ikono :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(pivot)`, da "
"preklopite na vrtilni pogled."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:32
msgid ""
"While the |per| can also be :ref:`viewed <purchase/view-results>` as "
"a :icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`(bar chart)`, :icon:`fa-line-"
"chart` :guilabel:`(line chart)`, or :icon:`fa-pie-chart` :guilabel:`(pie "
"chart)`, the pivot view provides the most detailed view of the data, and is "
"the recommended starting point."
msgstr ""
"Medtem ko je |per| mogoče :ref:`prikazati <purchase/view-results>` tudi "
"kot :icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`(stolpčni grafikon)`, :icon:`fa-line-"
"chart` :guilabel:`(črtni grafikon)` ali :icon:`fa-pie-"
"chart` :guilabel:`(tortni grafikon)`, vrtilni pogled zagotavlja najbolj "
"podroben pogled na podatke in je priporočena začetna točka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:37
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/vendor_costs_report.rst:36
msgid ""
"Remove any default filters from the :guilabel:`Search...` bar. Then, click "
"the |caret| to open the drop-down menu that contains "
"the :guilabel:`Filters`, :guilabel:`Group By`, and :guilabel:`Favorites` "
"columns."
msgstr ""
"Odstranite vse privzete filtre iz vrstice :guilabel:`Iskanje...`. Nato "
"kliknite |caret|, da odprete spustni meni, ki vsebuje "
"stolpce :guilabel:`Filtri`, :guilabel:`Združi po` "
"in :guilabel:`Priljubljene`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:42
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/vendor_costs_report.rst:41
msgid ""
"Unless otherwise specified, the report displays data from both |RFQs| and |"
"POs|. This can be changed by selecting either :guilabel:`Requests for "
"Quotation` or :guilabel:`Purchase Orders` under the :guilabel:`Filters` "
"column."
msgstr ""
"Če ni drugače navedeno, poročilo prikazuje podatke tako iz |RFQs| kot iz |"
"POs|. To lahko spremenite z izbiro :guilabel:`Zahteve za ponudbo` "
"ali :guilabel:`Naročilnice` v stolpcu :guilabel:`Filtri`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:46
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Filters` column, select a time frame to use for "
"comparison. The report can be filtered by either :guilabel:`Order Date` "
"or :guilabel:`Confirmation Date`. Choose one from the list, and click the |"
"caret| to specify the date range, either by month, quarter, or year."
msgstr ""
"V stolpcu :guilabel:`Filtri` izberite časovni okvir za primerjavo. Poročilo "
"lahko filtrirate po :guilabel:`Datumu naročila` ali :guilabel:`Datumu "
"potrditve`. Izberite enega s seznama in kliknite |caret|, da določite "
"časovno obdobje po mesecih, četrtletjih ali letih."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:50
msgid ""
"Next, under the :guilabel:`Group by` column, select :guilabel:`Vendor`. "
"Then, select :guilabel:`Product Category`, which is also located in "
"the :guilabel:`Group By` column."
msgstr ""
"Nato v stolpcu :guilabel:`Združi po` izberite :guilabel:`Dobavitelj`. Nato "
"izberite :guilabel:`Kategorija izdelka`, ki se prav tako nahaja v "
"stolpcu :guilabel:`Združi po`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:54
msgid ""
"The selections under the :guilabel:`Group By` heading can be altered, "
"depending on the needs of the individual company. For example, "
"selecting :guilabel:`Product`, instead of :guilabel:`Product Category`, "
"provides a more in depth look at the performance of specific items, in place "
"of an entire category."
msgstr ""
"Izbire v naslovu :guilabel:`Združi po` je mogoče spremeniti glede na potrebe "
"posameznega podjetja. Na primer, izbira :guilabel:`Izdelek` "
"namesto :guilabel:`Kategorija izdelka` zagotavlja bolj poglobljen vpogled v "
"uspešnost določenih artiklov namesto celotne kategorije."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:59
msgid ""
"Next, make a selection under the :guilabel:`Comparison` heading that "
"appears. These options are only available after the date range is selected "
"under the :guilabel:`Filters` column, and vary based on that "
"range. :guilabel:`Previous Period` adds a comparison to the previous period, "
"such as the last month or quarter. :guilabel:`Previous Year` compares the "
"same time period from the previous year."
msgstr ""
"Nato naredite izbiro pod naslovom :guilabel:`Primerjava`, ki se prikaže. Te "
"možnosti so na voljo šele po izbiri časovnega obdobja v "
"stolpcu :guilabel:`Filtri` in se razlikujejo glede na to "
"obdobje. :guilabel:`Prejšnje obdobje` doda primerjavo s prejšnjim obdobjem, "
"kot je prejšnji mesec ali četrtletje. :guilabel:`Prejšnje leto` primerja "
"isto časovno obdobje iz prejšnjega leta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:65
msgid ""
"While multiple time-based filters can be added at once, only one comparison "
"can be selected at a time."
msgstr ""
"Medtem ko je mogoče hkrati dodati več časovnih filtrov, je mogoče izbrati le "
"eno primerjavo naenkrat."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:68
msgid ""
"The drop-down menu of filters, group by and comparison options for the "
"procurement expenses\n"
"report."
msgstr ""
"Spustni meni filtrov, združevanja in možnosti primerjave za poročilo o "
"stroških oskrbe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:73
msgid ""
"The filter for Q2, comparison for **Previous Period**, and group-by for "
"**Vendor** and **Product Category** were selected."
msgstr ""
"Izbrani so bili filter za 2. četrtletje, primerjava za **Prejšnje obdobje** "
"ter združevanje za **Dobavitelj** in **Kategorija izdelka**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:77
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/vendor_costs_report.rst:64
msgid "Add measures"
msgstr "Dodajanje mer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:79
msgid ""
"After selecting the :guilabel:`Filters`, :guilabel:`Group by`, "
"and :guilabel:`Comparison` settings, click out of the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Po izbiri nastavitev :guilabel:`Filtri`, :guilabel:`Združi po` "
"in :guilabel:`Primerjava` kliknite izven spustnega menija."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:82
msgid ""
"By default, the report displays data with the following "
"measures: :guilabel:`Order`, :guilabel:`Total`, :guilabel:`Untaxed Total`, "
"and :guilabel:`Count`. Click :guilabel:`Measures` at the top-left to open "
"the drop-down list of available measures."
msgstr ""
"Privzeto poročilo prikazuje podatke z naslednjimi "
"merami: :guilabel:`Naročilo`, :guilabel:`Skupaj`, :guilabel:`Neobdavčeni "
"znesek` in :guilabel:`Število`. Kliknite :guilabel:`Mere` zgoraj levo, da "
"odprete spustni seznam razpoložljivih mer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:86
msgid ""
"Click the following specific measures to include additional columns for the "
"procurement expenses report:"
msgstr ""
"Kliknite naslednje določene mere, da vključite dodatne stolpce za poročilo o "
"stroških oskrbe:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Total` and :guilabel:`Untaxed Total`: can include one or both "
"measures. These are included for overall spending analysis."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Skupaj` in :guilabel:`Neobdavčeni znesek`: lahko vključite eno "
"ali obe meri. Ti sta vključeni za analizo celotne porabe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:91
msgid ":guilabel:`Average Cost`: included to evaluate cost efficiency."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Povprečni strošek`: vključen za oceno stroškovne učinkovitosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:92
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Days to Confirm` and :guilabel:`Days to Receive`: used to assess "
"supplier performance."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dni za potrditev` in :guilabel:`Dni za prejem`: uporabljeno za "
"oceno uspešnosti dobavitelja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Qty Ordered` and :guilabel:`Qty Received`: used to understand "
"order efficiency."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Naročena količina` in :guilabel:`Prejeta količina`: uporabljeno "
"za razumevanje učinkovitosti naročil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Qty Billed` and :guilabel:`Qty to be Billed`: used to track order "
"accuracy."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fakturirana količina` in :guilabel:`Količina za fakturiranje`: "
"uporabljeno za sledenje natančnosti naročil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:97
msgid ""
"Additional measures can be included in the report, if desired, to provide "
"additional insights. For example, :guilabel:`Gross Weight` "
"and :guilabel:`Volume` may be included for further logistics and management "
"analysis."
msgstr ""
"V poročilo je mogoče po želji vključiti dodatne mere za dodatne vpogled. Na "
"primer, :guilabel:`Bruto teža` in :guilabel:`Volumen` sta lahko vključena za "
"nadaljnjo logistično in upravljavsko analizo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:101
msgid ""
"After selecting all necessary measures, click out of the drop-down menu."
msgstr "Po izbiri vseh potrebnih mer kliknite zunaj spustnega menija."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:106
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/vendor_costs_report.rst:81
msgid "View results"
msgstr "Ogled rezultatov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:108
msgid ""
"After all of the filters and measures have been selected, the report "
"generates in the selected view."
msgstr ""
"Ko so izbrani vsi filtri in mere, se poročilo ustvari v izbranem pogledu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:110
msgid "A sample version of the procurement expenses report."
msgstr "Vzorčna različica poročila o stroških oskrbe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:114
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Insert in Spreadsheet` to add the pivot view into an "
"editable spreadsheet format within the *Documents* app."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Vstavi v preglednico`, da dodate vrtilni pogled v "
"urejevalni format preglednice v aplikaciji *Dokumenti*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:118
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Insert in Spreadsheet` option is **only** available if the "
"*Documents Spreadsheet* module is installed."
msgstr ""
"Možnost :guilabel:`Vstavi v preglednico` je na voljo **samo**, če je "
"nameščen modul *Documents Spreadsheet*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:122
msgid ""
"The |per| is also available in graph view. Click the :icon:`fa-area-"
"chart` :guilabel:`(area chart)` icon to change to graph view. Click the "
"corresponding icon at the top of the report to switch to a :icon:`fa-bar-"
"chart` :guilabel:`(bar chart)`, :icon:`fa-line-chart` :guilabel:`(line "
"chart)`, or :icon:`fa-pie-chart` :guilabel:`(pie chart)`."
msgstr ""
"|per| je na voljo tudi v grafičnem pogledu. Kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-area-"
"chart` :guilabel:`(ploščni grafikon)`, da preklopite na grafični pogled. "
"Kliknite ustrezno ikono na vrhu poročila, da preklopite na :icon:`fa-bar-"
"chart` :guilabel:`(stolpčni grafikon)`, :icon:`fa-line-"
"chart` :guilabel:`(črtni grafikon)` ali :icon:`fa-pie-"
"chart` :guilabel:`(tortni grafikon)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:128
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/vendor_costs_report.rst:102
msgid "To save this report as a *favorite*, see :ref:`search/favorites`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite to poročilo shraniti kot *priljubljeno*, glejte :ref:`search/"
"favorites`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/purchase_dashboard.rst:3
msgid "Purchase & Vendor analysis dashboard"
msgstr "Nadzorna plošča za analizo nabave in dobaviteljev"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/purchase_dashboard.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *Purchase & Vendor analysis* dashboard, available in the :doc:`Odoo "
"Dashboards <../../../productivity/dashboards>` app, offers various metrics "
"to evaluate purchasing performance and vendor reliability."
msgstr ""
"Nadzorna plošča *Analiza nakupov in dobaviteljev*, na voljo v "
"aplikaciji :doc:`Nadzorne plošče Odoo <../../../productivity/dashboards>`, "
"ponuja različne metrike za ocenjevanje uspešnosti nabave in zanesljivosti "
"dobaviteljev."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/purchase_dashboard.rst:9
msgid ""
"The dashboard tracks financial data like total and average purchase amounts "
"and the number of purchase orders. It also provides KPIs for supplier "
"performance, such as the average time to receive products and the percentage "
"of quantities received on time. This makes it possible to rank vendors and "
"optimize procurement strategy accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Nadzorna plošča spremlja finančne podatke, kot so skupni in povprečni zneski "
"nakupov ter število naročil. Zagotavlja tudi kazalnike uspešnosti za "
"učinkovitost dobaviteljev, kot so povprečni čas za prejem izdelkov in "
"odstotek količin, prejetih pravočasno. To omogoča razvrščanje dobaviteljev "
"in ustrezno optimizacijo strategije oskrbe."

